ually support intra-team communication and the specific constraints the user described. The team tools likely use worktree isolation.\n\nLet me think about what each team would actually do:\n\nTeam A (dsx-types + dsx-proto): \n- Define core types (SafetyLevel, Message, ToolCall, TaskPhase, etc.)\n- Define IPC message protocol between processes\n- This is the foundation that other teams depend on\n\nTeam B (dsx-hp):\n- Health monitoring daemon\n- API proxy gateway\n- Liveness, sentinel, circuit breaker, gate\n\nTeam C (dsx-agent):\n- Agent core logic\n- Orchestrator, memory, session, context, conversation\n- Router, tokenizer, prompt, skills\n\nTeam D (dsx-tools):\n- Tool server with sandbox\n- All 12 tools with 2-level menu structure\n\nTeam E (dsx-tui):\n- Terminal UI with ratatui\n- All render/input components\n\nThe challenge is that Team A needs to finish first since other teams depend on their types/protocol. So I need to sequence this properly.\n\nLet me enter plan mode and create the detailed plan.\n\nActually, I realize I need to be practical here. Creating 15 isolated teammates with worktree isolation and managing inter-team communication constraints is complex. Let me first enter plan mode, create the plan, and then we can execute.\n\nLet me use EnterPlanMode.","signature":"395f46f3-21c1-4e3c-b648-e27ab8159df8"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":278,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":84736,"output_tokens":813,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"6b8ab58c-eca8-481a-a21a-3b5c42250f0a","timestamp":"2026-05-14T13:37:34.156Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141