ce)\n\nNow let me think about the actual work each team member would do. Given that we're in the refactoring phase (files already classified), each member needs to:\n\n1. Read their assigned files\n2. Understand the existing implementation\n3. Design the module's public API / interface\n4. Write the module's `Cargo.toml` dependencies\n5. Implement the module with proper error handling, IPC integration points\n6. Write tests\n7. Report back to Lead\n\nBut wait - we're still in plan mode and I can't write code. The user wants me to create the plan first, then distribute tasks. Let me write the plan.\n\nActually, I realize I need to understand the team features better. Let me check what tools are available for team management:\n- TeamCreate\n- TaskCreate  \n- SendMessage\n\nLet me create the plan file now.","signature":"17d7dce9-73b1-4281-b519-c51bd64adf75"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1200,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":85760,"output_tokens":2774,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"55c77f99-0e9b-4bd9-a0c0-3b078e7d661f","timestamp":"2026-05-14T13:37:56.631Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"55c77f99-0e9b-4bd9-a0c0-3b078e7d661f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"17d7dce9-73b1-4281-b519-c51bd64adf75","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_00_5SKCbDnpBOMZ5eulRUEv4290","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/qaqtamsy/.claude/plans/gentle-orbiting-karp.md","content":"# DSX Multi-Team Collaboration Plan\n\n## Context\n\nDSX 已从单体 binary 拆分为 7 crate（5 binary + 2 shared lib），80 个原子文件已按模块分类到位。现在需要 5 支 Team（A-E）并行完成各 crate 的接口设计、模块实现和集成测试。\n\nLead（Claude Opus）负责：制定 task → 点对点分发 → 收集报告 → 汇总分析 → 等待 User 解散指令。\n\n## Team 映射\n\n| Team | Crate | 职责 | 文件 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **Team A** | dsx-types + dsx-proto | 核心类型 + IPC 消息协议 | 1 (+ 新建 proto) |\n| **Team B** | dsx-hp | 健康守护进程 + API 代理网关 | 15 |\n| **Team C** | dsx-agent | Agent 核心（无界面） | 32 |\n| **Team D** | dsx-tools | 工具执行服务器（沙箱） | 13 |\n| **Team E** | dsx-tui | 终端界面（ratatui） | 19 |\n\n## 通信规则\n\n```\n                    ┌──────────┐\n                    │   LEAD   │\n                    │ (Claude) │\n                    └────┬─────┘\n           ┌─────────────┼─────────────┐\n    p2p     │        p2p  │  p2p         │  p2p\n     ▼      ▼         ▼   ▼   ▼          ▼   ▼\n  ┌──────┐ ┌──────┐ ┌──────┐ ┌──────┐ ┌──────┐\n  │Team A│ │Team B│ │Team C│ │Team D│ │Team E│\n  │01 02 │ │01 02 │ │01 02 │ │01 02 │ │01 02 │\n  │  03  │ │  03  │ │  03  │ │  03  │ │  03  │\n  └──────┘ └──────┘ └──────┘ └──────┘ └──────┘\n     ↑          ↑          ↑          ↑          ↑\n     └──────────┴──────────┴──────────┴──────────┘\n              Team 间禁止通信\n```\n\n- **Team 内**：01/02/03 可互相通信协作\n- **Team 间**：严格隔离，禁止通信\n- **Lead → Member**：点对点分发 task，不允许广播\n- **Member → Lead**：完成任务后点对点报告\n- **解散**：仅 User 有权限命令解散\n\n## Team 成员分工\n\n### Team A — dsx-types + dsx-proto（基础层，优先完成）\n\n| 成员 | 分工 | 关键文件 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **A01** | 核心类型定义 | `src/dsx-types/mod.rs`：SafetyLevel, Message, ToolCall, TaskPhase, AgentPhase, DebugLevel, PersistentConfig, SessionFile |\n| **A02** | IPC 消息协议 | `src/dsx-proto/`：定义全部跨进程消息枚举（Agent→HP、Agent→Tools、HP→Agent、Tools→Agent、TUI→Agent） |\n| **A03** | 共享工具函数 | token 计数接口、序列化/反序列化辅助、错误类型定义 |\n\n### Team B — dsx-hp（健康守护 + API 网关）\n\n| 成员 | 分工 | 关键文件 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **B01** | 守护核心 | `mod.rs`, `liveness.rs`, `platform.rs`, `monitor.rs`：进程注册、心跳检测、崩溃重启、健康平台 |\n| **B02** | API 代理网关 | `client.rs`, `converter.rs`, `sentinel.rs`, `gate.rs`：API 转发、消息格式转换、错误哨兵、预检门 |\n| **B03** | 熔断 + 质量 | `circuit_breaker.rs`, `quality.rs`, `emotion.rs`, `assessment.rs`, `audit.rs`, `checks.rs`, `report.rs` |\n\n### Team C — dsx-agent（Agent 核心）\n\n| 成员 | 分工 | 关键文件 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **C01** | 编排引擎 | `orchestrator/`（12 文件）：agent_loop, stream_handler, response_processor, tool_dispatch, context_compactor, gates, learning, tracker, turn_scorer, session_persistence |\n| **C02** | 上下文 + 记忆 | `context.rs`, `conversation.rs`, `memory/`（5 文件）：ContextBuilder, ContextAssembler, 长/短/语义/陷阱记忆 |\n| **C03** | 会话 + 路由 + 技能 | `session/`（7 文件）, `router.rs`, `tokenizer.rs`, `prompt.rs`, `skills.rs`, `config.rs`, `dsc_log.rs` |\n\n### Team D — dsx-tools（工具服务器）\n\n| 成员 | 分工 | 关键文件 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **D01** | 工具框架 + 系统工具 | `mod.rs`（ToolManager）, `exec.rs`, `explore.rs`, `git.rs`, `web.rs` |\n| **D02** | 文件 + 元数据工具 | `file.rs`, `meta.rs`, `agent.rs`：文件读写编辑搜索、技能/文件元数据、统一 agent 分发 |\n| **D03** | 任务/计划/记忆工具 | `task.rs`, `plan.rs`, `memory.rs`, `ask.rs`, `status.rs` |\n\n### Team E — dsx-tui（终端界面）\n\n| 成员 | 分工 | 关键文件 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **E01** | 应用核心 | `main.rs`, `mod.rs`, `app.rs`, `commands.rs`, `mode.rs`：事件循环、状态管理、斜杠命令、模式切换 |\n| **E02** | 输入处理 | `input/`（5 文件）, `utils.rs`, `tui_text.rs`：聊天输入、确认/选择器/sudo 模式 |\n| **E03** | 渲染引擎 | `render/`（7 文件）：聊天面板、输入框、弹窗、状态栏、工具预览、工作区面板 |\n\n## Task 执行流程\n\n```\nPhase 0: Lead 创建 5 Team + 15 Member（TeamCreate）\nPhase 1: Lead 点对点发送 task 给 A01-A03（Team A 优先）\n         → A 完成后各成员报告 Lead\nPhase 2: Lead 发送 task 给 B01-B03, C01-C03（B/C 并行）\n         → B/C 完成后各成员报告 Lead\nPhase 3: Lead 发送 task 给 D01-D03, E01-E03（D/E 并行）\n         → D/E 完成后各成员报告 Lead\nPhase 4: Lead 收集全部 15 份报告，汇总分析\nPhase 5: Lead 向 User 呈报分析结果\nPhase 6: 等待 User 命令解散\n```\n\n### 依赖关系\n\n```\nTeam A (types + proto)\n    │\n    ├──► Team B (hp) ── 可并行 ──►\n    │         │\n    ├──► Team C (agent) ─────────► Team D (tools)\n    │         │                         │\n    └──► Team E (tui) ◄─────────────────┘\n                                       (tui 通过 IPC 调 tools)\n```\n\n- A 是所有 crate 的依赖，必须最先完成\n- B 和 C 可并行（B 依赖 A 的 types，C 也依赖 A 的 types）\n- D 依赖 C 的 IPC 协议（tools 被 agent 调用）\n- E 依赖 A 的 types，可较早启动但完整集成需等 C/D\n\n## 每个 Member 的 Task 模板\n\n```\nTask: [模块名] 接口设计与实现\nContext: [所在 crate 的职责]\nInput: [分配给该成员的文件列表]\nRequirements:\n  1. 阅读全部分配文件，理解现有实现\n  2. 设计模块的 pub API（trait / struct / enum / fn 签名）\n  3. 定义与其他 crate 的 IPC 交互点（使用 Team A 定义的 proto）\n  4. 编写 Cargo.toml 依赖\n  5. 标注哪些现有代码可复用、哪些需重写/删除\n  6. 输出模块设计文档（Markdown）\nDeliverable: 1 份 Markdown 设计文档\n```\n\n## 通信协议\n\n- Lead → Member：`SendMessage(to=member, content=task)`\n- Member → Lead：成员完成后通过 `SendMessage(to=lead, content=report)` 报告\n- Team 内协作：成员间 `SendMessage(to=same_team_member, content=...)`\n- 解散：`TeamDelete(name)` — 仅 User 命令触发\n\n## 验证方式\n\n1. 每个 Team 完成时，Lead 检查成员报告完整性\n2. Lead 汇总分析后，对照 `explore.md` 确认无遗漏\n3. 最终由 User 审核各模块设计文档\n4. User 批准后执行 `TeamDelete` 逐一解散\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1200,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":85760,"output_tokens":2774,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"ecd2f278-c375-4efa-9e4e-65bef6113ca7","timestamp":"2026-05-14T13:38:58.588Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
