{"parentUuid":"26db876a-a75e-4b04-bb10-e1adfead749c","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","promptId":"8ce34dfc-71d1-42c1-92d0-b1482fc67de3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"<teammate-message teammate_id=\"C03\" color=\"blue\" summary=\"C03 design document completed at src/dsx-agent/DESIGN-C03.md covering session, router, tokenizer, prompt, skills, config, and log modules with integration points to C01, C02, and A03.\">\nTeam C member C03 design complete.\n\nSession + Router + Skills subsystem design document written at `src/dsx-agent/DESIGN-C03.md`.\n\nKey deliverables:\n- **Session layer**: persistence, index, restore, snapshot, plan_io all remain in-process (no cross-process RPC). Extracted `SessionPersistence` trait for testability. memory_io is the shared interface with C02.\n- **Router**: atomic encoding (TaskPhase + DebugLevel in AtomicU8) preserved. Routing table and phase prompt suffixes stay in router.rs (tied to phase semantics). PhaseConfig consumed by C01's agent_loop.\n- **Tokenizer**: will expose a `TokenCounter` trait (aligned with A03). `DeepSeekTokenizer` with heuristic fallback. `TokenBreakdown` for C02 context builder.\n- **Skills**: directory-based discovery with YAML-free frontmatter. Global OnceLock singleton. Keyword-scoring matching.\n- **Config/Log**: infrastructure unchanged. Config with profile system + env var override chain.\n\nKey integration points documented:\n- C03 to C01: phase_config, phase_prompt_suffix, session save/load/snapshot, skills injection\n- C03 to C02: memory_io contract (shared file paths and formats), recommends C02 wrap in MemoryStore\n- C03 to A03: TokenCounter trait alignment\n\nOpen questions for team-lead to coordinate:\n1. Confirm C02's memory_io interface boundary (Section 5 of the design doc)\n2. Request A03's TokenCount trait signature\n3. Confirm whether PhaseConfig should remain a struct or become a trait in dsx-types\n</teammate-message>"},"uuid":"1a7d3301-c875-44a6-8f16-a8189b7ad13b","tim