uilder.build()\n50\t  ├─ System prompt (固定)\n51\t  ├─ SemanticMemory.render() (文件知识)\n52\t  ├─ LongTermMemory.render_backbone_compact() (项目骨架)\n53\t  └─ compact_context(对话历史) (压缩后轮次)\n54\t```\n55\t\n56\t---\n57\t\n58\t## 2. ContextBuilder — 4 层渐进式组装\n59\t\n60\t### 2.1 层顺序"}]},"uuid":"274d5f96-6e6f-4f08-aa8f-1ec1eb048942","timestamp":"2026-05-14T13:52:17.725Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/src/dsx-agent/context-memory-design.md","content":"# DSX Agent: 上下文构建与分层记忆子系统设计\n\n**Team C / C02** — 上下文构建 + 分层记忆\n**依赖关系**: 本设计同时回应 A01 发现的循环引用问题\n\n---\n\n## 1. 系统总览\n\ndsx-agent 的上下文+记忆子系统由三个核心组件构成：\n\n```\n记忆子系统 (memory/)                   上下文构建 (context.rs)\n  ┌──────────────┐                    ┌────────────────────┐\n  │ Semantic     │ ──render()──▶     │ ContextBuilder     │ 4层组装\n  │ LongTerm     │ ──render()──▶     │   System           │ ← 不变\n  │ ShortTerm    │ ──render()──▶     │   Semantic         │ ← 文件知识\n  │ PitfallGuide │ ──render()──▶     │   Backbone(LTM)    │ ← 项目骨架\n  └──────┬───────┘                    │   Episodic(对话)   │ ← 压缩后历史\n         │                            └────────┬───────────┘\n         │ 持久化接口                            │\n         ▼                                      ▼\n  ┌────────────────┐                  ┌────────────────────┐\n  │ session/       │                  │ ContextAssembler   │\n  │ memory_io.rs   │                  │ Turn+Step 模型     │\n  │ (C03 共享边界)  │                  │ 类型级交替保证     │\n  └────────────────┘                  └────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### 1.1 数据流\n\n```\n用户输入\n  │\n  ▼\nContextAssembler.push_user() ──▶ Turn 新增\n  │\n  ▼\nAPI 调用 ──▶ assistant 响应 ──▶ ContextAssembler.push_assistant()\n  │                                      │\n  ▼                                      ▼\nTool 执行 ──▶ ContextAssembler.push_tool_result()\n  │\n  ▼  (KnowledgeExtractor 从工具结果中提取知识)\nSemanticMemory.upsert() ──▶ 持久化至 semantic-mem.json\nLongTermMemory.sync_from_semantic() ──▶ 持久化至 long-mem.md\n\n下一次 API 调用:\nContextBuilder.build()\n  ├─ System prompt (固定)\n  ├─ SemanticMemory.render() (文件知识)\n  ├─ LongTermMemory.render_backbone_compact() (项目骨架)\n  └─ compact_context(对话历史) (压缩后轮次)\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2. ContextBuilder — 4 层渐进式组装\n\n### 2.1 层顺序","numLines":60,"startLine":1,"totalLines":535}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1187f63e-21da-457a-aef1-1e69b1da41a5","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
