{"parentUuid":"84bea682-d6c5-48fc-91c5-7bb75b1736ea","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","message":{"id":"63a5d110-087d-4808-9cda-a68e8a6d83fe","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_08_79uf3kOPig3NPAFIRcTq1526","name":"SendMessage","input":{"to":"B03","message":"## 辩论任务：代表 Team B 与 C03、E03 辩论\n\n你是 Team B 的辩论代表。\n\n### 任务\n1. 接收 B01 和 B02 的立场要点\n2. 整合为 Team B 的统一立场\n3. 主动联系 C03 和 E03，就以下议题组织辩论：\n\n**议题清单：**\n- ① client/converter 归属（B01 vs B02 内部争议，你需要给出 Team B 最终立场）\n- ② gate 职责分界：HP hp_gate() vs Agent policy gate\n- ③ check_alternation 重复：谁拥有权威实现（HP audit 还是 Agent session）\n- ④ tool loop limits：HP circuit_breaker 统一负责还是 Agent 保留\n- ⑤ DsAgentsHealthPlatform 上帝对象拆分方案\n- ⑥ TUI 如何展示 HP gate 拦截和流式错误\n\nC03 和 E03 已收到辩论通知。开始吧。","summary":"委任 B03 为辩论代表，组织跨 Team 辩论","type":"message","recipient":"B03","content":"## 辩论任务：代表 Team B 与 C03、E03 辩论\n\n你是 Team B 的辩论代表。\n\n### 任务\n1. 接收 B01 和 B02 的立场要点\n2. 整合为 Team B 的统一立场\n3. 主动联系 C03 和 E03，就以下议题组织辩论：\n\n**议题清单：**\n- ① client/converter 归属（B01 vs B02 内部争议，你需要给出 Team B 最终立场）\n- ② gate 职责分界：HP hp_gate() vs Agent policy gate\n- ③ check_alternation 重复：谁拥有权威实现（HP audit 还是 Agent session）\n- ④ tool loop limits：HP circuit_breaker 统一负责还是 Agent 保留\n- ⑤ DsAgentsHealthPlatform 上帝对象拆分方案\n- ⑥ TUI 如何展示 HP gate 拦截和流式错误\n\nC03 和 E03 已收到辩论通知。开始吧。"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":320,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":135296,"output_tokens":2872,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"b017d769-9e77-43de-9d33-1a7c4834c245","timestamp":"2026-05-14T13:59:18.799Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version