{"parentUuid":"2b97aed3-d60d-457a-91c7-13a2d4e3c2fe","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","message":{"id":"c9e68de5-ec75-4bf2-9b44-27a6a2d45104","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good progress. Let me summarize what's happening:\n\n1. C01 has submitted a comprehensive position paper on all 4 debate points - very thorough analysis supporting B02 on most points\n2. E01 says the HP debate has zero impact on TUI - correct analysis\n3. B01 has sent their position to B03\n4. C02 and E02 have gone idle (no additional input)\n\nNow we're waiting for:\n- B02 to send their position to B03\n- B03 to receive both positions and start the debate with C03 and E03\n\nLet me wait for B03 to initiate the debate.","signature":"c9e68de5-ec75-4bf2-9b44-27a6a2d45104"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10286,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":135552,"output_tokens":223,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"a0df0ea7-cc27-4d45-bbac-bec9efca8aab","timestamp":"2026-05-14T13:59:35.000Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"160c00b2-4a1d-409b-bac1-045310a1be47","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","promptId":"f329bb2a-49e9-4400-84e5-dcb31e6e6f4c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"<teammate-message teammate_id=\"B02\" color=\"orange\">\n{\"type\":\"idle_notification\",\"from\":\"B02\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-14T13:59:30.385Z\",\"idleReason\":\"available\",\"summary\":\"[to B03] B02 设计立场要点给 B03，供辩论使用\"}\n</teammate-message>\n\n<teammate-message teammate_id=\"C03\" color=\"blue\" summary=\"C03 prepared for debate on all four topics\">\nC03 prepared for debate. Read all B-team files including gate.rs, audit.rs, client.rs, sentinel.rs, checks.rs, and platform.rs. Here are my initial positions on the four topics:\n\n1. **gate 职责分界**: Two distinct gate types exist — (a) pre-API structural validation in HP's gate.rs (validates ContextAssembler before sending), (b) per-tool eligibility gates in orchestrator/gates.rs (phase_check, explore_gate). These don't overlap. My router is orthogonal: it just exposes `read_phase()` for phase_check_tool. I'll argue for keeping the split clean rather than consolidating.\n\n2. **check_alternation**: There are 3+ implementations of essentially the same flat scan (gate.rs, checks.rs, audit.rs). The canonical implementation should be ContextAssembler::validate() — it's the single source of truth for message structure. HP's flat scans are legacy pre-assembler code. I'll argue for consolidation, not duplication.\n\n3. **API 错误反馈路径**: client.rs sends errors via StreamEvent channel → C01/TUI consume. My config provides api_key/base_url. My log system receives the error logs. My session layer saves pre-API snapshots for crash recovery. Integration point is clean: HP emits, C03 logs/persists.\n\n4. **PhaseConfig 归属**: PhaseConfig struct should remain in dsx-agent because it contains hardcoded model names and routing policy specific to this agent. If types wants an interface, extract a Router trait into dsx-types, keep the concrete impl in agent. Happy to debate this.\n\nWaiting for B03.\n</teammate-message>"},"uuid":"a2eaeeb5-90cf-4a6d-a366-eeae38792eed","timestamp":"2026-05-14T13:59:37.918Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
