tive\n223\t   same-role messages may cause API errors.\n224\t\n225\tViolating any of these causes `400 Bad Request` with message:\n226\t`\"The content[].thinking in the thinking mode must be passed back to the API.\"`\n227\t\n228\t## 5. Internal (NOT frozen — may change any release)\n229\t\n230\tThese are implementation details, not part of the public ABI:\n231\t\n232\t- `tui.rs` — all rendering functions, App fields, Mode enum\n233\t- `context.rs` — ContextBuilder, compact_context(), L1-L4 internals\n234\t- `cli_ui.rs` — CLI mode rendering\n235\t- `main.rs` — CLI argument parsing (clap derives)\n236\t- System prompt text content (evolves with model capabilities)\n237\t- Session auto-snapshot interval, token thresholds\n238\t"}]},"uuid":"e8b6b81d-7f0c-4cda-9882-815aefd5e4da","timestamp":"2026-05-14T14:10:14.240Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/docs/STABILITY.md","content":"# Stability Contract — v0.40.1-beta\n\nThis document declares the public interfaces that are **frozen as of v0.40.0**.\nAny breaking change to these MUST bump the version (0.40 → 0.41).\n\n## 1. Public Crate API (`pub` items callable by external code)\n\n### `src/types.rs`\n\n| Symbol | Kind | Stability |\n|--------|------|-----------|\n| `Message` | struct (Serialize/Deserialize) | **Frozen** — session file format depends on it. `thinking_signature: Option<String>` MUST be preserved and passed back for Anthropic API compliance. |\n| `Message::system()` | constructor | **Frozen** |\n| `Message::user()` | constructor | **Frozen** |\n| `Message::tool()` | constructor | **Frozen** |\n| `ToolCall` | struct | **Frozen** |\n| `FunctionCall` | struct | **Frozen** |\n| `ToolDef` | struct | **Frozen** |\n| `ToolFunction` | struct | **Frozen** |\n| `SafetyLevel` | enum | **Frozen** |\n| `SessionFile` | struct (Serialize) | **Frozen** — crash recovery format |\n| `SessionMeta` | struct | **Frozen** |\n| `StreamState` | struct | **Frozen** |\n| `UsageInfo` | struct |