ing functions, App fields, Mode enum\n- `context.rs` — ContextBuilder, compact_context(), L1-L4 internals\n- `cli_ui.rs` — CLI mode rendering\n- `main.rs` — CLI argument parsing (clap derives)\n- System prompt text content (evolves with model capabilities)\n- Session auto-snapshot interval, token thresholds\n","numLines":238,"startLine":1,"totalLines":238}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"b10138b7-343c-41ae-9482-6edb200009c2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
