{"parentUuid":"4bd5d69b-08ca-45e7-ab78-888f6b314ac4","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","promptId":"9d74668c-3e37-4fcd-b03d-ee1c5ae0fb2d","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_00_5gJjAWo8UMEEgOE9jv8e2205","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# dsc Architecture (v0.40.1-beta)\n2\t\n3\t## Source Layout\n4\t\n5\t```\n6\tsrc/\n7\t├── main.rs           (80L)  – entry point, CLI arg parsing\n8\t├── api.rs            (300L) – SSE streaming, Anthropic request marshalling\n9\t├── config.rs         (330L) – Config, profiles, system prompt, is_command\n10\t├── context.rs        (470L) – ContextBuilder, compact_context (L1-L4), atomic entries\n11\t├── health.rs         (680L) – DsAgentsHealthPlatform, emotion, tier, health tool\n12\t├── memory.rs         (810L) – SemanticMemory, LongTerm, ShortTerm, PitfallGuide\n13\t├── session.rs        (520L) – session I/O, memory persistence, pitfalls I/O\n14\t├── types.rs          (650L) – Message, ToolDef, Anthropic types\n15\t├── router.rs         (200L) – phase routing and auto-mode\n16\t├── skills.rs         (310L) – skill scanning and matching\n17\t├── dsc_log.rs        (50L)  – logging configuration\n18\t│\n19\t├── tools/\n20\t│   ├── mod.rs        (300L) – ToolManager singleton, 31 tool registration\n21\t│   ├── exec.rs       (280L) – async exec with streaming, sudo pipe\n22\t│   ├── file.rs       (330L) – read_file, write_file, edit_file, list_dir, search\n23\t│   ├── git.rs        (100L) – git status, diff, log, commit\n24\t│   ├── memory.rs     (140L) – mem_save, mem_read, mem_forget\n25\t│   ├── meta.rs       (200L) – status, ask_user, explore, list_skills, read_skill_ref\n26\t│   ├── plan_task.rs  (520L) – plan_*, task_*, glance, pitfall_*\n27\t│   └── web.rs        (240L) – web_fetch, web_search, context7_*\n28\t│\n29\t└── tui/\n30\t    ├── mod.rs        (320L) – entry point, main event loop, Mode enum\n31\t    ├── app.rs        (1350L)– App state, agent loop, auto_extract, safety gates\n32\t    ├── input.rs      (550L) – key handlers per mode (Chat, Confirm, Danger, etc.)\n33\t    ├── render.rs     (1400L)– 4-quadrant layout, info panel, popups, heading renderer\n34\t    └── utils.rs      (180L) – helpers (char_boundary, etc.)\n35\t```\n36\t\n37\t## Data Flow\n38\t\n39\t```\n40\tUser Input → App.run_app() → prepare_and_compact() → API Request\n41\t                │                     │\n42\t                │                     ├─ ContextBuilder::build()\n43\t                │                     │  ├─ L1-L4 compaction (compact_context)\n44\t                │                     │  ├─ Inject: SemanticMemory\n45\t                │                     │  ├─ Inject: Project Backbone\n46\t                │                     │  ├─ Inject: Plan\n47\t                │                     │  ├─ Inject: Short-Term Memory\n48\t                │                     │  ├─ Inject: Tasks\n49\t                │                     │  └─ Inject: Pitfall Guide\n50\t                │                     │\n51\t                │                     └─ API call (DeepSeek SSE stream)\n52\t                │\n53\t                ▼\n54\t          Stream Events → handle_stream_event()\n55\t                │\n56\t                ├─ Tool calls → exec → tool results\n57\t                ├─ Text → stream_content / stream_reasoning\n58\t                ├─ ExecProgress → bottom-left terminal panel\n59\t                └─ Done → finalize_stream_response()\n60\t                            └─ auto_extract_memory()\n61\t                               ├─ health.assess() → Assessment { level, emotion, interrupt }\n62\t                               ├─ Pitfall extraction (scan AI response for lessons)\n63\t                               ├─ short_mem.append_round()\n64\t                               └─ Write memory files to disk\n65\t```\n66\t\n67\t## Layer Architecture (ContextBuilder::build())\n68\t\n69\t| Layer | Name | Content | Token Budget |\n70\t|-------|------|---------|-------------|\n71\t| 0 | System | system_prompt(lang) | ~3K |\n72\t| 1 | Semantic | SemanticMemory::render() | ~4K |\n73\t| 2L | Backbone | LongTermMemory::render() or render_backbone_compact() | ~1K |\n74\t| 2P | Plan | Active plan read from ~/.config/dsc/plans/ | ~500 |\n75\t| 2S | Short-Term | ShortTermMemory::render() | ~500 |\n76\t| 2T | Tasks | tasks-mem.md | ~200 |\n77\t| 2F | Pitfalls | PitfallGuide::render(5) | ~300 |\n78\t| 3 | Episodic | Messages after L1-L4 compaction | Variable |\n79\t\n80\tCompact backbone (render_backbone_compact) activates when context enters Danger tier (>400K or >80%).\n81\t\n82\t## Health Platform\n83\t\n84\t`DsAgentsHealthPlatform` in `src/health.rs` consolidates:\n85\t\n86\t| Domain | Signals |\n87\t|--------|---------|\n88\t| Context | context_tokens, context_limit, context_pressure, context_tier (Premium/Healthy/Danger) |\n89\t| Tool Chain | tool_failures_this_turn, consecutive_failures, tool_loop_count, consecutive_tool_only_turns |\n90\t| Error Ledger | recent_errors (VecDeque<HealthError>), error_counts (HashMap<ErrorKind, u32>) |\n91\t| Emotion | AgentEmotion (Flow, Calm, Anxious, Frustrated, Confused, Panic) |\n92\t| API | api_retries, api_errors, transport_errors, empty_responses |\n93\t| Exec | exec_pending, exec_timeouts, sudo_failures |\n94\t\n95\tAfter each turn: `assess()` returns `Assessment { level: Green/Yellow/Red, emotion, advice, interrupt }`.\n96\tHealth interrupt injected as system message when Yellow/Red. Caring prompt when ≥2 consecutive failures.\n97\t\n98\t## Three-Tier Memory\n99\t\n100\t| Tier | Context Range | Strategy |\n101\t|------|-------------|----------|\n102\t| Premium | 0–128K | Full fidelity — active files, current turn, recent 5-8 rounds |\n103\t| Healthy | 128K–400K | Atomic F:/E: entries — each line self-contained for CSA sparse selection |\n104\t| Danger | 400K+ | Compact backbone only — module map + critical invariants |\n105\t\n106\tAuto-triggers: compact backbone injection at Danger tier; health tool shows current tier.\n107\tCSA (Compressed Sparse Attention) top-k selection at 400K+ can only see ~0.5% of older entries — atomic format ensures any selected line carries full information.\n108\t\n109\t## 31 Tools\n110\t\n111\t| Category | Tools |\n112\t|----------|-------|\n113\t| Files | read_file, write_file, edit_file, list_dir, glance |\n114\t| Search | search, explore |\n115\t| Git | git_status, git_diff, git_log, git_commit |\n116\t| Exec | exec |\n117\t| Web | web_fetch, web_search, context7_resolve, context7_query |\n118\t| Memory | mem_save, mem_read, mem_forget |\n119\t| Planning | plan_create, plan_update, plan_read, plan_list |\n120\t| Tasks | task_create, task_update, task_list |\n121\t| Health | health, pitfall_save, pitfall_guide |\n122\t| Meta | status, ask_user, list_skills, read_skill_ref |\n123\t\n124\tAll tools registered in `ToolManager::new()`, sent as Anthropic function definitions in the API `tools[]` array.\n125\t\n126\t## Key Invariants\n127\t\n128\t- tool_use/tool_result MUST be adjacent in messages vec (API 400 if interleaved)\n129\t- Sudo password via stdin pipe, NEVER in command string\n130\t- exec_pending gates agent loop to prevent double-request race\n131\t- Thinking blocks (with signatures) must be preserved across requests\n132\t- Health report Mutex protects cross-tool access (health tool reads from static)\n133\t\n134\t## TUI Modes\n135\t\n136\t| Mode | Description |\n137\t|------|-------------|\n138\t| Chat | Idle, waiting for user input |\n139\t| Streaming | Agent loop active, receiving SSE stream |\n140\t| ToolConfirm | Tool requires user confirmation (Y/N) |\n141\t| DangerPrompt | Dangerous command warning |\n142\t| SudoPrompt | Sudo password required |\n143\t| ApiConfig | API key not configured |\n144\t| SessionPicker | Choosing a session to resume |\n145\t| IntentPicker | Slash command submenu |\n146\t"}]},"uuid":"41868bf6-33b8-4159-a73b-d855e50079be","timestamp":"2026-05-14T14:10:21.316Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"t