 → API Request\n                │                     │\n                │                     ├─ ContextBuilder::build()\n                │                     │  ├─ L1-L4 compaction (compact_context)\n                │                     │  ├─ Inject: SemanticMemory\n                │                     │  ├─ Inject: Project Backbone\n                │                     │  ├─ Inject: Plan\n                │                     │  ├─ Inject: Short-Term Memory\n                │                     │  ├─ Inject: Tasks\n                │                     │  └─ Inject: Pitfall Guide\n                │                     │\n                │                     └─ API call (DeepSeek SSE stream)\n                │\n                ▼\n          Stream Events → handle_stream_event()\n                │\n                ├─ Tool calls → exec → tool results\n                ├─ Text → stream_content / stream_reasoning\n                ├─ ExecProgress → bottom-left terminal panel\n                └─ Done → finalize_stream_response()\n                            └─ auto_extract_memory()\n                               ├─ health.assess() → Assessment { level, emotion, interrupt }\n                               ├─ Pitfall extraction (scan AI response for lessons)\n                               ├─ short_mem.append_round()\n                               └─ Write memory files to disk\n```\n\n## Layer Architecture (ContextBuilder::build())\n\n| Layer | Name | Content | Token Budget |\n|-------|------|---------|-------------|\n| 0 | System | system_prompt(lang) | ~3K |\n| 1 | Semantic | SemanticMemory::render() | ~4K |\n| 2L | Backbone | LongTermMemory::render() or render_backbone_compact() | ~1K |\n| 2P | Plan | Active plan read from ~/.config/dsc/plans/ | ~500 |\n| 2S | Short-Term | ShortTermMemory::render() | ~500 |\n| 2T | Tasks | tasks-mem.md | ~200 |\n| 2F | Pitfalls | PitfallGuide::render(5) | ~300 |\n| 3 | Episodic | Messages after L1-L4 compaction | Variable |\n\nCompact backbone (render_backbone_compact) activates when context enters Danger tier (>400K or >80%).\n\n## Health Platform\n\n`DsAgentsHealthPlatform` in `src/health.rs` consolidates:\n\n| Domain | Signals |\n|--------|---------|\n| Context | context_tokens, context_limit, context_pressure, context_tier (Premium/Healthy/Danger) |\n| Tool Chain | tool_failures_this_turn, consecutive_failures, tool_loop_count, consecutive_tool_only_turns |\n| Error Ledger | recent_errors (VecDeque<HealthError>), error_counts (HashMap<ErrorKind, u32>) |\n| Emotion | AgentEmotion (Flow, Calm, Anxious, Frustrated, Confused, Panic) |\n| API | api_retries, api_errors, transport_errors, empty_responses |\n| Exec | exec_pending, exec_timeouts, sudo_failures |\n\nAfter each turn: `assess()` returns `Assessment { level: Green/Yellow/Red, emotion, advice, interrupt }`.\nHealth interrupt injected as system message when Yellow/Red. Caring prompt when ≥2 consecutive failures.\n\n## Three-Tier Memory\n\n| Tier | Context Range | Strategy |\n|------|-------------|----------|\n| Premium | 0–128K | Full fidelity — active files, current turn, recent 5-8 rounds |\n| Healthy | 128K–400K | Atomic F:/E: entries — each line self-contained for CSA sparse selection |\n| Danger | 400K+ | Compact backbone only — module map + critical invariants |\n\nAuto-triggers: compact backbone injection at Danger tier; health tool shows current tier.\nCSA (Compressed Sparse Attention) top-k selection at 400K+ can only see ~0.5% of older entries — atomic format ensures any selected line carries full information.\n\n## 31 Tools\n\n| Category | Tools |\n|----------|-------|\n| Files | read_file, write_file, edit_file, list_dir, glance |\n| Search | search, explore |\n| Git | git_status, git_diff, git_log, git_commit |\n| Exec | exec |\n| Web | web_fetch, web_search, context7_resolve, context7_query |\n| Memory | mem_save, mem_read, mem_forget |\n| Planning | plan_create, plan_update, plan_read, plan_list |\n| Tasks | task_create, task_update, task_list |\n| Health | health, pitfall_save, pitfall_guide |\n| Meta | status, ask_user, list_skills, read_skill_ref |\n\nAll tools registered in `ToolManager::new()`, sent as Anthropic function definitions in the API `tools[]` array.\n\n## Key Invariants\n\n- tool_use/tool_result MUST be adjacent in messages vec (API 400 if interleaved)\n- Sudo password via stdin pipe, NEVER in command string\n- exec_pending gates agent loop to prevent double-request race\n- Thinking blocks (with signatures) must be preserved across requests\n- Health report Mutex protects cross-tool access (health tool reads from static)\n\n## TUI Modes\n\n| Mode | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| Chat | Idle, waiting for user input |\n| Streaming | Agent loop active, receiving SSE stream |\n| ToolConfirm | Tool requires user confirmation (Y/N) |\n| DangerPrompt | Dangerous command warning |\n| SudoPrompt | Sudo password required |\n| ApiConfig | API key not configured |\n| SessionPicker | Choosing a session to resume |\n| IntentPicker | Slash command submenu |\n","numLines":146,"startLine":1,"totalLines":146}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"4bd5d69b-08ca-45e7-ab78-888f6b314ac4","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
