{"parentUuid":"91971996-476a-44db-867f-0eddec1e70bc","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","promptId":"9d74668c-3e37-4fcd-b03d-ee1c5ae0fb2d","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_01_d5x6VDFPZJLJ0mAJPuTr9210","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# DeepSeek Coder (dsc) v0.40.1-beta\n2\t\n3\tAI coding CLI/TUI for DeepSeek V4. Rust + ratatui, single binary.\n4\t\n5\t## Features\n6\t\n7\t### Agent Loop\n8\t- Full tool chain: read → edit → exec(build) → fix → repeat\n9\t- Safety gates: 100 tools/turn limit, 3-consecutive-failure gate, 5 tool-only turn gate\n10\t- gate_message deferred when exec_pending > 0 (prevents tool_use/tool_result pairing break)\n11\t- Auto mode with phase routing (explore/plan/coding/debug/chat)\n12\t\n13\t### Health Platform & Emotion\n14\t- `DsAgentsHealthPlatform` — unified system monitoring\n15\t- Green/Yellow/Red levels with auto-injected health interrupts\n16\t- `AgentEmotion`: Flow, Calm, Anxious, Frustrated, Confused, Panic\n17\t- Cathartic advice on negative emotions (\"This thing is being a pain...\")\n18\t- `health()` tool — AI can query its own health status\n19\t\n20\t### Self-Learning (Pitfall Guide)\n21\t- Cross-session error knowledge base (`pitfalls.json`)\n22\t- Auto-extracts lessons from AI's own failure descriptions\n23\t- Matches recurring errors to past pitfalls\n24\t- Caring prompt: \"What went wrong?\" on ≥2 consecutive failures\n25\t\n26\t### Context Management\n27\t- ContextBuilder with 8-layer assembly\n28\t- L1-L4 progressive compaction with atomic entries (F:/E: format)\n29\t- Three-tier model aligned with V4 attention: Premium (0-128K) / Healthy (128K-400K) / Danger (400K+)\n30\t- Compact backbone auto-switch at Danger tier\n31\t- `/compact` manual force-compact\n32\t\n33\t### Memory\n34\t- SemanticMemory — file→purpose+symbols, auto-extracted from tool results\n35\t- LongTermMemory — Project Backbone (module map + critical invariants), cross-session\n36\t- ShortTermMemory — per-session round index\n37\t- `glance(path)` — file metadata preview (~150 tokens vs ~3500 for read)\n38\t- `mem_save`/`mem_read`/`mem_forget` — session memory tools\n39\t\n40\t### Plan & Task\n41\t- `plan_create`/`plan_update`/`plan_read`/`plan_list` — implementation planning\n42\t- `task_create`/`task_update`/`task_list` — work tracking\n43\t- Tasks in independent `tasks-mem.md` (no auto_extract interference)\n44\t- Plan completion auto-summarized to long-term memory\n45\t\n46\t### File Operations\n47\t- read_file with paging (start_line/end_line)\n48\t- write_file / edit_file (exact find-and-replace)\n49\t- list_dir / search (regex grep) / explore (project scan)\n50\t- glance (cached metadata preview)\n51\t- Git: status, diff, log, commit\n52\t\n53\t### Context7 Integration\n54\t- `context7_resolve` — find library documentation\n55\t- `context7_query` — fetch current docs with code examples\n56\t\n57\t### Exec\n58\t- Async shell commands with streaming output to bottom-left TUI panel\n59\t- Sudo support (password via stdin pipe, never in command string)\n60\t- Safety classification: dangerous commands require confirmation\n61\t\n62\t## Slash Commands\n63\t\n64\t| Command | Action |\n65\t|---------|--------|\n66\t| `/auto` | Toggle auto-mode (phase routing) |\n67\t| `/compact` | Force context compaction |\n68\t| `/model` | Switch model |\n69\t| `/effort` | Set thinking effort (low/medium/high/max) |\n70\t| `/skip-all` | Toggle skip-all confirmations |\n71\t| `/dev` | Toggle dev mode (diagnostic logging) |\n72\t| `/context` | Show context breakdown |\n73\t| `/help` | Show help |\n74\t\n75\t## Config\n76\t\n77\t```json\n78\t{\n79\t  \"api_key\": \"...\",\n80\t  \"model\": \"deepseek-v4-pro\",\n81\t  \"max_tokens\": 96000,\n82\t  \"context_limit\": 1000000,\n83\t  \"effort\": \"high\",\n84\t  \"prompt_lang\": \"en\",\n85\t  \"active_profile\": \"default\",\n86\t  \"profiles\": {\n87\t    \"default\": {\n88\t      \"model\": \"deepseek-v4-flash\",\n89\t      \"max_tokens\": 16000,\n90\t      \"context_limit\": 1000000,\n91\t      \"effort\": null,\n92\t      \"base_url\": \"https://api.deepseek.com\",\n93\t      \"prompt_lang\": \"en\"\n94\t    }\n95\t  },\n96\t  \"auto_mode\": false\n97\t}\n98\t```\n99\t\n100\tProfiles support quick model/effort switching. Env vars: `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY`, `DEEPSEEK_MODEL`, `DEEPSEEK_MAX_TOKENS`, `DEEPSEEK_CONTEXT_LIMIT`, `DEEPSEEK_EFFORT`, `DEEPSEEK_PROMPT_LANG`.\n101\t\n102\t## Build\n103\t\n104\t```bash\n105\tcargo build --release     # ~19MB binary\n106\tcargo test                # 1 test\n107\t```\n108\t\n109\t## Data Files\n110\t\n111\t| Path | Purpose |\n112\t|------|---------|\n113\t| `~/.config/dsc/config.json` | Config + profiles |\n114\t| `~/.config/dsc/sessions/{seed}-{date}/` | Per-session messages + memory |\n115\t| `~/.config/dsc/plans/` | Plan files |\n116\t| `~/.config/dsc/pitfalls.json` | Cross-session pitfall knowledge base |\n117\t"}]},"uuid":"cef6c4d3-4cfe-4a81-a5f3-ce61507a598c","timestamp":"2026-05-14T14:10:32.090Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/docs/agent.md","content":"# DeepSeek Coder (dsc) v0.40.1-beta\n\nAI coding CLI/TUI for DeepSeek V4. Rust + ratatui, single binary.\n\n## Features\n\n### Agent Loop\n- Full tool chain: read → edit → exec(build) → fix → repeat\n- Safety gates: 100 tools/turn limit, 3-consecutive-failure gate, 5 tool-only turn gate\n- gate_message deferred when exec_pending > 0 (prevents tool_use/tool_result pairing break)\n- Auto mode with phase routing (explore/plan/coding/debug/chat)\n\n### Health Platform & Emotion\n- `DsAgentsHealthPlatform` — unified system monitoring\n- Green/Yellow/Red levels with auto-injected health interrupts\n- `AgentEmotion`: Flow, Calm, Anxious, Frustrated, Confused, Panic\n- Cathartic advice on negative emotions (\"This thing is being a pain...\")\n- `health()` tool — AI can query its own health status\n\n### Self-Learning (Pitfall Guide)\n- Cross-session error knowledge base (`pitfalls.json`)\n- Auto-extracts lessons from AI's own failure descriptions\n- Matches recurring errors to past pitfalls\n- Caring prompt: \"What went wrong?\" on ≥2 consecutive failures\n\n### Context Management\n- ContextBuilder with 8-layer assembly\n- L1-L4 progressive compaction with atomic entries (F:/E: format)\n- Three-tier model aligned with V4 attention: Premium (0-128K) / Healthy (128K-400K) / Danger (400K+)\n- Compact backbone auto-switch at Danger tier\n- `/compact` manual force-compact\n\n### Memory\n- SemanticMemory — file→purpose+symbols, auto-extracted from tool results\n- LongTermMemory — Project Backbone (module map + critical invariants), cross-session\n- ShortTermMemory — per-session round index\n- `glance(path)` — file metadata preview (~150 tokens vs ~3500 for read)\n- `mem_save`/`mem_read`/`mem_forget` — session memory tools\n\n### Plan & Task\n- `plan_create`/`plan_update`/`plan_read`/`plan_list` — implementation planning\n- `task_create`/`task_update`/`task_list` — work tracking\n- Tasks in independent `tasks-mem.md` (no auto_extract interference)\n- Plan completion auto-summarized to long-term memory\n\n### File Operations\n- read_file with paging (start_line/end_line)\n- write_file / edit_file (exact find-and-replace)\n- list_dir / search (regex grep) / explore (project scan)\n- glance (cached metadata preview)\n- Git: status, diff, log, commit\n\n### Context7 Integration\n- `context7_resolve` — find library documentation\n- `context7_query` — fetch current docs with code examples\n\n### Exec\n- Async shell commands with streaming output to bottom-left TUI panel\n- Sudo support (password via stdin pipe, never in command string)\n- Safety classification: dangerous commands require confirmation\n\n## Slash Commands\n\n| Command | Action |\n|---------|--------|\n| `/auto` | Toggle auto-mode (phase routing) |\n| `/compact` | Force context compaction |\n| `/model` | Switch model |\n| `/effort` | Set thinking effort (low/medium/high/max) |\n| `/skip-all` | Toggle skip-all confirmations |\n| `/dev` | Toggle dev mode (diagnostic logging) |\n| `/context` | Show context breakdown |\n| `/help` | Show help |\n\n## Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"api_key\": \"...\",\n  \"model\": \"deepseek-v4-pro\",\n  \"max_tokens\": 96000,\n  \"context_limit\": 1000000,\n  \"effort\": \"high\",\n  \"prompt_lang\": \"en\",\n  \"active_profile\": \"default\",\n  \"profiles\": {\n    \"default\": {\n      \"model\": \"deepseek-v4-flash\",\n      \"max_tokens\": 16000,\n      \"context_limit\": 1000000,\n      \"effort\": null,\n      \"base_url\": \"https://api.deepseek.com\",\n      \"prompt_lang\": \"en\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"auto_mode\": false\n}\n```\n\nProfiles support quick model/effort switching. Env vars: `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY`, `DEEPSEEK_MODEL`, `DEEPSEEK_MAX_TOKENS`, `DEEPSEEK_CONTEXT_LIMIT`, `DEEPSEEK_EFFORT`, `DEEPSEEK_PROMPT_LANG`.\n\n## Build\n\n```bash\ncargo build --release     # ~19MB binary\ncargo test                # 1 test\n```\n\n## Data Files\n\n| Path | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `~/.config/dsc/config.json` | Config + profiles |\n| `~/.config/dsc/sessions/{seed}-{date}/` | Per-session messages + memory |\n| `~/.config/dsc/plans/` | Plan files |\n| `~/.config/dsc/pitfalls.json` | Cross-session pitfall knowledge base |\n","numLines":117,"startLine":1,"totalLines":117}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"91971996-476a-44db-867f-0eddec1e70bc","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
