{"parentUuid":"eea39ae4-6794-41b4-bd24-dec0ebb89d16","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","message":{"id":"3ad329fc-883f-4ee8-9f00-cf4efde37a22","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_00_yDOg4fljoPNSF5IhD9CL1262","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/docs/updatelog/3.2.0.md","limit":60}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1680,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":171648,"output_tokens":248,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"885ac709-ad8e-4464-af64-cb4de6bf8d94","timestamp":"2026-05-14T14:10:37.819Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"885ac709-ad8e-4464-af64-cb4de6bf8d94","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","promptId":"9d74668c-3e37-4fcd-b03d-ee1c5ae0fb2d","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_00_yDOg4fljoPNSF5IhD9CL1262","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# dsc v3.2.0 — Trust Governance & Health Controller\n2\t\n3\t> 2026-05-13 | From v3.1.1\n4\t\n5\t## Release Summary\n6\t\n7\tv3.2.0 transforms the enforcement model from gate-based blocking to trust-based\n8\tgovernance. The Health Platform evolves from a passive monitor into a runtime\n9\tcontroller with circuit breakers, soft throttling, and escalation policies.\n10\tIntent gates shift from pre-execution blocking to post-execution noting —\n11\twriting always succeeds, the system learns from patterns.\n12\t\n13\t## Paradigm Shift: Gates → Trust\n14\t\n15\t### Pre-Execution → Post-Execution\n16\t| Before (v3.1.x) | After (v3.2.0) |\n17\t|-----------------|----------------|\n18\t| write/edit blocked until AI declares intent | write always succeeds; missing intent gets a NOTE |\n19\t| exec blocked for missing content | exec always succeeds; reminder after |\n20\t| tool-equivalence BLOCKED | tool-equivalence NOTE (feedback > friction) |\n21\t| intent checked per-file, per-turn | checked by HealthPlatform, scored globally |\n22\t\n23\t### Trust Scoring (HealthPlatform)\n24\t```\n25\ttrust_score: 0-100, starts at 100\n26\t  +5  per declared intent (capped at 100)\n27\t  -5  per undeclared write on HighStake path (< 3 consecutive)\n28\t  -10 per undeclared write on HighStake path (3-4 consecutive)\n29\t  -20 per undeclared write on HighStake path (5+ consecutive)\n30\t\n31\tTrustTier:\n32\t  Relaxed   (< 3 misses)  → no note\n33\t  Watchful  (3-5 misses)  → REMINDER with count\n34\t  Strict    (6+ misses)   → WARNING with score threat\n35\t```\n36\t\n37\t### Path-Based Trust\n38\t```\n39\t/**, /var/tmp/, /exam*/  → Trusted      — no gate, no sandbox\n40\tsrc/**                   → HighStake    — intent scoring active\n41\teverything else          → HighStake    — default cautious\n42\t```\n43\t`classify_path()` normalizes paths to prevent `/tmp/../src/` bypass.\n44\t\n45\t## Health Platform: Controller\n46\t\n47\t### New Dimensions\n48\t| Layer | Method | Behavior |\n49\t|-------|--------|----------|\n50\t| Circuit Breaker | `should_block(name)` | 5 consecutive failures → disable tool for session |\n51\t| Soft Throttle | `should_throttle(name)` | 20+ calls/turn → WARNING, no block |\n52\t| Escalation | `should_escalate()` | trust<20, 4+ failures, API backoff≥4 → force text |\n53\t| Resource Ledger | `tokens_by_category` | Token consumption by \"file\"/\"exec\"/\"search\"/\"meta\" |\n54\t| Recovery | `record_api_success()` | Reset backoff, remember last working model |\n55\t\n56\t### Integration Points\n57\t```\n58\tapp.rs → pre_tool_health_check(name)  ← before execute_tool\n59\t       → post_tool_health_record(name, !failed)  ← after result\n60\t       → health.should_escalate()     ← in safety gate section"}]},"uuid":"b79a5fe5-ff58-4d06-b82c-fa0c47f864ce","timestamp":"2026-05-14T14:10:37.835Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/docs/updatelog/3.2.0.md","content":"# dsc v3.2.0 — Trust Governance & Health Controller\n\n> 2026-05-13 | From v3.1.1\n\n## Release Summary\n\nv3.2.0 transforms the enforcement model from gate-based blocking to trust-based\ngovernance. The Health Platform evolves from a passive monitor into a runtime\ncontroller with circuit breakers, soft throttling, and escalation policies.\nIntent gates shift from pre-execution blocking to post-execution noting —\nwriting always succeeds, the system learns from patterns.\n\n## Paradigm Shift: Gates → Trust\n\n### Pre-Execution → Post-Execution\n| Before (v3.1.x) | After (v3.2.0) |\n|-----------------|----------------|\n| write/edit blocked until AI declares intent | write always succeeds; missing intent gets a NOTE |\n| exec blocked for missing content | exec always succeeds; reminder after |\n| tool-equivalence BLOCKED | tool-equivalence NOTE (feedback > friction) |\n| intent checked per-file, per-turn | checked by HealthPlatform, scored globally |\n\n### Trust Scoring (HealthPlatform)\n```\ntrust_score: 0-100, starts at 100\n  +5  per declared intent (capped at 100)\n  -5  per undeclared write on HighStake path (< 3 consecutive)\n  -10 per undeclared write on HighStake path (3-4 consecutive)\n  -20 per undeclared write on HighStake path (5+ consecutive)\n\nTrustTier:\n  Relaxed   (< 3 misses)  → no note\n  Watchful  (3-5 misses)  → REMINDER with count\n  Strict    (6+ misses)   → WARNING with score threat\n```\n\n### Path-Based Trust\n```\n/**, /var/tmp/, /exam*/  → Trusted      — no gate, no sandbox\nsrc/**                   → HighStake    — intent scoring active\neverything else          → HighStake    — default cautious\n```\n`classify_path()` normalizes paths to prevent `/tmp/../src/` bypass.\n\n## Health Platform: Controller\n\n### New Dimensions\n| Layer | Method | Behavior |\n|-------|--------|----------|\n| Circuit Breaker | `should_block(name)` | 5 consecutive failures → disable tool for session |\n| Soft Throttle | `should_throttle(name)` | 20+ calls/turn → WARNING, no block |\n| Escalation | `should_escalate()` | trust<20, 4+ failures, API backoff≥4 → force text |\n| Resource Ledger | `tokens_by_category` | Token consumption by \"file\"/\"exec\"/\"search\"/\"meta\" |\n| Recovery | `record_api_success()` | Reset backoff, remember last working model |\n\n### Integration Points\n```\napp.rs → pre_tool_health_check(name)  ← before execute_tool\n       → post_tool_health_record(name, !failed)  ← after result\n       → health.should_escalate()     ← in safety gate section","numLines":60,"startLine":1,"totalLines":142}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"885ac709-ad8e-4464-af64-cb4de6bf8d94","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version