ongTermMemory`: added `critical_invariants` field\n- `render()` → \"Project Backbone\" with Module Map + Critical Invariants\n- `render_backbone_compact()` for re-injection in Danger tier\n- `sync_from_semantic()` keeps module map fresh from SemanticMemory\n- Auto-injected at session start via ContextBuilder\n\n### Glance Tool (`src/tools/plan_task.rs`)\n- File metadata preview from SemanticMemory cache (~150 tokens vs ~3500 for read)\n- Returns purpose, symbols, language — no full content\n- ideal workflow: `explore` → `glance` suspicious files → `read` only what matters\n\n## Tool Definition Audit — All 31 Tools Fixed\n\n### A. Missing `required` field (6 tools)\ngit_status, git_diff, git_log, list_skills, plan_list, health — now all have `\"required\": []`\n\n### B. Missing `enum` constraint (6 parameters)\nmem_save.tier, mem_read.tier, plan_update.status, task_update.status, pitfall_save.error_kind, pitfall_guide.error_kind — fixed\n\n### C. Inaccurate descriptions (4 tools)\n- web_fetch: removed false \"HTML→markdown\" claim\n- git_diff: \"(unstaged)\" → describes both staged/unstaged\n- status: removed contradictory 16K/32K token budgets and hardcoded model names\n- task_list: added \"cancelled\" to filter\n\n### D/E/F. Minor fixes (12 across 7 tools)\nAdded `default` keys, removed redundant \"(optional)\" markers, renamed `context7_def` → `context7_resolve_def`\n\n## System Prompt Cleanup (`src/config.rs`)\n- Removed hand-written TOOLS section (~850 tokens saved per request)\n- Tools now defined exclusively via `tools[]` array (single source of truth)\n- Two `\\\\\\n\\` sed artifacts fixed (EN line 204, ZH line 284)\n- New tools (glance, health, pitfall_save, pitfall_guide) listed in category summary\n\n## Memory & Compact Integration\n- Tasks separated to `tasks-mem.md` (no more auto_extract overwrites)\n- Task injection via ContextBuilder (Layer 2T)\n- Context tier visible in health report\n- Compact backbone auto-switches at Danger tier\n- Three-tier design documented: Layer 1 (Premium), Layer 2 (Healthy), Layer 3 (Danger)\n\n## Bug Fixes\n- Task tool stability: 3 bugs fixed (overwrite, TUI read source, truncation direction)\n- Health report staleness: OnceLock→Mutex\n- Emotion lock: cumulative counters replaced with per-turn/rolling-window signals\n- `task_update`: exact subject matching instead of substring\n- `consecutive_tool_only_turns`: now synced to health platform\n\n## Source Files (current)\n- `src/main.rs` — entry point\n- `src/api.rs` — SSE streaming, DeepSeek API\n- `src/config.rs` — config, system prompt, is_command\n- `src/context.rs` — ContextBuilder, compact_context, atomic entries\n- `src/health.rs` (~680L) — DsAgentsHealthPlatform, emotion, tier, health tool\n- `src/memory.rs` (~810L) — SemanticMemory, LongTerm, ShortTerm, PitfallGuide\n- `src/session.rs` — session I/O, memory persistence, pitfalls I/O\n- `src/types.rs` — Message, ToolDef, Anthropic types\n- `src/router.rs` — phase routing and auto-mode\n- `src/skills.rs` — skill scanning and matching\n- `src/dsc_log.rs` — logging","numLines":100,"startLine":1,"totalLines":119}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"151372a9-c906-45fc-b012-b1538c3a071e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
