{"parentUuid":"3284a582-b176-48d3-a612-907cdada80f3","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","message":{"id":"47c1473c-b4d8-4661-a2f7-963c587f8f5b","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a comprehensive picture. Let me synthesize the key findings:\n\n1. **Why sandboxing matters**: \n   - v3.2.0 had trust governance with path-based trust (`/**, /var/tmp/` → Trusted, `src/**` → HighStake)\n   - But the gate logic and the trust scoring lived in the same binary as the agent being monitored\n   - `classify_path()` could be bypassed since it was in-process\n   - The whole \"gate → trust\" paradigm shift happened because gate blocking was ineffective when it lived in the same process\n   - The `health.rs` file grew from 0 to 680 lines through self-upgrading, becoming a monolithic God object\n\n2. **Why health platform historical legacy matters**:\n   - `DsAgentsHealthPlatform` was built incrementally by AI self-upgrades\n   - v0.40.1: emotion, pitfall guide, context tier added → health.rs already 680L\n   - v3.2.0: trust governance, circuit breaker, escalation → health.rs became a controller\n   - Multiple bugs were caused by health living in-process: OnceLock staleness, cumulative counter lock-in, thread safety issues\n   - Self-learning memory was FROZEN (disabled) in v3.4.0 — deemed \"low signal-to-noise\"\n   - The monolith grew through updater cycles and became increasingly fragile\n\n3. **Git history shows the iterative pain**:\n   - 400 error popup never disappears (orphan tool_use never reset)\n   - `/fix` validates after repair — confirms alternation\n   - Orphan ExecDone after stream cancel\n   - confirm_tools deadlock\n   - ANSI escape code corruption in PTY exec output\n   - Hardcoded 15s timeout override\n\n4. **The cumulative effect**: Each updater cycle added features but the single-binary constraint meant health/safety/tools all tangled together. The system became self-aware but couldn't self-protect because the guardian lived inside the guarded.\n\nLet me now send this analysis to the team members.","signature":"47c1473c-b4d8-4661-a2f7-963c587f8f5b"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2414,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":173568,"output_tokens":3430,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"8f3dc85c-1f0b-427d-a3dd-3b42067d9333","timestamp":"2026-05-14T14:11:01.168Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
