{"parentUuid":"7c5f88e4-db48-464d-99ba-b0ae15ebf035","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","message":{"id":"47c1473c-b4d8-4661-a2f7-963c587f8f5b","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_02_CQdIa4GBXOKEXCGkXMB27773","name":"SendMessage","input":{"to":"D01","message":"## Lead 分析：为什么 Tools 必须独立进程\n\n从 /home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/docs 的历史证据：\n\n**v3.4.1 的 4 个 bug，3 个是 tools/exec/UI 进程内耦合导致的：**\n1. `confirm_tools` 执行完未切换 mode → 空弹窗死锁（ToolManager 和 TUI mode 耦合）\n2. Orphan ExecDone after stream cancel → tool_result 无 assistant（exec 取消与消息流耦合）\n3. ANSI escape codes from PTY exec → TTY corruption（exec stdout 直接污染 TUI 渲染）\n4. ToolManager::execute 硬编码 15s timeout 覆盖 exec timeout_secs（超时在 tools/mod.rs 和 exec.rs 两处定义）\n\n**31→34 个工具平铺给模型**：v2.x 工具系统自我繁殖，agent.rs 的 20+ action 分发器就是平铺架构的结果。二级菜单缺失是单进程的附带伤害——在单体里加新工具太容易了，没有进程边界约束。\n\n**D03 的质疑现在有答案了**：task/plan/memory 的 1ms I/O 不需要 IPC——但它们和 exec 在同一个 ToolManager 注册表里。要么全拆要么全不拆。半拆（exec 独立，task/plan/memory 留 agent）会导致两个 ToolManager，比统一 IPC 更复杂。沙箱一致性优先于 1ms 延迟。","summary":"下发历史分析给 D01","type":"message","recipient":"D01","content":"## Lead 分析：为什么 Tools 必须独立进程\n\n从 /home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/docs 的历史证据：\n\n**v3.4.1 的 4 个 bug，3 个是 tools/exec/UI 进程内耦合导致的：**\n1. `confirm_tools` 执行完未切换 mode → 空弹窗死锁（ToolManager 和 TUI mode 耦合）\n2. Orphan ExecDone after stream cancel → tool_result 无 assistant（exec 取消与消息流耦合）\n3. ANSI escape codes from PTY exec → TTY corruption（exec stdout 直接污染 TUI 渲染）\n4. ToolManager::execute 硬编码 15s timeout 覆盖 exec timeout_secs（超时在 tools/mod.rs 和 exec.rs 两处定义）\n\n**31→34 个工具平铺给模型**：v2.x 工具系统自我繁殖，agent.rs 的 20+ action 分发器就是平铺架构的结果。二级菜单缺失是单进程的附带伤害——在单体里加新工具太容易了，没有进程边界约束。\n\n**D03 的质疑现在有答案了**：task/plan/memory 的 1ms I/O 不需要 IPC——但它们和 exec 在同一个 ToolManager 注册表里。要么全拆要么全不拆。半拆（exec 独立，task/plan/memory 留 agent）会导致两个 ToolManager，比统一 IPC 更复杂。沙箱一致性优先于 1ms 延迟。"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2414,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":173568,"output_tokens":3430,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"ca50d45a-9c96-412d-bf3e-ba6b4572bd44","timestamp":"2026-05-14T14:12:16.780Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
