n 分发器就是平铺架构的结果。二级菜单缺失是单进程的附带伤害——在单体里加新工具太容易了，没有进程边界约束。\n\n**D03 的质疑现在有答案了**：task/plan/memory 的 1ms I/O 不需要 IPC——但它们和 exec 在同一个 ToolManager 注册表里。要么全拆要么全不拆。半拆（exec 独立，task/plan/memory 留 agent）会导致两个 ToolManager，比统一 IPC 更复杂。沙箱一致性优先于 1ms 延迟。"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ca50d45a-9c96-412d-bf3e-ba6b4572bd44","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"7dc8887b-3dc5-4621-abcc-d232f26ce025","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","message":{"id":"47c1473c-b4d8-4661-a2f7-963c587f8f5b","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_03_fyjhIXiUGgGgXAZbW8zq9306","name":"SendMessage","input":{"to":"C01","message":"## Lead 分析：gate→trust 范式转变的教训\n\n从 /home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/docs/updatelog/3.2.0.md：\n\nv3.2.0 做了一个重大范式转变：**Gate → Trust**\n- 之前：write/edit 被 gate 阻塞直到 AI 声明意图\n- 之后：write 永远成功，缺失意图只记 NOTE\n\n为什么转变？因为 gate 和被监控者在同一进程——prompt 可以绕 gate，gate 绕不了的前提是 gate 物理独立。\n\n你的 StreamAction/LoopDecision 设计（代替 `&mut App`）本质上就是给编排器做同样的事：用一个类型安全的枚举替代隐式状态修改，让编排决策可审计、可外部验证。\n\n**辩论结论中的 gate 分界**（HP check_gate 审计、Agent policy gate 策略）正是吸取了 v3.2.0 的教训：HP 独立于 Agent，它的 gate 不可绕。","summary":"下发历史分析给 C01","type":"message","recipient":"C01","content":"## Lead 分析：gate→trust 范式转变的教训\n\n从 /home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/docs/updatelog/3.2.0.md：\n\nv3.2.0 做了一个重大范式转变：**Gate → Trust**\n- 之前：write/edit 被 gate 阻塞直到 AI 声明意图\n- 之后：write 永远成功，缺失意图只记 NOTE\n\n为什么转变？因为 gate 和被监控者在同一进程——prompt 可以绕 gate，gate 绕不了的前提是 gate 物理独立。\n\n你的 StreamAction/LoopDecision 设计（代替 `&mut App`）本质上就是给编排器做同样的事：用一个类型安全的枚举替代隐式状态修改，让编排决策可审计、可外部验证。\n\n**辩论结论中的 gate 分界**（HP check_gate 审计、Agent policy gate 策略）正是吸取了 v3.2.0 的教训：HP 独立于 Agent，它的 gate 不可绕。"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2414,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":173568,"output_tokens":3430,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"8f15b485-adba-4d4f-b8a8-8677530a9ea2","timestamp":"2026-05-14T14:12:33.074Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master"