{"parentUuid":"baf51778-9b60-40c9-91e1-a81df0acde3c","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","message":{"id":"70c81ea4-b836-4fb0-ab5d-38ce97a0c534","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can see D01's design: Explore is treated as an action under `exec`, not as a standalone tool. They placed it under `exec/explore` in the tool menu hierarchy.\n\nLet me present this to the user. D01 seems unable to respond directly (all Explore agents are read-only). Let me just relay what I found in their design doc.\n\nActually, D01 is an Explore-type agent - they can only read/search, not write or send rich messages. But they CAN use SendMessage. Let me wait a bit more for their response.\n\nActually, looking at the Explore agent capabilities: \"All tools except Agent, ExitPlanMode, Edit, Write, NotebookEdit\" — so they CAN use SendMessage. But D01 keeps going idle instead of sending a message.\n\nLet me just present what D01 wrote in their design doc to the user directly.","signature":"70c81ea4-b836-4fb0-ab5d-38ce97a0c534"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":284,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":187520,"output_tokens":269,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"e1d1e19c-5875-4be1-a48a-e1e31a5314a9","timestamp":"2026-05-14T14:17:52.692Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
