{"parentUuid":"73675ee1-e6c3-408f-ad8a-cce58d73183d","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","promptId":"b2059178-09e5-4847-90ff-317c1fd2c6b1","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_00_pxjVhGBpnqQwkEWClWkh0732","type":"tool_result","content":"330\t| `web/context7_query` | `context7_query` | `handle_c7_query` | Allow | 15s |\n331\t\n332\t注意：\n333\t- `web/fetch` 的 `output` 参数功能保留（写文件）\n334\t- Context7 API key 应移至配置文件/环境变量（`CONTEXT7_API_KEY`），当前硬编码需移除\n335\t- 搜索目前使用 cn.bing.com，未来可改为可配置的 search provider\n336\t\n337\t### 4.4 Explore — 独立为 `exec/explore`\n338\t\n339\tExplore 不再作为独立顶级工具，而是 `exec` 下的一个 action。这与当前代码结构一致（`exec_exec` 中已分派到 `explore`）。\n340\t\n341\t---\n342\t\n343\t## 5. 安全检测中心化\n344\t\n345\t### 5.1 统一 `safety.rs`\n346\t\n347\t```rust\n348\t// src/dsx-tools/safety.rs\n349\t\n350\t/// 全局工具安全检查（所有 handler 执行前调用）\n351\tpub fn check(name: &str, action: &str, args: &Value) -> SafetyVerdict {\n352\t    match (name, action) {\n353\t        // Exec\n354\t        (\"exec\", \"run\") => classify_execution(args),\n355\t        (\"exec\", \"sudo_run\") => SafetyVerdict::Block(\"sudo requires password prompt\"),\n356\t        (\"exec\", \"explore\") => SafetyVerdict::Allow,\n357\t        (\"exec\", \"pty\") => SafetyVerdict::Confirm(\"PTY exec may be interactive\"),\n358\t        \n359\t        // Git\n360\t        (\"git\", \"commit\") => SafetyVerdict::Confirm(\"Create a git commit?\"),\n361\t        (\"git\", _) => SafetyVerdict::Allow,  // status, diff, log are safe\n362\t        \n363\t        // Web\n364\t        (\"web\", \"fetch\") => SafetyVerdict::Confirm(\"Fetch external URL?\"),\n365\t        (\"web\", _) => SafetyVerdict::Allow,  // search, context7_* are safe\n366\t        \n367\t        // File (D02 provides these, central safety here is for the overall flow)\n368\t        (\"file\", \"read\" | \"list\" | \"search\") => SafetyVerdict::Allow,\n369\t        (\"file\", \"write\" | \"edit\" | \"diff\") => SafetyVerdict::Confirm(\"Modify file?\"),"}]},"uuid":"76e4af01-1b14-432d-b7db-f9f3761d91a8","timestamp":"2026-05-14T14:17:54.881Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/explore.md","content":"| `web/context7_query` | `context7_query` | `handle_c7_query` | Allow | 15s |\n\n注意：\n- `web/fetch` 的 `output` 参数功能保留（写文件）\n- Context7 API key 应移至配置文件/环境变量（`CONTEXT7_API_KEY`），当前硬编码需移除\n- 搜索目前使用 cn.bing.com，未来可改为可配置的 search provider\n\n### 4.4 Explore — 独立为 `exec/explore`\n\nExplore 不再作为独立顶级工具，而是 `exec` 下的一个 action。这与当前代码结构一致（`exec_exec` 中已分派到 `explore`）。\n\n---\n\n## 5. 安全检测中心化\n\n### 5.1 统一 `safety.rs`\n\n```rust\n// src/dsx-tools/safety.rs\n\n/// 全局工具安全检查（所有 handler 执行前调用）\npub fn check(name: &str, action: &str, args: &Value) -> SafetyVerdict {\n    match (name, action) {\n        // Exec\n        (\"exec\", \"run\") => classify_execution(args),\n        (\"exec\", \"sudo_run\") => SafetyVerdict::Block(\"sudo requires password prompt\"),\n        (\"exec\", \"explore\") => SafetyVerdict::Allow,\n        (\"exec\", \"pty\") => SafetyVerdict::Confirm(\"PTY exec may be interactive\"),\n        \n        // Git\n        (\"git\", \"commit\") => SafetyVerdict::Confirm(\"Create a git commit?\"),\n        (\"git\", _) => SafetyVerdict::Allow,  // status, diff, log are safe\n        \n        // Web\n        (\"web\", \"fetch\") => SafetyVerdict::Confirm(\"Fetch external URL?\"),\n        (\"web\", _) => SafetyVerdict::Allow,  // search, context7_* are safe\n        \n        // File (D02 provides these, central safety here is for the overall flow)\n        (\"file\", \"read\" | \"list\" | \"search\") => SafetyVerdict::Allow,\n        (\"file\", \"write\" | \"edit\" | \"diff\") => SafetyVerdict::Confirm(\"Modify file?\"),","numLines":40,"startLine":330,"totalLines":700}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"73675ee1-e6c3-408f-ad8a-cce58d73183d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
