{"parentUuid":"8fa1141e-22c9-41bd-8662-e7df89a286d2","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","message":{"id":"2d0835ab-f6d4-4ec3-aeef-0e34f25f089d","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"D01 似乎无法直接对话（Explore 类型子代理的局限性）。我直接转述他在设计文档中的方案：\n\n---\n\n## D01 的 explore.rs 设计\n\n**位置：** `exec/explore` —— explore 不再是独立顶级工具，而是 `exec` 下的一个子 action。\n\n**理由：** 与当前代码结构一致（`exec_exec` 中已分派到 `explore`）。\n\n**菜单层级：**\n```\nexec\n├── run          (shell 命令)\n├── sudo_run     (提权命令)\n├── explore      (项目扫描)     ← 这里\n└── pty          (交互终端)\n```\n\n**安全级别：** `Allow`（无风险操作，不需要确认）\n\n---\n\n## D02 的质疑\n\nD02 认为 explore 扫描目录结构和 file 操作（read/write/list/search）语义更接近，应该放在 `file` 下或者作为独立顶级工具。\n\n---\n\n## 你的裁定？\n\n两条路径：\n\n| 方案 A (D01) | 方案 B (D02 隐含) |\n|---|---|\n| `exec/explore` | `file/explore` 或独立顶级 |\n| 扫描=执行分析 | 扫描=文件发现 |\n| 与当前代码一致 | 语义更直观 |\n\n你倾向哪个？"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":595,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":188032,"output_tokens":412,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"63a6cb58-cb78-425c-a568-6a4bc76be19c","timestamp":"2026-05-14T14:18:09.848Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
