{"parentUuid":"fc5b8892-5c21-4fdf-b563-41a6f6151033","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","promptId":"af31fe37-1771-41a4-a5fb-e0cd99047260","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"在早前的design中，explore工具并不存在。我们通过ls等exec command进行执行。可之后发现1. ls不能告诉我们为什么ai需要这么做。我们设计了explore,并且要求：if you dont use explore tools first ，you cannot edit any files ，and this design make ai MUST explore all project and do next design/debug/coding.if not ,may them have no all seeing. ，所以在早期explore就单纯是一个工具。而目前由于我们的工具设计使用 tools-manager直接统一注册工具，那么实际上我个人认为explore 是一个tools,与edittools/webtools等同等级。且explore在agents的定义是预先探索而非一上来就read：files,explore我们未来也会设计快速建立code-map的映射，而非只是简单的ls/read的升级版。 user答辩完毕，抄送给teammate,并且邀请lead谈谈看法。"},"uuid":"330e41a6-c4ba-4f03-b302-0e32eef7874b","timestamp":"2026-05-14T14:22:58.644Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
