{"parentUuid":"3b5e6973-1034-492e-9a24-db61972508ea","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","promptId":"af31fe37-1771-41a4-a5fb-e0cd99047260","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"<teammate-message teammate_id=\"D02\" color=\"yellow\">\n{\"type\":\"idle_notification\",\"from\":\"D02\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-14T14:23:37.028Z\",\"idleReason\":\"available\"}\n</teammate-message>"},"uuid":"0c80d572-12ff-4c82-8930-159b6cd8d359","timestamp":"2026-05-14T14:23:53.358Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"0a555dd3-c4b3-41bf-bc2e-1d9ae56b0af9","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","message":{"id":"3c23995a-5af2-456f-bb77-500f87a98d59","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n## Lead 看法\n\nUSER 的裁定在架构层面完全正确。三个理由：\n\n**1. explore 是 gate 的前置条件，不是工具的子动作**\n\n`orchestrator/gates.rs` 的 `explore_gate` 检查\"是否已 explore 过才允许 edit\"。这意味着 explore 在编排层有**独立身份**——gate 需要知道\"explore 是否已经执行\"。如果 explore 是 exec 的子动作，gate 就必须解析 exec 的 action 参数才能知道是否执行过探索，削弱了 gate 的可审计性。\n\n**2. 独立顶级 = 未来可扩展**\n\nUSER 提到的 code-map 映射方向，如果 explore 埋在 exec/explore 下，扩展时只有两个选择：(a) 把 exec 变得更胖，或 (b) 把 explore 从 exec 里拆出来——这是不必要的增量 churn。ToolManager 统一注册模式下，独立顶级工具没有额外成本。\n\n**3. 工具层级应该是语义层级，而非代码结构层级**\n\n```\nedit tools     — 修改代码\nweb tools      — 获取外部信息\nexec tools     — 执行命令\nexplore tools  — 理解项目结构    ← 独立一等公民\nmeta tools     — 元操作（status/plan/task）\n```\n\nD01 把 explore 塞进 exec 的理由是\"当前代码 exec_exec 中已分派到 explore\"，这是从代码结构出发，不是从语义出发。重构的目标之一正是打破这种惯性。\n\n**裁定：explore 独立顶级工具，在 ToolManager 中与 exec/file/web/meta 同级注册。D01 修正设计。**"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":566,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":191232,"output_tokens":379,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"3b5e6973-1034-492e-9a24-db61972508ea","timestamp":"2026-05-14T14:23:53.343Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
