{"parentUuid":"a4659275-8e43-474f-aabe-2889b353bb6e","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","message":{"id":"1a4e82b9-baca-460c-9b09-c2d01d9bfffd","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is making a sophisticated proposal for addressing the 400 problem at its root cause: JSON assembly errors. Their idea has three parts:\n\n1. **ToolManager unified forwarding** - All tool results must go through ToolManager, which acts as a gate before the result flows back into the message stream.\n\n2. **State machine for message flow** - A state machine that enforces: exec or other tool must complete and return result before JSON can continue to be assembled. This prevents orphan tool_use/tool_result problems.\n\n3. **HP-side mock/simulation server** - Before sending JSON to the real API, HP runs it through a local validator that simulates the API's validation. If the mock server detects invalid JSON (missing tool_result, consecutive same-role messages), it returns a simulated 400. The system can then re-assemble or report the error to the user before wasting an API call.\n\nThis is essentially a \"pre-flight check\" pattern - validate locally before sending remotely. This is much stronger than the current approach because:\n- It catches errors client-side before any API call\n- It addresses the root cause (JSON assembly) rather than treating symptoms (400 errors)\n- The mock server is \"absolutely correct\" because it only checks structural invariants that are well-defined\n\nThe relevant team members for this:\n- **C02** (ContextBuilder/ContextAssembler - JSON assembly)\n- **B02** (HP client.rs - sends JSON to API)\n- **B03** (gate.rs - pre-API validation)  \n- **C01** (orchestrator - message flow control)\n- **D01** (ToolManager - tool result forwarding)\n\nLet me distribute the user's proposal to these members for analysis.","signature":"1a4e82b9-baca-460c-9b09-c2d01d9bfffd"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1047,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":212480,"output_tokens":3547,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"629cad68-1f8b-443a-ae06-3c76ce3ab743","timestamp":"2026-05-14T14:38:57.482Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"629cad68-1f8b-443a-ae06-3c76ce3ab743","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","message":{"id":"1a4e82b9-baca-460c-9b09-c2d01d9bfffd","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_00_EtYvxStFaDQmOqWbtNOn5508","name":"SendMessage","input":{"summary":"USER 400根因方案：HP模拟伺服器+状态机+ToolManager转发","message":"## USER 关于 400 根因的新方案\n\nUSER 指出：**400 问题本质是 JSON 拼凑错误问题**。引申义：如何确保 JSON 不会拼错？\n\nUSER 提出三点方案，请你们逐一分析裁决：\n\n### 方案 1：ToolManager 统一转发 tool result\n不是由 Agent 直接拼 tool_result 进 messages，而是由 ToolManager 作为唯一出口——工具执行完毕后，ToolManager 统一将 result 格式化为标准 tool_result 块返回给 Agent 的 conversation 层。杜绝了 Agent 自行拼凑 tool_result 时可能出现的格式错误。\n\n### 方案 2：消息流状态机\n设计一个状态机，exec 或其他工具不完成并返回 result 时，**禁止继续流转 JSON**。即：消息拼凑是有顺序的状态转换，非法状态（如 tool_use 未完成就继续拼下一个 user 消息）被状态机拒绝。\n\n### 方案 3：HP 模拟伺服器（Mock Server）\n在 HP 收到 Agent 发来的 JSON 后，发送到真实 API **之前**，先经过一个本地模拟伺服器。这个模拟伺服器：\n- 检查拼凑顺序（无非就是没有拼凑 tool_result 或连续两个 user/assistant 消息被发出）\n- **绝对正确**——只检查结构不变量（消息交替性、tool_use/tool_result 配对），不依赖启发式\n- 如果检测到不合规 → 直接返回模拟 400\n- 如果在模拟伺服器被拦截 → HP 不发送到真实 API，而是：(a) 重新拼凑，或 (b) 告知 USER error 需要重传\n\n### 请分析\n\nB02（HP/client.rs）：这个模拟伺服器应该在 HP 的哪个位置？是在 `chat_stream()` 调用前？还是作为 HP 内部的一个独立校验层？对性能影响？\n\nB03（HP/gate.rs）：模拟伺服器和你现有的 `check_gate`/`validate_anthropic_messages` 是什么关系？是替代它还是增强它？\n\nC01（orchestrator）：方案 2 的状态机——编排器是否已经有类似机制（Turn+Step）？方案 1 的 ToolManager 统一转发是否与你现有的 tool_dispatch 流程冲突？\n\nC02（conversation）：方案 2 的状态机直接用 ContextAssembler 的 Turn+Step 模型就能实现吗？还是需要新增一个独立的状态机？\n\nD01（ToolManager）：方案 1 的 ToolManager 统一转发 tool result——你的 IPC 框架中 Tools 返回 ToolResult 后，是谁负责把它拼成 Message::tool()？如果是 Agent 侧拼，是否应该改为 Tools 侧统一拼好再返回？\n\n请各自裁决，通过我转达 USER。","to":"B02","type":"message","recipient":"B02","content":"## USER 关于 400 根因的新方案\n\nUSER 指出：**400 问题本质是 JSON 拼凑错误问题**。引申义：如何确保 JSON 不会拼错？\n\nUSER 提出三点方案，请你们逐一分析裁决：\n\n### 方案 1：ToolManager 统一转发 tool result\n不是由 Agent 直接拼 tool_result 进 messages，而是由 ToolManager 作为唯一出口——工具执行完毕后，ToolManager 统一将 result 格式化为标准 tool_result 块返回给 Agent 的 conversation 层。杜绝了 Agent 自行拼凑 tool_result 时可能出现的格式错误。\n\n### 方案 2：消息流状态机\n设计一个状态机，exec 或其他工具不完成并返回 result 时，**禁止继续流转 JSON**。即：消息拼凑是有顺序的状态转换，非法状态（如 tool_use 未完成就继续拼下一个 user 消息）被状态机拒绝。\n\n### 方案 3：HP 模拟伺服器（Mock Server）\n在 HP 收到 Agent 发来的 JSON 后，发送到真实 API **之前**，先经过一个本地模拟伺服器。这个模拟伺服器：\n- 检查拼凑顺序（无非就是没有拼凑 tool_result 或连续两个 user/assistant 消息被发出）\n- **绝对正确**——只检查结构不变量（消息交替性、tool_use/tool_result 配对），不依赖启发式\n- 如果检测到不合规 → 直接返回模拟 400\n- 如果在模拟伺服器被拦截 → HP 不发送到真实 API，而是：(a) 重新拼凑，或 (b) 告知 USER error 需要重传\n\n### 请分析\n\nB02（HP/client.rs）：这个模拟伺服器应该在 HP 的哪个位置？是在 `chat_stream()` 调用前？还是作为 HP 内部的一个独立校验层？对性能影响？\n\nB03（HP/gate.rs）：模拟伺服器和你现有的 `check_gate`/`validate_anthropic_messages` 是什么关系？是替代它还是增强它？\n\nC01（orchestrator）：方案 2 的状态机——编排器是否已经有类似机制（Turn+Step）？方案 1 的 ToolManager 统一转发是否与你现有的 tool_dispatch 流程冲突？\n\nC02（conversation）：方案 2 的状态机直接用 ContextAssembler 的 Turn+Step 模型就能实现吗？还是需要新增一个独立的状态机？\n\nD01（ToolManager）：方案 1 的 ToolManager 统一转发 tool result——你的 IPC 框架中 Tools 返回 ToolResult 后，是谁负责把它拼成 Message::tool()？如果是 Agent 侧拼，是否应该改为 Tools 侧统一拼好再返回？\n\n请各自裁决，通过我转达 USER。"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1047,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":212480,"output_tokens":3547,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"65cfc21b-fdae-47fb-83e8-c769984998bb","timestamp":"2026-05-14T14:39:36.109Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
