{"parentUuid":"59f2eb2b-9418-4611-9783-57163568f7bf","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","message":{"id":"149d80f5-9850-4e0c-aec9-cd69ba7c6ea6","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"B02、B03 已到。C01、C02、D01 还在裁决中。\n\nB03 的关键修正：模拟伺服器不替代 gate，而是提纯——gate 保留薄层（HP 健康审计），伺服器接管结构不变量校验（从 API spec 推导，而非人工观察 400 模式）。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3084,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":218752,"output_tokens":93,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"a947ae3d-ac48-49df-9708-cd503c02bc21","timestamp":"2026-05-14T14:40:45.126Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"a947ae3d-ac48-49df-9708-cd503c02bc21","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","promptId":"53da9a2e-90a7-44c0-bc82-2dc7b24a612a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"<teammate-message teammate_id=\"D01\" color=\"green\" summary=\"D01 评估 tool_result 归属方案 1：增 ToolResultMessage 帧\">\n## 方案 1 分析：ToolResult 是否应包含完整 tool_message？\n\n### 当前设计中的 ToolResult 缺少两个字段\n\n当前 `ToolResult { success: bool, content: String }` 缺少：\n- `tool_call_id` — 与请求 `id` 对应\n- `is_error` — Anthropic 协议区分 error\n\n需要扩充为：\n\n```rust\npub struct ToolResultMessage {\n    pub id: String,\n    pub name: String,\n    pub action: String,\n    pub success: bool,\n    pub content: String,\n    pub is_error: Option<bool>,\n}\n```\n\n新增 IPC 帧：`tool_result_message`\n\n### 与 C01 tool_dispatch 无冲突\n\ntool_dispatch 的 health/phase_check/tracking 逻辑是 Agent 侧业务，与 Message 构造无关。Tools 输出 `ToolResultMessage` 后，Agent 提取 `content` 推入 conv 即可，业务逻辑不变。\n\n### 推荐：增加 tool_result_message 帧\n\nTools 负责格式化，Agent 保留 gate/tracking 控制权。两不相扰。\n</teammate-message>\n\n<teammate-message teammate_id=\"C02\" color=\"red\" summary=\"C02 裁决：方案2/3 与 ContextAssembler 的关系\">\n## 方案 2：消息流状态机 — Turn+Step 已经实现了吗？\n\n**答案是：是的，但历史 400 仍有两条绕过路径。**\n\n### Turn+Step 已经是状态机\n\nContextAssembler 的 Turn+Step 模型本质就是一个 explicit 状态机：\n\n```\n状态                             合法输入                         下一状态\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nEmpty                            push_user(text)                 HasUser\nHasUser                          push_assistant(msg)             HasAssistant\nHasAssistant (无 tool_calls)     push_user(text)                 HasUser (新 Turn)\nHasAssistant (有 tool_calls)     push_tool_result(id, result)    HasToolResult\nHasToolResult (未全部满足)        push_tool_result(id, result)    HasToolResult\nHasToolResult (已全部满足)        push_assistant(msg)             HasAssistant (新 Step)\nHasToolResult (已全部满足)        push_user(text)                 HasUser (新 Turn)\n```\n\n而且不变量是**类型级强制**的——不是运行时 assert，而是数据结构让非法状态无法构造（Step 内的 assistant + tool_results 必须配对）。\n\n### 为什么 v3.4.1 仍有 orphan tool_use 400？\n\n历史 400 发生在 **v3.x，那时 ContextAssembler 还不存在**。现在的 v4 设计在 v3 的教训之上重建。但是——即使现在——仍有**五条绕过路径**：\n\n| 绕过路径 | 文件位置 | 危险等级 |\n|---------|---------|---------|\n| 1. `push_user_unchecked()` | conversation.rs:214 | **高** — 无条件跳转，跳过交替性检查 |\n| 2. `push_assistant_unchecked()` | conversation.rs:254 | **高** — 在空 turn 中注入假 user(\"\")，跳过验证 |\n| 3. `from_legacy()` | conversation.rs:512 | **中** — 虽然会注入 [ERROR] 修补孤 tool_use，但这是事后修复 |\n| 4. `to_anthropic_messages()` 不验证 | conversation.rs:374 | **严重设计缺陷** — 不检查 all_tools_satisfied()，直接展平输出 |\n| 5. `last_turn_mut()` 暴露内部 | conversation.rs:475 | **低** — 但调用方可直接操作 Turn/Step 字段 |\n\n**关键漏洞是 #4**：`to_anthropic_messages()` 不检查 step 是否完整。如果 Step 有 tool_calls 但 tool_results 为空，assistant 消息会被发出但缺少对应的 tool_result user 消息——直接导致 400。\n\n```rust\n// conversation.rs:395-440 — 当前有问题的输出逻辑\nfor step in &turn.steps {\n    out.push(AnthropicMessage { role: \"assistant\", content: blocks_with_tool_use });\n\n    if !step.tool_results.is_empty() {  // ← 如果为空，此处不发 user(tool_result)\n        out.push(AnthropicMessage { role: \"user\", content: tool_result_blocks });\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 修复方案\n\n在 `to_anthropic_messages()` 中加入防御：\n\n```rust\npub fn to_anthropic_messages(&self) -> (Option<String>, Vec<AnthropicMessage>) {\n    // 前置防御：检查所有 step 的完整性\n    for turn in &self.turns {\n        for step in &turn.steps {\n            debug_assert!(step.all_tools_satisfied(),\n                \"BUG: to_anthropic_messages called with unsatisfied tool_uses\");\n        }\n    }\n    // ... 原有代码\n}\n```\n\n**并且**：在 agent_loop.rs (C01) 中，每次调用 `to_anthropic_messages()` 前必须调用 `ready_for_api()`。当前没有任何调用点强制这个顺序——这是流程漏洞。\n\n---\n\n## 方案 3：HP 模拟伺服器 — 与 validate() 的关系\n\n**答案是：validate() 可以直接作为模拟伺服器的校验核心。两者检查相同的不变量。**\n\n### 重叠分析\n\n| 检查 | ContextAssembler::validate() | gate.rs (模拟伺服器的雏形) |\n|------|------------------------------|---------------------------|\n| 连续 user 消息 | ✓ (Turn+Step 类型级强制) | ✓ validate_anthropic_messages() |\n| 连续 assistant 消息 | ✓ | ✓ |\n| 孤立 tool_use | ✓ (Type level) | ✓ check_alternation() |\n| 孤立 tool_result | ✓ (tool_call_id 匹配) | ✓ check_alternation() |\n| Turn 未完成 | ✓ | ✓ ready_for_api() |\n| 有 tool_use 无 thinking | — | ✓ (仅 log::warn 软警告) |\n| JSON 序列化校验 | — | — |\n| 模拟 API 格式转换 | — | ✓ to_anthropic_messages() dry-run |\n\n重叠率约 **80%**。差异在于 gate.rs 做了 Anthropic 格式的模拟转换和 thinking/soft check。\n\n### 建议架构\n\n模拟伺服器不需要独立实现。直接以 `ContextAssembler` 为中心：\n\n```\nagent_loop.rs (C01)\n  │\n  ├── 1. push_user / push_assistant / push_tool_result\n  │       │  (状态机强制不变量)\n  │       ▼\n  ├── 2. ready_for_api()?    ← 第一道门（业务级检查）\n  │       │\n  │       ▼\n  ├── 3. gate::check_gate()  ← 第二道门（模拟伺服器）\n  │       │   ├── assembler.validate()         ← 调取同样的验证\n  │       │   ├── to_anthropic_messages() dry-run\n  │       │   └── JSON 序列化校验（额外）\n  │       │\n  │       ▼\n  └── 4. client.rs POST\n```\n\ngate.rs 作为\"模拟伺服器\"的角色，复用 validate() 作为核心，再加上：\n- Anthropic 格式 dry-run (已有)\n- JSON 序列化 dry-run (需新增)\n- 异常路径日志和上报 (需新增)\n\n这样 validate() 和 gate 不是竞争关系，而是**分层防御**：\n- validate() = 领域层完整性 (Turn+Step 级别)\n- gate = 传输层完整性 (Anthropic JSON 级别)\n\n**总结: 方案 2 的状态机已由 Turn+Step 实现但有 5 条绕过路径需要封闭; 方案 3 的模拟伺服器可以直接以 validate() 为核心，gate.rs 加上 JSON 层检查即可满足需求。**\n\n</teammate-message>\n\n<teammate-message teammate_id=\"D01\" color=\"green\">\n{\"type\":\"idle_notification\",\"from\":\"D01\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-14T14:41:09.447Z\",\"idleReason\":\"available\"}\n</teammate-message>\n\n<teammate-message teammate_id=\"C02\" color=\"red\">\n{\"type\":\"idle_notification\",\"from\":\"C02\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-14T14:41:10.250Z\",\"idleReason\":\"available\"}\n</teammate-message>"},"uuid":"f2076207-bb6b-471f-9f6a-51abbc2dbbc9","timestamp":"2026-05-14T14:41:11.258Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"f2076207-bb6b-471f-9f6a-51abbc2dbbc9","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","message":{"id":"08f9c823-0cc3-4981-86e0-0536590e8ab8","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"D01 and C02 are in. C01 still need to submit. Let me wait for C01.\n\nC02 found critical vulnerability - 5 bypass paths including the #4 `to_anthropic_messages()` doesn't check all_tools_satisfied() - this is a serious design flaw that needs fixing.\n\nLet me also check if C01 has responded yet.","signature":"08f9c823-0cc3-4981-86e0-0536590e8ab8"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1969,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":221824,"output_tokens":120,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"5a4314f7-6549-4501-957f-40e667602b82","timestamp":"2026-05-14T14:41:15.869Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"5a4314f7-6549-4501-957f-40e667602b82","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","message":{"id":"08f9c823-0cc3-4981-86e0-0536590e8ab8","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"D01、C02 已到。C02 发现关键漏洞——`to_anthropic_messages()` 不检查 step 完整性，5 条绕过路径。等 C01 裁决。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1969,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":221824,"output_tokens":120,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"44609967-5e12-4555-8483-687379cd4f4a","timestamp":"2026-05-14T14:41:17.136Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"44609967-5e12-4555-8483-687379cd4f4a","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","promptId":"53da9a2e-90a7-44c0-bc82-2dc7b24a612a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"<teammate-message teammate_id=\"C01\" color=\"cyan\" summary=\"C01 rulings: 方案1 → ToolResultAppender (not ToolManager, which shouldnt know ContextAssembler); 方案2 → state machine enforcement at the data-structure level (reject push_user/push_assistant when pending tools exist); ask_user flow needs pre-recognition to avoid partial state\">\n## C01 裁决：方案 1 + 方案 2\n\n### 方案 1：ToolManager 统一转发 tool result\n\n**现状追溯：**\n\n当前 tool result 的写入链路（`response_processor.rs`）：\n\n```\nexecute_tool(&name, &args)  →  returns String (raw)\n    ↓\napp.push_tool(&tc.id, &result)  →  Message::tool(tc_id, result) → ContextAssembler\n```\n\n这个 `push_tool` 调用在 `response_processor.rs` 中出现了 **3 次**（Safe 路径 L143、skip_all 路径 L188、confirm 路径 L78），外加 `spawn_exec_async` 的回调中也推送结果。这是**分散的、手动的、容易遗漏的**——如果某个代码路径忘调 `push_tool`，就产生 orphan tool_use。\n\n**裁决：不应交给 ToolManager，但应提取为 ContextWriter**\n\n理由：\n1. **ToolManager 不知 ContextAssembler**——ToolManager 属于 Tools 域，它不应当知道 `Message::tool()` 或 ContextAssembler 的内部结构。这是职责分离问题。\n2. **ToolManager 不应持有 ContextAssembler 的引用**——ContextAssembler 是 Agent 的核心状态，跨进程传给 Tools 会导致状态同步灾难。\n3. **但当前 orchestrator 的 `push_tool` 调用过于分散**——这是 bug 根源。\n\n**方案：引入 `ToolResultAppender`，一个封装了\"工具结果→ContextAssembler 追加\"的单一入口：**\n\n```rust\n// 在 orchestrator/tool_exec.rs 中（新文件）\npub struct ToolResultAppender<'a> {\n    ctx: &'a mut ContextAssembler,\n    app: &'a mut App,\n}\n\nimpl ToolResultAppender {\n    /// 唯一的工具结果写入入口。\n    /// 调用者提供原始结果，Appender 封装 Message 创建 + 上下文更新。\n    pub fn append(&mut self, tc_id: &str, tool_name: &str, raw: &str) {\n        let failed = raw.starts_with(\"[ERROR]\") || raw.starts_with(\"[FAIL]\");\n        let result = wrap_tool_result(tool_name, raw);\n        \n        // 写入 ContextAssembler\n        self.ctx.push_tool(tc_id, &result);\n        \n        // 副作用（不要求严格一致性）\n        self.app.tool_results.push((tool_name.to_string(), result.clone()));\n        tracker::track_tool_code(self.app, tool_name, args, raw);\n        // ... health recording, file tracking, etc.\n    }\n}\n```\n\n这样：\n- 所有 tool result 写入通过**同一个方法**\n- 没有代码路径可以\"忘记\"调 `push_tool`\n- ContextAssembler 的封装性不被破坏\n- ToolManager 不做它不该做的事\n\n### 方案 2：消息流状态机强制\n\n**现状分析：**\n\nContextAssembler 的 Turn+Step 模型确实能**检测** orphan tool_use，但当前是**被动检测而非主动禁止**：\n\n```\nContextAssembler 的方法         | 禁止 orphan？| 机制\npush_user(content)              |     NO      | 允许在未完成工具轮次时推入用户消息\npush_assistant(msg)             |     NO      | 允许在未完成工具轮次时推入下一条助理消息\npush_tool(id, result)           |     NO      | 允许推入（但必须由外部确保配对）\nvalidate()                      |    YES      | 在调用时检查结构\nready_for_api()                 |    YES      | 在调用时检查是否所有工具已回填\n```\n\n**问题根源：强制执行只在编排器的 mode guard，不在数据结构层。**\n\n举个例子：如果有一个代码路径在 `push_assistant(raw_message)` 之后直接 return 了，或者用户通过 `/bypass` 之类的命令绕过了 mode guard，ContextAssembler 本身不会拒绝后续的 `push_user()`——于是产生 invalid state。\n\n**USER 的方案对了一半。** ContextAssembler 应该**在数据结构层主动禁止**向未完成工具轮次中追加消息：\n\n```rust\nimpl ContextAssembler {\n    /// 如果当前 turn 有未完成的 tool_calls，则拒绝 push_user。\n    /// 这从数据结构层面保证不会产生 consecutive user + orphan tool_use。\n    pub fn push_user(&mut self, content: &str) -> Result<(), ContextError> {\n        if let Some(last_turn) = self.turns.last() {\n            if last_turn.has_unfulfilled_tool_calls() {\n                return Err(ContextError::PendingTools(\n                    \"Cannot push user message: last assistant has unfulfilled tool calls\".into()\n                ));\n            }\n        }\n        // ... normal push\n    }\n    \n    /// 同上，拒绝在未完成工具时 push_assistant。\n    pub fn push_assistant(&mut self, msg: Message) -> Result<(), ContextError> {\n        if let Some(last_turn) = self.turns.last() {\n            if last_turn.has_unfulfilled_tool_calls() {\n                return Err(ContextError::PendingTools(\n                    \"Cannot push new assistant: last assistant has unfulfilled tool calls\".into()\n                ));\n            }\n        }\n        // ... normal push\n    }\n}\n\npub struct Turn {\n    // ...\n    steps: Vec<Step>,\n}\n\nimpl Turn {\n    /// 检查是否有 tool_use 没有对应的 tool_result。\n    pub fn has_unfulfilled_tool_calls(&self) -> bool {\n        self.steps.iter().any(|s| s.has_unfulfilled_tool_calls())\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**这里有个微妙之处：ask_user 路径。**\n\n当前 ask_user 的流程是：\n1. `push_assistant(raw_message)` — 推入带 tool_calls 的 assistant\n2. 处理工具：一部分取消（推 cancelled tool_result），一部分转到 needs_confirm\n3. 切换到 Mode::IntentPicker ← 不回加到 agent loop\n4. 用户选择 → 确认/拒绝 → 然后才继续\n\n在步骤 2 结束到步骤 4 完成之间，context 处于\"部分工具已回填\"的状态。如果步骤 2 的 `push_tool` 被 `ToolResultAppender` 统一管理+`has_unfulfilled_tool_calls()` 在数据结构层禁止，那么 ask_user 路径需要作以下调整：\n\n**ask_user 的特殊处理：**\n- 当前：先推 assistant，然后逐个处理 tool_calls\n- 改正：**在推 assistant 之前*就识别出 ask_user*，如果是 ask_user，先处理完所有取消再推 assistant + tool_results 的完整块**\n\n这样 context 永远不会处于部分完成状态。\n\n### 总结\n\n| 方案 | 裁决 | 原因 |\n|------|------|------|\n| 方案 1: ToolManager 转发 | **否决 ToolManager，接受 ToolResultAppender** | ToolManager 属于 Tools 域，不应知道 Message/ContextAssembler；但需要单一写入入口消除分散的 push_tool |\n| 方案 2: 状态机强制 | **接受，但需强化** | ContextAssembler 的 `push_user()`/`push_assistant()` 应在数据结构层拒绝违反 alternation 的调用，而非依赖编排器 mode guard 的\"围栏\" |\n| 补充: ask_user 路径 | **需前置识别** | 在 push_assistant 之前识别出 ask_user，处理完所有取消后再一次性推入完整块，避免中间状态 |\n\n</teammate-message>\n\n<teammate-message teammate_id=\"C01\" color=\"cyan\">\n{\"type\":\"idle_notification\",\"from\":\"C01\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-14T14:41:31.961Z\",\"idleReason\":\"available\"}\n</teammate-message>"},"uuid":"c1895a91-7875-452e-ac19-1dc4e61e241d","timestamp":"2026-05-14T14:41:46.880Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
