{"parentUuid":"c1895a91-7875-452e-ac19-1dc4e61e241d","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","message":{"id":"e55b462f-340f-4fe7-ae03-4705f4134019","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All 5 reviewers have submitted their rulings. Let me summarize the combined analysis for the user.\n\nKey points:\n\n**方案 1: ToolManager 统一转发**\n- D01: 同意，增加 ToolResultMessage IPC 帧\n- C01: 否决 ToolManager 做这件事（跨域职责混乱），但接受 ToolResultAppender 作为单一写入入口\n- B02: 中立，对 HP 无影响\n\n**方案 2: 消息流状态机**\n- C01: 接受但需强化——push_user/push_assistant 在数据结构层主动拒绝，而非依赖编排器 mode guard\n- C02: Turn+Step 已经是状态机，但有 5 条绕过路径（尤其是 to_anthropic_messages() 不检查 all_tools_satisfied()）\n- B02: 状态机已在 ContextAssembler，HP 仍需自己轻量验证\n\n**方案 3: HP 模拟伺服器**\n- B02: HP 内 opt-in 调试层，在 hp_gate 之后 chat_stream 之前，<1ms 性能开销\n- B03: 替代 validate_anthropic_messages 的实现，gate 保留薄层。invariant 从 API spec 推导\n- C02: validate() 可直接用作模拟伺服器核心，两者检查相同不变量。但 C02 发现了关键漏洞 #4\n\nNow I need to synthesize these into a coherent response. The biggest insight is that all three proposals are valid but need adjustments:\n\n1. ToolManager 转发 → ToolResultAppender (C01's improvement)\n2. 状态机 → 已在但需强化（封闭绕过路径 + 数据结构层主动拒绝）\n3. 模拟伺服器 → opt-in 调试层，validate() 为核心，gate 保留 thin layer\n\nAlso C02 found the critical bug: `to_anthropic_messages()` doesn't check step completeness.","signature":"e55b462f-340f-4fe7-ae03-4705f4134019"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1888,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":223744,"output_tokens":1087,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"d1914af9-eb36-4beb-a39a-39ab9be23d5b","timestamp":"2026-05-14T14:42:02.028Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","s