{"parentUuid":"f13514cf-db97-4172-997a-33b5137624de","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","message":{"id":"f2f8e321-cbf0-4f16-819e-9f2f96d5c0e5","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"现在我已掌握全部关键路径。以下是完整的上下文流转模拟：\n\n---\n\n# 一次完整轮次的上下文流转\n\n用户输入 `\"refactor config.rs — extract the profile system into a separate struct\"` 到 AI 返回最终回复。\n\n---\n\n## 阶段 0：用户输入 → send_message\n\n```\nTUI (E02 handle_chat_key)\n  │  Enter 键\n  │  InputAction::SendMessage\n  ▼\nE01 event loop\n  │  app.send_message(tx)\n  ▼\norchestrator/agent_loop::handle_send_message()\n  │  1. 生成 session seed\n  │  2. 扫描 skill 匹配\n  │  3. 调用 app.start_agent_loop()\n  ▼\nContextAssembler 当前状态：\n  Turn 0: user(\"修复 bug\") → assistant(已响应, 工具已完成)\n  Turn 1: user(\"refactor config.rs — ...\")\n```\n\n## 阶段 1：上下文拼凑（prepare_and_compact）—— **第一个 JSON 拼凑点**\n\n```\nagent_loop::handle_start_agent_loop()\n  │\n  ├── app.sync_messages()          ← 从 ContextAssembler 提取扁平消息\n  │     self.messages = self.ctx.to_vec()\n  │\n  ├── app.repair_messages()         ← 修复孤儿 tool_use/tool_result\n  │     ContextAssembler::from_legacy() → 自动注入 [ERROR] 修复\n  │\n  ├── ContextBuilder::build()       ← 4 层组装（**核心拼凑**）\n  │     Layer 0: System prompt (EN, ~500 tokens)     ───┐\n  │     Layer 1: SemanticMemory::render() (~1500)       │\n  │     Layer 2: PitfallGuide::render(3) (~300)         │ 稳定层\n  │     Layer 2: Skill bodies (~200)                    │\n  │     Layer 3: compact_context(messages)               │ 可变层\n  │       │                                              │\n  │       ├── L1: 截断长输出（>40% token）              │\n  │       ├── L2: 卡片化旧轮次（>50%）                  │\n  │       ├── L3: 仅保留最近 3 轮（>65%）               │\n  │       └── L4: 仅保留最近 1 轮（>80%）          ───┘\n  │     输出: Vec<Message> (所有层的扁平列表)\n  │\n  ├── token_estimate / token_breakdown ← 统计\n  │\n  └── 输出: prepared: Vec<Message> (system + semantic + backbone + episodic)\n```\n\n**产物：`Vec<Message>`** — 一个扁平的混合列表，`role` 混有 system/user/assistant/tool\n\n---\n\n## 阶段 2：gate 校验（Pre-flight）—— **干跑模拟**\n\n```\nhandle_start_agent_loop()\n  │\n  ├── GateContext {\n  │     assembler: &app.ctx,          ← ContextAssembler（Turn+Step 模型）\n  │     has_orphan_tool_uses: ...     ← HP 健康标志\n  │   }\n  │\n  ├── check_gate(&gate_ctx)\n  │     │\n  │     ├── 1. assembler.validate()         ← Turn+Step 层面的不变量\n  │     │       检查: 交替性、Step 完整性、tool_call_id 匹配\n  │     │\n  │     ├── 2. assembler.ready_for_api()    ← 所有 Turn 完成？有 pending tool？\n  │     │\n  │     ├── 3. assembler.to_anthropic_messages()  ← **关键干跑**\n  │     │       │\n  │     │       │  Turn+Step → AnthropicMessage 转换：\n  │     │       │  user(\"refactor config.rs\")\n  │     │       │    → assistant(tool_use: read_file id=call_1)\n  │     │       │    → user(tool_result id=call_1)\n  │     │       │    → assistant(tool_use: write_file id=call_2)\n  │     │       │    → user(tool_result id=call_2)\n  │     │       │  user(\"refactor config.rs — extract...\")\n  │     │       │\n  │     │       └── validate_anthropic_messages()\n  │     │            检查: 连续同角色？空列表？tool_use 无 thinking？\n  │     │\n  │     └── 4. has_orphan_tool_uses?\n  │\n  ├── Pass → 继续 / Block → 拦截，告知用户 /fix\n  │\n  └── mode = Mode::Streaming\n```\n\n**关键：** gate 只在 Agent 进程内运行，干跑 `to_anthropic_messages()`。如果这里有 bug，gate 和被检查者共用同一份代码，缺陷会被掩盖。\n\n---\n\n## 阶段 3：Agent → HP IPC → 真实 API 请求 —— **第二个 JSON 拼凑点**\n\n```\nhandle_start_agent_loop()\n  │\n  ├── 配置 model + max_tokens + tools + thinking\n  │\n  ├── 获取 Anthropic tools 定义列表\n  │     tools_for_phase(phase) → Vec<ToolDef>\n  │\n  ├── 构建 ApiRequest → 通过 TCP 发给 HP\n  │     {\n  │       request_id: \"req_001\",\n  │       provider: \"DeepSeek\",\n  │       model: \"deepseek-v4-pro\",\n  │       messages: prepared,           ← Vec<Message>（从 ContextBuilder 输出）\n  │       tools: [...],                 ← Vec<ToolDef>\n  │       extra_params: { effort: \"high\", max_tokens: 96000 }\n  │     }\n  │\n  ▼\nHP client.rs\n  │\n  ├── hp_gate() 轻量形状检查（非空、key 合法）\n  │\n  ├── convert_messages(prepared) → Vec<AnthropicMessage>\n  │     │\n  │     │  将 Vec<Message> → Anthropic API 格式：\n  │     │  - system 消息合并为一个 system 参数\n  │     │  - tool_result 消息合并到前面 assistant 轮次中\n  │     │  - role \"tool\" → Anthropic user(tool_result)\n  │     │\n  │     └── 产物: Vec<AnthropicMessage>\n  │\n  ├── 构建 AnthropicRequest JSON\n  │     {\n  │       model: \"deepseek-v4-pro\",\n  │       max_tokens: 96000,\n  │       stream: true,\n  │       system: \"<system prompt>\\n<semantic memory>\\n<pitfalls>\",\n  │       messages: [\n  │         { role: \"user\", content: \"修复 bug\" },\n  │         { role: \"assistant\", content: [thinking, text, tool_use: read_file] },\n  │         { role: \"user\", content: [tool_result: read_file] },\n  │         { role: \"assistant\", content: [thinking, text, tool_use: write_file] },\n  │         { role: \"user\", content: [tool_result: write_file] },\n  │         { role: \"user\", content: \"refactor config.rs — extract...\" }\n  │       ],\n  │       tools: [...],\n  │       thinking: { type: \"enabled\", budget_tokens: 8192 }\n  │     }\n  │\n  ├── POST https://api.deepseek.com/anthropic/messages\n  │\n  └── SSE 流式返回\n```\n\n**这里有两个拼凑操作，各有可能出错：**\n1. `convert_messages()` — Message → AnthropicMessage 转换（可能制造连续同角色）\n2. `AnthropicRequest` 序列化 — 拼 JSON（可能产生格式错误）\n\n---\n\n## 阶段 4：SSE 流式处理 → tool_call 提取\n\n```\nstream_handler::handle_stream_event()\n  │\n  ├── ContentBlockDelta → push 到 stream_content\n  ├── ReasoningDelta    → push 到 stream_reasoning\n  ├── ToolUseProgress   → push 到 stream_tool_progress\n  ├── StreamDone(raw_message, usage)\n  │     │\n  │     │  raw_message: Message {\n  │     │    role: \"assistant\",\n  │     │    content: \"I'll start by reading config.rs...\",\n  │     │    reasoning_content: \"Let me understand the current...\",\n  │     │    thinking_signature: \"dsc-...\",\n  │     │    tool_calls: Some([\n  │     │      ToolCall { id: \"call_1\", function: { name: \"read_file\", args: {\"path\":\"src/config.rs\"} } },\n  │     │      ToolCall { id: \"call_2\", function: { name: \"read_file\", args: {\"path\":\"src/types.rs\"} } }\n  │     │    ])\n  │     │  }\n  │     │\n  │     └── finalize_stream_response(app, raw_message, usage, tx)\n  │\n  └── StreamError(msg) → 错误处理\n```\n\n---\n\n## 阶段 5：response_processor → 工具执行 —— **第三个 JSON 拼凑点**\n\n```\nfinalize_stream_response()\n  │\n  ├── app.ctx.push_assistant(raw_message)    ← 推入 ContextAssembler\n  │     │\n  │     │  Turn 1: user(\"refactor config.rs...\")\n  │     │    └─ Step 0: assistant(read_file[call_1], read_file[call_2])  ← 新 Step\n  │     │         tool_results: []                                         ← 待回填\n  │     │\n  │     └── dirty = true\n  │\n  ├── 提取 tool_calls: [call_1(read_file), call_2(read_file)]\n  │\n  ├── 遍历 tool_calls:\n  │     │\n  │     ├── call_1: read_file(\"src/config.rs\")\n  │     │   │  SafetyLevel::Safe → 直接执行\n  │     │   │  execute_tool(\"read_file\", {\"path\":\"src/config.rs\"})\n  │     │   │  → \"[OK]\\nuse std::...\\npub struct Config {...}\"\n  │     │   │\n  │     │   └── app.push_tool(\"call_1\", result)      ← **push tool_result**\n  │     │         │\n  │     │         │  self.ctx.push_tool_result(\"call_1\", result)\n  │     │         │    Step::push_tool_result() → 回填 tool_results vec\n  │     │         │\n  │     │         │  ToolResult {\n  │     │         │    tool_call_id: \"call_1\",\n  │     │         │    role: \"tool\",\n  │     │         │    content: \"[OK]\\nuse std::...\"\n  │     │         │  }\n  │     │         │\n  │     │         └── Step 0: tool_results = [call_1 ✓, call_2 ?]\n  │     │\n  │     └── call_2: read_file(\"src/types.rs\")\n  │         │  execute_tool(...) → \"[OK]\\n#[derive...]\\npub struct ...\"\n  │         │\n  │         └── app.push_tool(\"call_2\", result)      ← **push tool_result**\n  │               Step 0: tool_results = [call_1 ✓, call_2 ✓]  ← 完整\n  │\n  ├── session_persistence::maybe_save_session()\n  │\n  └── 继续循环 → start_agent_loop() → 新 API 请求\n```\n\n---\n\n## 阶段 6：第二轮 API 请求——上下文包含工具结果\n\n```\nstart_agent_loop()\n  │\n  ├── sync_messages() → ctx.to_vec()\n  │     [\n  │       system(\"...\"),\n  │       user(\"修复 bug\"), assistant, user(tool_result), ...\n  │       user(\"refactor config.rs...\"),\n  │       assistant(read_file[call_1, call_2]),\n  │       tool(\"call_1\", \"[OK]...\"),          ← 新增\n  │       tool(\"call_2\", \"[OK]...\"),          ← 新增\n  │     ]\n  │\n  ├── compact_context(...) → 可能裁剪，但最新轮次保留\n  │\n  ├── check_gate():\n  │     to_anthropic_messages():\n  │       user(\"refactor config.rs\")\n  │         → assistant(tool_use: read_file call_1)\n  │         → user(tool_result: call_1)       ✓\n  │         → assistant(tool_use: read_file call_2)\n  │         → user(tool_result: call_2)       ✓\n  │     validate_anthropic() → OK\n  │\n  ├── HP: convert_messages() → AnthropicRequest JSON\n  │\n  └── POST → SSE → 新 assistant(write_file[call_3]) → ...\n```\n\n---\n\n## 汇总：三个 JSON 拼凑点\n\n| 点 | 位置 | 操作 | 可能出错 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **P1** | `ContextBuilder::build()` | 拼 4 层消息为 `Vec<Message>` | 层序错误、重复注入 |\n| **P2** | `HP convert_messages()` | `Vec<Message>` → `Vec<AnthropicMessage>` | 连续同角色、孤儿 tool_use、system 合并错误 |\n| **P3** | `ContextAssembler::push_tool_result()` | tool_result 回填 Step | 回填了错误的 Step、漏回填、重复回填 |\n\n**三个点中，P2（HP convert_messages）和 P3（push_tool_result）是最脆弱的**。P2 是扁平列表→交替格式的转换，转换逻辑中的 bug 会导致 400。P3 是分散在多处的手动调用（response_processor 的 3 个不同路径），任何一个漏掉就产生孤儿。你说得对——这就是为什么需要封闭绕过路径，让这三个点变成**唯一的、不可绕过的入口**。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1809,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":244608,"output_tokens":3254,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details"