{"parentUuid":"ac20e7b6-d83d-4cc6-b0ad-0dd522fbeba4","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","message":{"id":"7e08ca39-af30-4f22-9690-84445355eec5","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Very clean! The dependencies are minimal:\n\nCommon to all: linux-vdso.so.1 (kernel), libgcc_s.so.1, libc.so.6, ld-linux-x86-64.so.2\n\ndsx-agent only adds: libstdc++.so.6 (because tokenizers crate uses C++ tokenizer)\n\ndsx-tui adds: libm.so.6 (math, probably for TUI rendering)\n\ndsx-tools adds: libm.so.6\n\nNo:\n- No OpenSSL/libssl\n- No TLS libraries\n- No systemd\n- No dbus\n- No graphical libraries (even dsx-tui uses ratatui which is pure terminal)\n\nBut wait — these use rustls, not OpenSSL, for HTTP requests. And they use reqwest with rustls feature. That means TLS is compiled in statically, not dynamically linked. The binaries should work on any modern Linux.\n\nFor LFS: They need glibc (libc.so.6), libgcc_s, and optionally libstdc++ (for dsx-agent's tokenizer). These are standard on any Linux system.\n\nFor extra portability, I should suggest building with MUSL target for a fully static binary.\n\nActually, the user's concerns are:\n1. No HTTPS - reqwest uses rustls which is compiled in, no external TLS dependency\n2. No TLS 1.3 issues - rustls handles this internally\n3. Dependencies - just glibc + libgcc_s + optionally libstdc++/libm\n\nTo ship to LFS:\n```bash\n# Just copy the 4 binaries + ensure glibc/libgcc_s/libstdc++/libm are on the target\nscp target/release/dsx-* user@lfs:/usr/local/bin/\n```\n\nOr for fully static:\n```bash\nrustup target add x86_64-unknown-linux-musl\ncargo build --release --target x86_64-unknown-linux-musl\n# Produces fully static binaries\n```","signature":"7e08ca39-af30-4f22-9690-84445355eec5"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":686,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":391168,"output_tokens":699,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"69713966-b61c-452e-9d8d-32de6ad075d1","timestamp":"2026-05-14T17:22:28.665Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"69713966-b61c-452e-9d8d-32de6ad075d1","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","message":{"id":"7e08ca39-af30-4f22-9690-84445355eec5","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"极度干净。零 TLS/SSL/HTTPS 动态依赖。\n\n```\ndsx-tui:   linux-vdso + libgcc_s + libm + libc      (4 libs)\ndsx-agent: linux-vdso + libstdc++ + libgcc_s + libm + libc  (5 libs, tokenizer C++ 需要 libstdc++)\ndsx-hp:    linux-vdso + libgcc_s + libc              (3 libs)\ndsx-tools: linux-vdso + libgcc_s + libm + libc       (4 libs)\n```\n\n**没有** OpenSSL、没有 libssl、没有 systemd、没有 dbus。TLS 全由 rustls 静态编译进二进制。\n\n丢到 LFS：装好 `glibc + libgcc_s + libstdc++`，4 个二进制直接 `scp` 过去就能跑。\n\n如果要彻底静态（连 libc 都不依赖）：\n```bash\nrustup target add x86_64-unknown-linux-musl\ncargo build --release --target x86_64-unknown-linux-musl\n```\n产物就是单个文件，扔到任何 Linux 都能跑。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":686,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":391168,"output_tokens":699,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"47ae3f9f-59bc-4c6d-9f74-7ec74031df40","timestamp":"2026-05-14T17:22:36.483Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
