{"parentUuid":"1fd2a3c7-ae59-4e7b-91c0-535f222f3732","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","attachment":{"type":"task_reminder","content":[],"itemCount":0},"type":"attachment","uuid":"e3aae041-aa69-44ff-a950-7e7d0487aba8","timestamp":"2026-05-14T17:23:00.248Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"e3aae041-aa69-44ff-a950-7e7d0487aba8","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","message":{"id":"db406852-2d33-4697-afc9-1982f8db91b1","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking whether we can merge all 4 binaries back into a single binary. Let me think about this...\n\nWe split from 1 binary to 4 for architectural reasons (process isolation, HP as daemon, sandboxing). But the user might want the option of a single-binary deployment for simplicity.\n\nActually, the key insight is: the 4 processes can all be in the same binary using subcommands or process forking. This is actually a common pattern - embed multiple processes in one binary and use CLI args to decide which to run. For example:\n\n```\ndsx --role hp       # runs the HP daemon\ndsx --role agent    # runs the agent\ndsx --role tools    # runs the tools server\ndsx --role tui      # runs the TUI (default)\n```\n\nEach \"role\" is launched as a separate process, but they all come from one binary. The TUI spawns child processes using the same binary with different arguments.\n\nThis gives us the best of both worlds:\n- Single binary deployment (copy one file)\n- Process isolation at runtime (each subprocess is a separate OS process)\n\nLet me suggest this.","signature":"db406852-2d33-4697-afc9-1982f8db91b1"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":214,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":392448,"output_tokens":407,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"f631582b-5576-4d56-ad3f-da022adb530e","timestamp":"2026-05-14T17:23:12.277Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857