{"parentUuid":"f631582b-5576-4d56-ad3f-da022adb530e","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx","message":{"id":"db406852-2d33-4697-afc9-1982f8db91b1","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"不是合并成一个进程——是 4 个进程**用一个二进制**，通过参数区分身份：\n\n```\n./dsx --role hp      # HP 守护进程\n./dsx --role agent   # Agent 核心\n./dsx --role tools   # 工具服务器\n./dsx --role tui     # TUI 前端（默认）\n```\n\nTUI 启动时 spawn 子进程：\n```rust\nCommand::new(std::env::current_exe()?)\n    .args([\"--role\", \"agent\"])\n    .spawn()\n```\n\n**好处：** LFS 上只放一个 ~12MB 的二进制，进程隔离不变。HP 崩溃 Agent 不受影响——因为是不同的 OS 进程，不是不同编译单元。\n\n要我改成这个模式吗？"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":214,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":392448,"output_tokens":407,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"e104ca13-ca0f-4167-910f-fd6142dd6774","timestamp":"2026-05-14T17:23:17.397Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
