{"parentUuid":"ed8c6dd1-c528-4f92-869a-f975a7366cc7","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"edited_text_file","filename":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/explore.md","snippet":"1\t# D01 设计文档：dsx-tools IPC 服务框架与系统工具\n2\t\n3\t> 日期: 2026-05-14 | 所属: Team D (dsx-tools) | 角色: D01 工具框架+系统工具\n4\t\n5\t---\n6\t\n7\t## 1. 现状分析\n8\t\n9\t现有 `src/dsx-tools/` 各文件已被阅读，核心观察：\n10\t\n11\t| 文件 | 问题 |\n12\t|------|------|\n13\t| `mod.rs` — ToolManager | 同步注册表，函数指针 `fn(&str)->String`，无法跨进程；超时基于 `mpsc::recv_timeout`，粒度粗 |\n14\t| `exec.rs` — 命令执行 | 内嵌安全检测（`is_danger_command`）；同步+异步共存；PTY 需特殊处理 |\n15\t| `explore.rs` — 扫描 | 依赖 `CANCEL` 全局变量，输出有 30KB cap |\n16\t| `git.rs` — Git 操作 | 4 个独立函数，各有独立 ToolDef |\n17\t| `web.rs` — 网络 | 需 `reqwest` 和 `html2text` 依赖，有 API key 硬编码 |\n18\t| `file.rs` — 文件操作 | 6 个 action 聚合在 `exec_file` 里，D02 负责 |\n19\t| `agent.rs` — 大代理分发器 | 21 个 action 全部通过 `match action` 分发，D03 负责拆解 |\n20\t\n21\t**核心结论**：当前架构是单进程同步模型，TUI 直接调用 `tools::execute_tool()`。目标是将 dsx-tools 改造为独立 IPC 服务进程，通过 JSON-LP 协议与 dsx-agent 或 dsx-tui 通信。\n22\t\n23\t---\n24\t\n25\t## 2. IPC 服务架构\n26\t\n27\t### 2.1 进程模型\n28\t\n29\t```\n30\t┌────────────────┐     JSON-LP (stdin/stdout)      ┌─────────────────────┐\n31\t│  dsx-agent     │  ◄══════════════════════════►   │  dsx-tools          │\n32\t│  (or dsx-tui)  │                                 │  (IPC Server)       │\n33\t│                │  ToolsInit / ToolCallReq /      │  ┌─────────────────┐│\n34\t│                │  ToolCancel / ToolsShutdown      │  │ ToolManager      ││\n35\t│                │  ◄───                           │  │ ├── router       ││\n36\t│                │  ToolsReady / ToolProgress /     │  │ ├── safety       ││\n37\t│                │  ToolResult / ToolError          │  │ ├── exec (D01)   ││\n38\t│                │  / ToolConfirmReq                │  │ ├── git (D01)    ││\n39\t│                │                                  │  │ ├── web (D01)    ││\n40\t└────────────────┘                                  │  │ ├── file (D02)   ││\n41\t                                                    │  │ └── agent (D03)  ││\n42\t                                                    │  └─────────────────┘│\n43\t                                                    └─────────────────────┘\n44\t```\n45\t\n46\t### 2.2 JSON-LP 协议帧\n47\t\n48\t所有帧以 `\\n` 分隔，每行一个完整 JSON 对象。\n49\t\n50\t**Agent → Tools:**\n51\t\n52\t```json\n53\t{\"type\":\"tools_init\",\"allowed_tools\":[\"exec\",\"file\",\"web\"],\"session_seed\":\"abc123\",\"auto_mode\":false}\n54\t{\"type\":\"tool_call_req\",\"id\":\"call_001\",\"name\":\"exec\",\"action\":\"run\",\"args\":{\"command\":\"ls -la\"},\"timeout_secs\":null}\n55\t{\"type\":\"tool_cancel\",\"id\":\"call_001\"}\n56\t{\"type\":\"tools_shutdown\"}\n57\t```\n58\t\n59\t**Tools → Agent:**\n60\t\n61\t```json\n62\t{\"type\":\"tools_ready\",\"tools\":[{\"name\":\"exec\",\"description\":\"...\",\"input_schema\":{...}},...]}\n63\t{\"type\":\"tool_progress\",\"id\":\"call_001\",\"content\":\"stdout line 1\\n\",\"stream_type\":\"stdout\"}\n64\t{\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"id\":\"call_001\",\"success\":true,\"content\":\"[OK] ...\"}\n65\t{\"type\":\"tool_error\",\"id\":\"call_001\",\"error\":\"Timed out after 30s\",\"code\":\"TIMEOUT\"}\n66\t{\"type\":\"tool_confirm_req\",\"id\":\"call_001\",\"tool_name\":\"exec\",\"action\":\"run\",\"danger_level\":\"danger\",\"prompt\":\"Run sudo rm -rf /?\"}\n67\t```\n68\t\n69\t### 2.3 Rust 类型定义\n70\t\n71\t```rust\n72\t// ── 入站帧（Agent → Tools）──\n73\t\n74\t#[derive(Debug, Deserialize)]\n75\t#[serde(tag = \"type\")]\n76\tpub enum InboundFrame {\n77\t    #[serde(rename = \"tools_init\")]\n78\t    Init {\n79\t        allowed_tools: Vec<String>,\n80\t        session_seed: String,\n81\t        auto_mode: bool,\n82\t    },\n83\t    #[serde(rename = \"tool_call_req\")]\n84\t    CallReq {\n85\t        id: String,\n86\t        name: String,\n87\t        action: String,\n88\t        args: serde_json::Value,\n89\t        timeout_secs: Option<u64>,\n90\t    },\n91\t    #[serde(rename = \"tool_cancel\")]\n92\t    Cancel {\n93\t        id: Option<String>,  // None = cancel all\n94\t    },\n95\t    #[serde(rename = \"tools_shutdown\")]\n96\t    Shutdown,\n97\t}\n98\t\n99\t// ── 出站帧（Tools → Agent）──\n100\t\n101\t#[derive(Debug, Serialize)]\n102\t#[serde(tag = \"type\")]\n103\tpub enum OutboundFrame {\n104\t    #[serde(rename = \"tools_ready\")]\n105\t    Ready { tools: Vec<ToolDef> },\n106\t    #[serde(rename = \"tool_progress\")]\n107\t    Progress { id: String, content: String, stream_type: String },\n108\t    #[serde(rename = \"tool_result\")]\n109\t    Result { id: String, success: bool, content: String },\n110\t    #[serde(rename = \"tool_error\")]\n111\t    Error { id: String, error: String, code: String },\n112\t    #[serde(rename = \"tool_confirm_req\")]\n113\t    ConfirmReq { id: String, tool_name: String, action: String, danger_level: String, prompt: String },\n114\t}\n115\t```\n116\t\n117\t### 2.4 IPC 传输层 (`ipc.rs`)\n118\t\n119\t```rust\n120\t/// 从 stdin 读取下一个入站帧（行缓冲）\n121\tpub fn read_frame(reader: &mut BufRead) -> Result<Option<InboundFrame>>;\n122\t\n123\t/// 向 stdout 写出站帧（自动追加 \\n 并 flush）\n124\tpub fn write_frame(frame: &OutboundFrame) -> Result<()>;\n125\t\n126\t/// IPC 主循环：阻塞读取 stdin → 路由到 ToolManager → 写结果到 stdout\n127\tpub fn ipc_main_loop(manager: &mut ToolManager) -> ! {\n128\t    let stdin = io::stdin().lock();\n129\t    let mut reader = io::BufReader::new(stdin);\n130\t    \n131\t    loop {\n132\t        match read_frame(&mut reader) {\n133\t            Ok(Some(InboundFrame::Init { allowed_tools, session_seed, auto_mode })) => {\n134\t                manager.apply_init(allowed_tools, session_seed, auto_mode);\n135\t                write_frame(&OutboundFrame::Ready {\n136\t                    tools: manager.filtered_defs(),\n137\t                });\n138\t            }\n139\t            Ok(Some(InboundFrame::CallReq { id, name, action, args, timeout_secs })) => {\n140\t                let result = manager.handle_request_sync(&id, &name, &action, &args, timeout_secs);\n141\t                write_frame(&result);\n142\t            }\n143\t            Ok(Some(InboundFrame::Cancel { id })) => {\n144\t                manager.handle_cancel(id.as_deref());\n145\t            }\n146\t            Ok(Some(InboundFrame::Shutdown)) | Ok(None) => break,\n147\t            Err(e) => {\n148\t                write_frame(&OutboundFrame::Error {\n149\t                    id: \"ipc\".into(), error: e.to_string(), code: \"IPC_ERROR\".into(),\n150\t                });\n151\t            }\n152\t        }\n153\t    }\n154\t}\n155\t```\n156\t\n157\t注意：IPC 主循环使用 `std::thread::spawn` 将每个 `CallReq` 的执行推入后台线程，并在单独的 tokio runtime 中执行异步 handler。主循环只做帧读写，不阻塞。设计上保持简单——**每条帧的长度约为 1KB 以内**，JSON-LP 无需长度前缀，从 stdin 直接按行读取即可。\n158\t\n159\t---\n160\t\n161\t## 3. ToolManager 改造\n162\t\n163\t### 3.1 核心结构\n164\t\n165\t```rust\n166\t// ── 工具键（名称 + 二级操作）──\n167\t#[derive(Clone, Debug, PartialEq, Eq, Hash)]\n168\tpub struct ToolKey {\n169\t    pub name: &'static str,\n170\t    pub action: &'static str,\n171\t}\n172\t\n173\timpl ToolKey {\n174\t    pub fn new(name: &'static str, action: &'static str) -> Self {\n175\t        Self { name, action }\n176\t    }\n177\t}\n178\t\n179\t// ── 安全检查结果 ──\n180\tpub enum SafetyVerdict {\n181\t    Allow,\n182\t    Confirm(String),\n183\t    Block(String),\n184\t}\n185\t\n186\t// ── 工具句柄 ──\n187\tpub struct ToolHandler {\n188\t    pub key: ToolKey,\n189\t    pub description: &'static str,\n190\t    pub input_schema: serde_json::Value,\n191\t    pub handler: fn(ToolCallCtx) -> ToolResult,\n192\t    pub safety: fn(&ToolCallCtx) -> SafetyVerdict,\n193\t    pub default_timeout: Duration,\n194\t}\n195\t\n196\t// ── handler 上下文 ──\n197\tpub struct ToolCallCtx {\n198\t    pub id: String,\n199\t    pub name: String,\n200\t    pub action: String,\n201\t    pub args: serde_json::Value,\n202\t    pub tx_progress: Option<crossbeam_channel::Sender<String>>,\n203\t}\n204\t\n205\t// ── handler 返回值 ──\n206\tpub struct ToolResult {\n207\t    pub success: bool,\n208\t    pub content: String,\n209\t}\n210\t\n211\t// ── ToolManager ──\n212\tpub struct ToolManager {\n213\t    handlers: HashMap<ToolKey, ToolHandler>,\n214\t    allowed: Option<HashSet<String>>,  // 从 ToolsInit 来\n215\t    cancel_flag: Arc<AtomicBool>,\n216\t    inflight_tasks: HashMap<String, Arc<AtomicBool>>,\n217\t    runtime: tokio::runtime::Runtime,\n218\t}\n219\t```\n220\t\n221\t### 3.2 Handler 改造方式\n222\t\n223\t存量 handler 目前签名是 `fn(args: &str) -> String`。改造为：\n224\t\n225\t```rust\n226\t// 旧签名\n227\tpub fn exec_command(args: &str) -> String { ... }\n228\t\n229\t// 新签名\n230\tpub fn handle_exec_run(ctx: ToolCallCtx) -> ToolResult {\n231\t    let command = ctx.args.get(\"command\").and_then(|v| v.as_str()).unwrap_or(\"\");\n232\t    // ... 实际逻辑不变，只改 IO 方式：\n233\t    // - 输出用 format! 构建 String 而非 println!\n234\t    // - 进度用 ctx.tx_progress.send(...) 推送\n235\t    ToolResult { success: true, content: result_string }\n236\t}\n237\t```\n238\t\n\n... [489 lines truncated] ..."},"type":"attachment","uuid":"f312df20-9990-47f3-a1ea-47a4302e284d","timestamp":"2026-05-14T17:27:01.106Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
