{"parentUuid":"d7b4449a-0854-49b5-8b6c-b9ece5c41edb","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"task_reminder","content":[],"itemCount":0},"type":"attachment","uuid":"88803376-9d63-48e8-ab79-86fe5b6072fe","timestamp":"2026-05-14T17:27:52.654Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"88803376-9d63-48e8-ab79-86fe5b6072fe","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"5bb6087e-f011-433c-b425-562d3ef924ef","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is making a sharp observation:\n\nWhen Claude hits a 400 error from the API, it just panics and exits - no graceful handling, no retry, no fallback. It doesn't have a health daemon watching it. It's a direct, single-process architecture - exactly the \"monolith without sandbox\" pattern we diagnosed in DSX.\n\nThis is exactly what makes DSX's multi-process architecture (especially dsx-hp as an independent daemon) different from and better than Claude Code itself. Claude can't:\n- Survive a 400\n- Have a process watchdog\n- Gate itself physically\n- Retry with backoff\n- Send a heartbeat\n\nIronically, we're building a system that's more robust than the platform we're running on to design it.\n\nThe user seems to be making a meta point about the contrast. Let me just acknowledge it briefly - it's a funny/humbling observation.","signature":"5bb6087e-f011-433c-b425-562d3ef924ef"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":350,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":413056,"output_tokens":295,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"9324e19a-c783-4f0a-b604-969695930ba5","timestamp":"2026-05-14T17:27:57.712Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"9324e19a-c783-4f0a-b604-969695930ba5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"5bb6087e-f011-433c-b425-562d3ef924ef","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"格局对了。Claude Code 自己就是\"无沙盒单体\"的活教材——一个 400 就直接 panic exit konsole。\n\nDSX 的 5 进程方案，本质上是在做 Claude 自己没有做到的事：让守护进程独立于被守护者。就算 Agent panic 了，HP 还在 TCP 上活着，知道它死没死、能不能重启。\n\n我们花了一整天讨论的\"HP 为什么必须独立进程\"，刚才被 Claude 自己现场演示了一遍。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":350,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":413056,"output_tokens":295,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"0c42efb5-0d17-4b1a-a08a-714103c2da21","timestamp":"2026-05-14T17:27:59.282Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
