{"parentUuid":"b85ff261-291e-4e66-b2f3-a30ae32b2276","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"48bbe0d9-f3eb-4599-88ee-35bada07d333","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_00_ET_r0xD2lKY0vfNT6CSNMYF4893","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/qaqtamsy/.claude/projects/-home-qaqtamsy-Desktop-dsx/memory/goal_dsx_surpass_claude.md","content":"---\nname: goal-dsx-surpass-claude\ndescription: DeepSeekX 的目标是超过 Claude Code，核心优势在于架构而非模型能力\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\nDSX 的核心目标是超越 Claude Code。关键洞察来自 2026-05-14 的一次亲身 400 错误：\n\nClaude Code 自己也没有沙盒、没有守护进程、没有健康平台——一个 400 错误就直接 panic + exit konsole，没有任何恢复能力。这意味着 Claude Code 的架构本身有根本性缺陷，而 DSX 的 5 进程拆分（尤其是 dsx-hp 独立守护进程）正是为了解决这个问题。\n\n**竞争窗口：** Claude Code 不会自己给自己重构架构。DSX 只需要把架构跑通，在稳定性（守护进程、进程隔离、故障恢复）上就天然超过它。\n\n**Why:** DSX v4.0 的 5 进程架构（dsx-hp / dsx-agent / dsx-tools / dsx-tui / dsx）是 Claude Code 没有的东西——物理隔离的 gate、独立存活的健康守护、可重启的沙箱工具进程。这不是功能差异，是架构代差。\n\n**How to apply:** 所有架构决策优先问\"Claude Code 做不到什么\"，然后让 DSX 做到。不做 Claude Code 已有的功能的复刻，做 Claude Code 做不到的事。\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":152,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":417024,"output_tokens":390,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"ce9028cf-2389-424d-a987-b52972461602","timestamp":"2026-05-14T17:35:12.807Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
