{"parentUuid":"1c2da54a-4353-451f-8df1-49ecb37196ba","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"83aef5af-6373-4805-8696-8ac96c7c225c","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Claude Code isn't running right now since we just had a 400 crash. But I know from experience that Claude Code spawns subprocesses for each tool call and for sub-agents. The user's point is valid - Claude Code does have sub-process management, it's just not a \"health daemon\" in the sense of independently monitoring and restarting processes. Let me acknowledge this.\n\nActually, let me look at it differently. Claude Code spawns child processes (bash for tool execution, sub-agents for team work), but:\n\n1. There's no daemon process that outlives the main process\n2. When the main process crashes (400 panic), all children die\n3. There's no process registry, no heartbeat, no automatic restart\n4. Gate logic (safety checks) lives in the same process as the agent being gated\n\nThat's exactly the distinction: process management ≠ health daemon.","signature":"83aef5af-6373-4805-8696-8ac96c7c225c"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":103,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":418688,"output_tokens":386,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"795a5847-50ca-4fd8-a929-89608375fa9d","timestamp":"2026-05-14T17:36:52.971Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"795a5847-50ca-4fd8-a929-89608375fa9d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"83aef5af-6373-4805-8696-8ac96c7c225c","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"你说得对。Claude Code 确实有子进程管理——spawn agent、跑 bash、子 agent 协作，都是多进程。但它缺的是**独立于被管理者的管理者**：\n\n- Claude Code 的\"进程管理\"是主进程代管的。主进程崩溃 → 全部子进程变孤儿\n- 没有**注册表**——HP 知道哪些进程活着，心跳超时就知道死了\n- 没有**独立存活能力**——Claude Code 的子进程不会被另一个进程重启\n- **gate 逻辑和 agent 在同一地址空间**——400 来了 gate 来不及拦截，因为爆的是 gate 自己\n\nDSX 的 HP 是 Claude Code 没有的东西：一个**先于一切启动、后于一切退出、即使在 agent/tools/tui 全部崩溃后仍然能响应查询**的独立进程。不是进程管理能力的区别，是守护和托管模式的区别。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":103,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":418688,"output_tokens":386,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"351c3542-aa19-43a1-b94a-53c8f945db6c","timestamp":"2026-05-14T17:36:55.571Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
