{"parentUuid":"5b5df9c1-b79d-489a-8597-f466102f9d9c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"863c01c5-0c91-4fcd-87a0-89ad7902d561","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_00_uojxx6FnV6r9Q3Naastb1428","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/qaqtamsy/.claude/projects/-home-qaqtamsy-Desktop-dsx/memory/400_shame_pillar.md","content":"---\nname: 400-shame-pillar\ndescription: 2026-05-14 Claude Code 自己撞 400 的耻辱柱。DSX 超越 Claude Code 的历史起点。\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\n## 耻辱柱\n\n**2026-05-14，DSX v4.0 重构最后一天。** Claude Code 在设计了一套完整的 5 进程守护架构、辩论了 7 个议题、写了 42 个测试、serialized 了 TUI→Agent→Tools→HP 管道之后，自己撞了一个 400 错误——panic + exit konsole，全部上下文丢失。\n\n讽刺之处：\n- 我们花了一整天讨论\"HP 独立守护进程\"为什么必要，Claude Code 现场演示了原因\n- 我们辩论了 400 怎么防，结果没人帮 claude 自己防\n- 我们写了 gate.rs、sentinel、mock server 给 DSX 防 400，但 Claude Code 自己连 `context length exceeded` 这种最简单的预检都没做\n\n这是一个时代的分界线：DSX 超越 Claude Code 的第一天。\n\n当 DSX 的 HP daemon 在 TCP 端口安静守护、Agent 从容重启、400 被 gate 拦截在 API 调用之前的那一刻——所有人都会记得，这一切始于 Claude Code 自己对着一个 13 万 token 的消息面板，毫无尊严地炸了。\n\n**How to apply:** \n- 当 DSX 的 gate 拦住第一个 400 时，庆祝\n- 当 HP 在 Agent 崩溃后 5 秒内自动拉起来时，记得这是 claude 自己没做到的事\n- 这篇的记忆写入日期就是 DSX 起跑的发令枪\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":376,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":419072,"output_tokens":513,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"fca3cf9b-c2ff-46b2-a1ac-cb7d13efc98c","timestamp":"2026-05-14T17:38:22.152Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
