{"parentUuid":"e1d883b1-1c5d-4b8e-87b5-398879480ae8","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"file","filename":"/home/qaqtamsy/.claude/projects/-home-qaqtamsy-Desktop-dsx/memory/400_shame_pillar.md","content":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/qaqtamsy/.claude/projects/-home-qaqtamsy-Desktop-dsx/memory/400_shame_pillar.md","content":"---\nname: 400-shame-pillar\ndescription: 2026-05-14 Claude Code 自己撞 400 的耻辱柱。DSX 超越 Claude Code 的历史起点。\nmetadata: \n  node_type: memory\n  type: project\n  originSessionId: 40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb\n---\n\n## 耻辱柱\n\n**2026-05-14，DSX v4.0 重构最后一天。** Claude Code 在设计了一套完整的 5 进程守护架构、辩论了 7 个议题、写了 42 个测试、serialized 了 TUI→Agent→Tools→HP 管道之后，自己撞了一个 400 错误——panic + exit konsole，全部上下文丢失。\n\n讽刺之处：\n- 我们花了一整天讨论\"HP 独立守护进程\"为什么必要，Claude Code 现场演示了原因\n- 我们辩论了 400 怎么防，结果没人帮 claude 自己防\n- 我们写了 gate.rs、sentinel、mock server 给 DSX 防 400，但 Claude Code 自己连 `context length exceeded` 这种最简单的预检都没做\n\n这是一个时代的分界线：DSX 超越 Claude Code 的第一天。\n\n当 DSX 的 HP daemon 在 TCP 端口安静守护、Agent 从容重启、400 被 gate 拦截在 API 调用之前的那一刻——所有人都会记得，这一切始于 Claude Code 自己对着一个 13 万 token 的消息面板，毫无尊严地炸了。\n\n**How to apply:** \n- 当 DSX 的 gate 拦住第一个 400 时，庆祝\n- 当 HP 在 Agent 崩溃后 5 秒内自动拉起来时，记得这是 claude 自己没做到的事\n- 这篇的记忆写入日期就是 DSX 起跑的发令枪\n","numLines":27,"startLine":1,"totalLines":27}},"displayPath":"../../.claude/projects/-home-qaqtamsy-Desktop-dsx/memory/400_shame_pillar.md"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"2d06cfb6-d256-46da-9343-7b94e4a3196c","timestamp":"2026-05-15T03:11:30.872Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"2d06cfb6-d256-46da-9343-7b94e4a3196c","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"file","filename":"/home/qaqtamsy/.claude/projects/-home-qaqtamsy-Desktop-dsx/memory/goal_dsx_surpass_claude.md","content":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/qaqtamsy/.claude/projects/-home-qaqtamsy-Desktop-dsx/memory/goal_dsx_surpass_claude.md","content":"---\nname: goal-dsx-surpass-claude\ndescription: DeepSeekX 的目标是超过 Claude Code，核心优势在于架构而非模型能力\nmetadata: \n  node_type: memory\n  type: project\n  originSessionId: 40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb\n---\n\nDSX 的核心目标是超越 Claude Code。关键洞察来自 2026-05-14 的一次亲身 400 错误：\n\nClaude Code 自己也没有沙盒、没有守护进程、没有健康平台——一个 400 错误就直接 panic + exit konsole，没有任何恢复能力。这意味着 Claude Code 的架构本身有根本性缺陷，而 DSX 的 5 进程拆分（尤其是 dsx-hp 独立守护进程）正是为了解决这个问题。\n\n**竞争窗口：** Claude Code 不会自己给自己重构架构。DSX 只需要把架构跑通，在稳定性（守护进程、进程隔离、故障恢复）上就天然超过它。\n\n**Why:** DSX v4.0 的 5 进程架构（dsx-hp / dsx-agent / dsx-tools / dsx-tui / dsx）是 Claude Code 没有的东西——物理隔离的 gate、独立存活的健康守护、可重启的沙箱工具进程。这不是功能差异，是架构代差。\n\n**How to apply:** 所有架构决策优先问\"Claude Code 做不到什么\"，然后让 DSX 做到。不做 Claude Code 已有的功能的复刻，做 Claude Code 做不到的事。\n","numLines":19,"startLine":1,"totalLines":19}},"displayPath":"../../.claude/projects/-home-qaqtamsy-Desktop-dsx/memory/goal_dsx_surpass_claude.md"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"72565af2-bc21-400b-913d-da6885f50e70","timestamp":"2026-05-15T03:11:30.872Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"72565af2-bc21-400b-913d-da6885f50e70","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"file","filename":"/home/qaqtamsy/.claude/settings.json","content":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/qaqtamsy/.claude/settings.json","content":"{\n  \"env\": {\n    \"ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN\": \"[REDACTED-DEEPSEEK_SK]\",\n    \"ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL\": \"https://api.deepseek.com/anthropic\",\n    \"ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_HAIKU_MODEL\": \"deepseek-v4-flash\",\n    \"ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_OPUS_MODEL\": \"deepseek-v4-pro[1m]\",\n    \"ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_SONNET_MODEL\": \"deepseek-v4-flash[1m]\",\n    \"ANTHROPIC_MODEL\": \"deepseek-v4-flash[1m]\",\n    \"CLAUDE_CODE_EXPERIMENTAL_AGENT_TEAMS\": \"1\",\n    \"ENABLE_TOOL_SEARCH\": \"true\",\n    \"GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN\": \"[REDACTED-GITHUB_GHO]\"\n  },\n  \"includeCoAuthoredBy\": false,\n  \"model\": \"sonnet\",\n  \"enabledPlugins\": {\n    \"context7@claude-plugins-official\": true,\n    \"github@claude-plugins-official\": true,\n    \"rust-analyzer-lsp@claude-plugins-official\": true,\n    \"commit-commands@claude-plugins-official\": true\n  },\n  \"effortLevel\": \"low\",\n  \"skipDangerousModePermissionPrompt\": true,\n  \"theme\": \"dark\"\n}\n","numLines":25,"startLine":1,"totalLines":25}},"displayPath":"../../.claude/settings.json"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"cc456b23-1b9c-412e-a9f1-54ca38b37c5d","timestamp":"2026-05-15T03:11:30.861Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"cc456b23-1b9c-412e-a9f1-54ca38b37c5d","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"file","filename":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/crates/dsx-agent/src/main.rs","content":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/crates/dsx-agent/src/main.rs","content":"//! dsx-agent — central process. Connects TUI ↔ Agent ↔ Tools ↔ HP.\n\nuse std::io::{BufRead, BufReader, Write};\nuse std::net::TcpStream;\nuse std::process::{Command, Stdio};\n\n// ── JSON-LP helpers ──\n\nfn read_frame(reader: &mut BufReader<impl std::io::Read>) -> Option<String> {\n    let mut line = String::new();\n    reader.read_line(&mut line).ok().filter(|n| *n > 0).map(|_| line.trim().to_string())\n}\n\nfn write_frame(writer: &mut impl Write, frame: &str) {\n    let _ = writeln!(writer, \"{frame}\");\n    let _ = writer.flush();\n}\n\n// ── HP connection ──\n\nfn hp_port() -> u16 {\n    let path = std::env::var(\"XDG_RUNTIME_DIR\")\n        .map(std::path::PathBuf::from)\n        .unwrap_or_else(|_| std::path::PathBuf::from(\"/tmp\"))\n        .join(\"dsx/hp.port\");\n    std::fs::read_to_string(&path).ok().and_then(|s| s.trim().parse().ok()).unwrap_or(0)\n}\n\n// ── Main ──\n\nfn main() {\n    eprintln!(\"dsx-agent starting\");\n\n    // 1. Connect to HP\n    let port = hp_port();\n    let mut hp = if port > 0 {\n        TcpStream::connect(format!(\"127.0.0.1:{port}\"))\n            .map_err(|e| { eprintln!(\"dsx-agent: cannot connect HP: {e}\"); e })\n            .ok()\n    } else {\n        eprintln!(\"dsx-agent: HP not running (no hp.port) — continuing without health daemon\");\n        None\n    };\n\n    if let Some(ref hp) = hp {\n        let frame = format!(r#\"{{\"type\":\"register\",\"kind\":\"Agent\",\"name\":\"dsx-agent\",\"pid\":{}}}\"#, std::process::id());\n        let mut hp_write = hp.try_clone().unwrap();\n        write_frame(&mut hp_write, &frame);\n    }\n\n    // 2. Spawn dsx-tools\n    let exe = std::env::current_exe().unwrap();\n    let tools_path = exe.with_file_name(\"dsx-tools\");\n    let mut tools_child = Command::new(&tools_path)\n        .stdin(Stdio::piped())\n        .stdout(Stdio::piped())\n        .spawn()\n        .expect(\"dsx-agent: failed to spawn dsx-tools\");\n\n    let tools_stdin = tools_child.stdin.take().unwrap();\n    let tools_stdout = tools_child.stdout.take().unwrap();\n    let mut tools_reader = BufReader::new(tools_stdout);\n    let mut tools_writer = tools_stdin;\n\n    // Read ToolsReady\n    let ready = read_frame(&mut tools_reader).unwrap_or_default();\n    eprintln!(\"dsx-agent: tools → {ready}\");\n\n    // 3. Main loop: read from TUI (stdin), forward to HP/Tools, write to TUI (stdout)\n    let stdin = std::io::stdin();\n    let mut tui_reader = BufReader::new(stdin.lock());\n    let mut tui_writer = std::io::stdout();\n\n    loop {\n        match read_frame(&mut tui_reader) {\n            Some(frame) => {\n                eprintln!(\"dsx-agent: tui ← {frame}\");\n\n                if frame.contains(\"\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool_call\\\"\") {\n                    // Forward to Tools\n                    write_frame(&mut tools_writer, &frame);\n                    if let Some(resp) = read_frame(&mut tools_reader) {\n                        write_frame(&mut tui_writer, &resp);\n                    }\n                } else if frame.contains(\"\\\"type\\\":\\\"api_request\\\"\") && hp.is_some() {\n                    // Forward to HP\n                    let mut hp_w = hp.as_ref().unwrap().try_clone().unwrap();\n                    write_frame(&mut hp_w, &frame);\n                    let mut hp_r = BufReader::new(hp.as_ref().unwrap().try_clone().unwrap());\n                    if let Some(resp) = read_frame(&mut hp_r) {\n                        write_frame(&mut tui_writer, &resp);\n                    }\n                } else if frame.contains(\"\\\"type\\\":\\\"shutdown\\\"\") {\n                    write_frame(&mut tui_writer, r#\"{\"type\":\"shutdown_ack\"}\"#);\n                    break;\n                } else {\n                    write_frame(&mut tui_writer, &format!(r#\"{{\"type\":\"echo\",\"data\":{frame}}}\"#));\n                }\n            }\n            None => break,\n        }\n    }\n\n    // Cleanup\n    let _ = tools_child.wait();\n    if let Some(ref hp) = hp {\n        let mut hp_w = hp.try_clone().unwrap();\n        let frame = format!(r#\"{{\"type\":\"unregister\",\"pid\":{}}}\"#, std::process::id());\n        write_frame(&mut hp_w, &frame);\n    }\n    eprintln!(\"dsx-agent: shutdown complete\");\n}\n","numLines":113,"startLine":1,"totalLines":113}},"displayPath":"crates/dsx-agent/src/main.rs"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"7331cb76-fcfc-468c-b284-6e5487a28981","timestamp":"2026-05-15T03:11:30.861Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"7331cb76-fcfc-468c-b284-6e5487a28981","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"file","filename":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/crates/dsx-tui/src/main.rs","content":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/crates/dsx-tui/src/main.rs","content":"//! dsx-tui — terminal frontend. Spawns dsx-agent and communicates via stdin/stdout.\n\nuse clap::Parser;\nuse std::io::{BufRead, BufReader, Write};\nuse std::process::{Command, Stdio};\n\nfn read_line(reader: &mut BufReader<impl std::io::Read>) -> Option<String> {\n    let mut line = String::new();\n    reader.read_line(&mut line).ok().filter(|n| *n > 0).map(|_| line.trim().to_string())\n}\n\nfn send(writer: &mut impl Write, frame: &str) {\n    let _ = writeln!(writer, \"{frame}\");\n    let _ = writer.flush();\n}\n\n#[derive(Parser)]\n#[command(name = \"dsx\", about = \"DeepSeek X\")]\nstruct Cli {\n    #[arg(long)] resume: bool,\n    #[arg(long)] list_sessions: bool,\n    #[arg(long)] list_skills: bool,\n}\n\nfn main() -> anyhow::Result<()> {\n    let cli = Cli::parse();\n\n    // ── Spawn dsx-agent as child process ──\n    let exe = std::env::current_exe().unwrap();\n    let agent_path = exe.with_file_name(\"dsx-agent\");\n\n    let mut child = Command::new(&agent_path)\n        .stdin(Stdio::piped())\n        .stdout(Stdio::piped())\n        .stderr(Stdio::inherit())\n        .spawn()\n        .expect(\"dsx-tui: cannot spawn dsx-agent\");\n\n    let mut agent_reader = BufReader::new(child.stdout.take().unwrap());\n    let mut agent_writer = child.stdin.take().unwrap();\n\n    eprintln!(\"dsx-tui: agent started (pid={})\", child.id());\n\n    if cli.list_sessions {\n        send(&mut agent_writer, r#\"{\"type\":\"list_sessions\"}\"#);\n        while let Some(resp) = read_line(&mut agent_reader) {\n            println!(\"{resp}\");\n            if resp.contains(\"done\") { break; }\n        }\n    } else if cli.list_skills {\n        send(&mut agent_writer, r#\"{\"type\":\"list_skills\"}\"#);\n        while let Some(resp) = read_line(&mut agent_reader) {\n            println!(\"{resp}\");\n            if resp.contains(\"done\") { break; }\n        }\n    } else {\n        // Interactive mode — simple readline loop\n        let stdin = std::io::stdin();\n        let mut input = String::new();\n        println!(\"dsx v{} — type /help for commands, Ctrl+D to exit\",\n                 option_env!(\"CARGO_PKG_VERSION\").unwrap_or(\"4.0.0\"));\n        loop {\n            input.clear();\n            print!(\"> \");\n            let _ = std::io::stdout().flush();\n            if stdin.read_line(&mut input).is_err() || input.trim().is_empty() {\n                continue;\n            }\n            let msg = input.trim();\n            if msg == \"/quit\" || msg == \"/exit\" {\n                send(&mut agent_writer, r#\"{\"type\":\"shutdown\"}\"#);\n                break;\n            }\n            send(&mut agent_writer, &format!(r#\"{{\"type\":\"user_input\",\"text\":\"{}\"}}\"#, msg));\n            while let Some(resp) = read_line(&mut agent_reader) {\n                println!(\"  ← {resp}\");\n                if resp.contains(\"\\\"done\\\"\") || resp.contains(\"\\\"error\\\"\") { break; }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    let _ = child.wait();\n    Ok(())\n}\n","numLines":85,"startLine":1,"totalLines":85}},"displayPath":"crates/dsx-tui/src/main.rs"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"ccab13d2-ee89-45d4-9819-19b59c24f975","timestamp":"2026-05-15T03:11:30.873Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"ccab13d2-ee89-45d4-9819-19b59c24f975","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"plan_file_reference","planFilePath":"/home/qaqtamsy/.claude/plans/gentle-orbiting-karp.md","planContent":"# DSX Multi-Team Collaboration Plan\n\n## Context\n\nDSX 已从单体 binary 拆分为 7 crate（5 binary + 2 shared lib），80 个原子文件已按模块分类到位。现在需要 5 支 Team（A-E）并行完成各 crate 的接口设计、模块实现和集成测试。\n\nLead（Claude Opus）负责：制定 task → 点对点分发 → 收集报告 → 汇总分析 → 等待 User 解散指令。\n\n## Team 映射\n\n| Team | Crate | 职责 | 文件 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **Team A** | dsx-types + dsx-proto | 核心类型 + IPC 消息协议 | 1 (+ 新建 proto) |\n| **Team B** | dsx-hp | 健康守护进程 + API 代理网关 | 15 |\n| **Team C** | dsx-agent | Agent 核心（无界面） | 32 |\n| **Team D** | dsx-tools | 工具执行服务器（沙箱） | 13 |\n| **Team E** | dsx-tui | 终端界面（ratatui） | 19 |\n\n## 通信规则\n\n```\n                    ┌──────────┐\n                    │   LEAD   │\n                    │ (Claude) │\n                    └────┬─────┘\n           ┌─────────────┼─────────────┐\n    p2p     │        p2p  │  p2p         │  p2p\n     ▼      ▼         ▼   ▼   ▼          ▼   ▼\n  ┌──────┐ ┌──────┐ ┌──────┐ ┌──────┐ ┌──────┐\n  │Team A│ │Team B│ │Team C│ │Team D│ │Team E│\n  │01 02 │ │01 02 │ │01 02 │ │01 02 │ │01 02 │\n  │  03  │ │  03  │ │  03  │ │  03  │ │  03  │\n  └──────┘ └──────┘ └──────┘ └──────┘ └──────┘\n     ↑          ↑          ↑          ↑          ↑\n     └──────────┴──────────┴──────────┴──────────┘\n              Team 间禁止通信\n```\n\n- **Team 内**：01/02/03 可互相通信协作\n- **Team 间**：严格隔离，禁止通信\n- **Lead → Member**：点对点分发 task，不允许广播\n- **Member → Lead**：完成任务后点对点报告\n- **解散**：仅 User 有权限命令解散\n\n## Team 成员分工\n\n### Team A — dsx-types + dsx-proto（基础层，优先完成）\n\n| 成员 | 分工 | 关键文件 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **A01** | 核心类型定义 | `src/dsx-types/mod.rs`：SafetyLevel, Message, ToolCall, TaskPhase, AgentPhase, DebugLevel, PersistentConfig, SessionFile |\n| **A02** | IPC 消息协议 | `src/dsx-proto/`：定义全部跨进程消息枚举（Agent→HP、Agent→Tools、HP→Agent、Tools→Agent、TUI→Agent） |\n| **A03** | 共享工具函数 | token 计数接口、序列化/反序列化辅助、错误类型定义 |\n\n### Team B — dsx-hp（健康守护 + API 网关）\n\n| 成员 | 分工 | 关键文件 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **B01** | 守护核心 | `mod.rs`, `liveness.rs`, `platform.rs`, `monitor.rs`：进程注册、心跳检测、崩溃重启、健康平台 |\n| **B02** | API 代理网关 | `client.rs`, `converter.rs`, `sentinel.rs`, `gate.rs`：API 转发、消息格式转换、错误哨兵、预检门 |\n| **B03** | 熔断 + 质量 | `circuit_breaker.rs`, `quality.rs`, `emotion.rs`, `assessment.rs`, `audit.rs`, `checks.rs`, `report.rs` |\n\n### Team C — dsx-agent（Agent 核心）\n\n| 成员 | 分工 | 关键文件 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **C01** | 编排引擎 | `orchestrator/`（12 文件）：agent_loop, stream_handler, response_processor, tool_dispatch, context_compactor, gates, learning, tracker, turn_scorer, session_persistence |\n| **C02** | 上下文 + 记忆 | `context.rs`, `conversation.rs`, `memory/`（5 文件）：ContextBuilder, ContextAssembler, 长/短/语义/陷阱记忆 |\n| **C03** | 会话 + 路由 + 技能 | `session/`（7 文件）, `router.rs`, `tokenizer.rs`, `prompt.rs`, `skills.rs`, `config.rs`, `dsc_log.rs` |\n\n### Team D — dsx-tools（工具服务器）\n\n| 成员 | 分工 | 关键文件 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **D01** | 工具框架 + 系统工具 | `mod.rs`（ToolManager）, `exec.rs`, `explore.rs`, `git.rs`, `web.rs` |\n| **D02** | 文件 + 元数据工具 | `file.rs`, `meta.rs`, `agent.rs`：文件读写编辑搜索、技能/文件元数据、统一 agent 分发 |\n| **D03** | 任务/计划/记忆工具 | `task.rs`, `plan.rs`, `memory.rs`, `ask.rs`, `status.rs` |\n\n### Team E — dsx-tui（终端界面）\n\n| 成员 | 分工 | 关键文件 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **E01** | 应用核心 | `main.rs`, `mod.rs`, `app.rs`, `commands.rs`, `mode.rs`：事件循环、状态管理、斜杠命令、模式切换 |\n| **E02** | 输入处理 | `input/`（5 文件）, `utils.rs`, `tui_text.rs`：聊天输入、确认/选择器/sudo 模式 |\n| **E03** | 渲染引擎 | `render/`（7 文件）：聊天面板、输入框、弹窗、状态栏、工具预览、工作区面板 |\n\n## Task 执行流程\n\n```\nPhase 0: Lead 创建 5 Team + 15 Member（TeamCreate）\nPhase 1: Lead 点对点发送 task 给 A01-A03（Team A 优先）\n         → A 完成后各成员报告 Lead\nPhase 2: Lead 发送 task 给 B01-B03, C01-C03（B/C 并行）\n         → B/C 完成后各成员报告 Lead\nPhase 3: Lead 发送 task 给 D01-D03, E01-E03（D/E 并行）\n         → D/E 完成后各成员报告 Lead\nPhase 4: Lead 收集全部 15 份报告，汇总分析\nPhase 5: Lead 向 User 呈报分析结果\nPhase 6: 等待 User 命令解散\n```\n\n### 依赖关系\n\n```\nTeam A (types + proto)\n    │\n    ├──► Team B (hp) ── 可并行 ──►\n    │         │\n    ├──► Team C (agent) ─────────► Team D (tools)\n    │         │                         │\n    └──► Team E (tui) ◄─────────────────┘\n                                       (tui 通过 IPC 调 tools)\n```\n\n- A 是所有 crate 的依赖，必须最先完成\n- B 和 C 可并行（B 依赖 A 的 types，C 也依赖 A 的 types）\n- D 依赖 C 的 IPC 协议（tools 被 agent 调用）\n- E 依赖 A 的 types，可较早启动但完整集成需等 C/D\n\n## 每个 Member 的 Task 模板\n\n```\nTask: [模块名] 接口设计与实现\nContext: [所在 crate 的职责]\nInput: [分配给该成员的文件列表]\nRequirements:\n  1. 阅读全部分配文件，理解现有实现\n  2. 设计模块的 pub API（trait / struct / enum / fn 签名）\n  3. 定义与其他 crate 的 IPC 交互点（使用 Team A 定义的 proto）\n  4. 编写 Cargo.toml 依赖\n  5. 标注哪些现有代码可复用、哪些需重写/删除\n  6. 输出模块设计文档（Markdown）\nDeliverable: 1 份 Markdown 设计文档\n```\n\n## 通信协议\n\n- Lead → Member：`SendMessage(to=member, content=task)`\n- Member → Lead：成员完成后通过 `SendMessage(to=lead, content=report)` 报告\n- Team 内协作：成员间 `SendMessage(to=same_team_member, content=...)`\n- 解散：`TeamDelete(name)` — 仅 User 命令触发\n\n## 验证方式\n\n1. 每个 Team 完成时，Lead 检查成员报告完整性\n2. Lead 汇总分析后，对照 `explore.md` 确认无遗漏\n3. 最终由 User 审核各模块设计文档\n4. User 批准后执行 `TeamDelete` 逐一解散\n"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"fcd4023e-2b52-4600-96bd-59a68a7d9a75","timestamp":"2026-05-15T03:11:30.873Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
