{"parentUuid":"1f553a2a-ea5a-4ae2-b75a-dd407e094fbd","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"ddf8f9ab-d801-42d7-9251-c7fccf1f1f0f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_01_gz1LfktOmhQ3SWpxeX7d8005","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t//! JSON-LP IPC 协议帧定义与传输层。\n2\t//!\n3\t//! 协议：每行一个完整 JSON 对象（`\\n` 分隔），称为一帧。\n4\t//!\n5\t//! Agent → Tools: tools_init, tool_call_req, tool_cancel, tools_shutdown, tool_confirm_resp\n6\t//! Tools → Agent: tools_ready, tool_progress, tool_result, tool_result_message, tool_error, tool_confirm_req\n7\t\n8\tuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\n9\t\n10\t// ── 入站帧（Agent → Tools）──\n11\t\n12\t#[derive(Debug, Deserialize)]\n13\t#[serde(tag = \"type\")]\n14\tpub enum InboundFrame {\n15\t    #[serde(rename = \"tools_init\")]\n16\t    Init {\n17\t        allowed_tools: Vec<String>,\n18\t        session_seed: String,\n19\t        auto_mode: bool,\n20\t    },\n21\t\n22\t    #[serde(rename = \"tool_call_req\")]\n23\t    CallReq {\n24\t        id: String,\n25\t        name: String,\n26\t        action: String,\n27\t        args: serde_json::Value,\n28\t        /// 超时覆盖（秒），None = 使用 handler 默认值。\n29\t        timeout_secs: Option<u64>,\n30\t    },\n31\t\n32\t    #[serde(rename = \"tool_cancel\")]\n33\t    Cancel {\n34\t        /// None = 取消所有，Some(id) = 取消指定工具。\n35\t        id: Option<String>,\n36\t    },\n37\t\n38\t    /// Agent 对 `tool_confirm_req` 的用户批准/拒绝回复。\n39\t    #[serde(rename = \"tool_confirm_resp\")]\n40\t    ConfirmResp {\n41\t        id: String,\n42\t        approved: bool,\n43\t    },\n44\t\n45\t    #[serde(rename = \"tools_shutdown\")]\n46\t    Shutdown,\n47\t}\n48\t\n49\t// ── 出站帧（Tools → Agent）──\n50\t\n51\t#[derive(Debug, Serialize)]\n52\t#[serde(tag = \"type\")]\n53\tpub enum OutboundFrame {\n54\t    /// Tools 进程就绪，附带可用工具定义列表。\n55\t    #[serde(rename = \"tools_ready\")]\n56\t    Ready {\n57\t        tools: Vec<dsx_types::ToolDef>,\n58\t    },\n59\t\n60\t    /// 流式进度输出。\n61\t    #[serde(rename = \"tool_progress\")]\n62\t    Progress {\n63\t        id: String,\n64\t        content: String,\n65\t        /// \"stdout\" | \"stderr\" | \"progress\"\n66\t        stream_type: String,\n67\t    },\n68\t\n69\t    /// 旧式工具结果（纯文本，向后兼容）。\n70\t    #[serde(rename = \"tool_result\")]\n71\t    Result {\n72\t        id: String,\n73\t        success: bool,\n74\t        content: String,\n75\t    },\n76\t\n77\t    /// 新式工具结果消息——包含构造 Message::tool() 所需的全部字段。\n78\t    /// Agent 收到此帧后可直接构造 conversation Message，无需额外解析。\n79\t    #[serde(rename = \"tool_result_message\")]\n80\t    ToolResultMessage {\n81\t        id: String,\n82\t        name: String,\n83\t        action: String,\n84\t        success: bool,\n85\t        content: String,\n86\t        /// Anthropic 协议：Some(true) 表示 is_error。\n87\t        #[serde(skip_serializing_if = \"Option::is_none\")]\n88\t        is_error: Option<bool>,\n89\t    },\n90\t\n91\t    /// 工具执行出错（拦截/未知工具/panic/超时）。\n92\t    #[serde(rename = \"tool_error\")]\n93\t    ToolError {\n94\t        id: String,\n95\t        error: String,\n96\t        /// \"UNKNOWN_TOOL\" | \"BLOCKED\" | \"TIMEOUT\" | \"PANIC\" | \"FORBIDDEN\"\n97\t        code: String,\n98\t    },\n99\t\n100\t    /// 请求用户确认（安全弹窗）。\n101\t    #[serde(rename = \"tool_confirm_req\")]\n102\t    ToolConfirmReq {\n103\t        id: String,\n104\t        tool_name: String,\n105\t        action: String,\n106\t        /// \"confirm\" | \"danger\"\n107\t        danger_level: String,\n108\t        prompt: String,\n109\t    },\n110\t}\n111\t\n112\t// ── 帧读写 ──\n113\t\n114\tuse std::io::{self, BufRead, Write};\n115\t\n116\t/// 从 reader 读取下一个入站帧。返回 None 表示 EOF。\n117\tpub fn read_frame(reader: &mut impl BufRead) -> io::Result<Option<InboundFrame>> {\n118\t    let mut line = String::new();\n119\t    let n = reader.read_line(&mut line)?;\n120\t    if n == 0 {\n121\t        return Ok(None); // EOF\n122\t    }\n123\t    let trimmed = line.trim();\n124\t    if trimmed.is_empty() {\n125\t        return Ok(None);\n126\t    }\n127\t    match serde_json::from_str::<InboundFrame>(trimmed) {\n128\t        Ok(frame) => Ok(Some(frame)),\n129\t        Err(e) => Err(io::Error::new(io::ErrorKind::InvalidData, e)),\n130\t    }\n131\t}\n132\t\n133\t/// 向 writer 写出站帧（自动追加 \\n 并 flush）。\n134\tpub fn write_frame(writer: &mut impl Write, frame: &OutboundFrame) -> io::Result<()> {\n135\t    let json = serde_json::to_string(frame)?;\n136\t    writeln!(writer, \"{}\", json)?;\n137\t    writer.flush()?;\n138\t    Ok(())\n139\t}\n140\t\n141\t// ── IPC 主循环 ──\n142\t\n143\tuse crate::ToolManager;\n144\t\n145\t/// IPC 主循环：从 stdin 读取 Agent 帧 → ToolManager 路由 → 写入 stdout。\n146\t///\n147\t/// 仅在收到 ToolsShutdown 或 EOF 时返回。\n148\tpub fn ipc_main_loop(manager: &mut ToolManager) {\n149\t    let stdin = io::stdin();\n150\t    let stdout = io::stdout();\n151\t    let mut reader = io::BufReader::new(stdin.lock());\n152\t    let mut writer = stdout.lock();\n153\t\n154\t    loop {\n155\t        let frame = match read_frame(&mut reader) {\n156\t            Ok(Some(f)) => f,\n157\t            Ok(None) => break,  // EOF\n158\t            Err(e) => {\n159\t                let _ = write_frame(&mut writer, &OutboundFrame::ToolError {\n160\t                    id: \"ipc\".into(),\n161\t                    error: format!(\"IPC parse error: {}\", e),\n162\t                    code: \"IPC_ERROR\".into(),\n163\t                });\n164\t                continue;\n165\t            }\n166\t        };\n167\t\n168\t        match frame {\n169\t            InboundFrame::Init { allowed_tools, session_seed, auto_mode } => {\n170\t                manager.apply_init(allowed_tools, &session_seed, auto_mode);\n171\t                let tools = manager.filtered_defs();\n172\t                if write_frame(&mut writer, &OutboundFrame::Ready { tools }).is_err() {\n173\t                    break; // stdout closed\n174\t                }\n175\t            }\n176\t\n177\t            InboundFrame::CallReq { id, name, action, args, timeout_secs } => {\n178\t                let response = manager.handle_req(id, &name, &action, args, timeout_secs);\n179\t                if write_frame(&mut writer, &response).is_err() {\n180\t                    break;\n181\t                }\n182\t            }\n183\t\n184\t            InboundFrame::Cancel { id } => {\n185\t                manager.cancel_tool(id.as_deref());\n186\t            }\n187\t\n188\t            InboundFrame::ConfirmResp { id, approved } => {\n189\t                // 暂未实现同步等待 ConfirmResp 的机制。\n190\t                // 当前版本：Confirm 级别工具直接返回 ToolConfirmReq 帧，\n191\t                // Agent 回复 ConfirmResp 时由 ToolManager 查找等待队列。\n192\t                // 简单实现：记录响应但不做处理（保持设计为未来扩展）。\n193\t                let _ = (id, approved);\n194\t            }\n195\t\n196\t            InboundFrame::Shutdown => break,\n197\t        }\n198\t    }\n199\t}\n200\t"}]},"uuid":"5bc1358c-a54c-4386-8199-da4aecf9a19b","timestamp":"2026-05-15T03:12:46.833Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/crates/dsx-tools/src/ipc.rs","content":"//! JSON-LP IPC 协议帧定义与传输层。\n//!\n//! 协议：每行一个完整 JSON 对象（`\\n` 分隔），称为一帧。\n//!\n//! Agent → Tools: tools_init, tool_call_req, tool_cancel, tools_shutdown, tool_confirm_resp\n//! Tools → Agent: tools_ready, tool_progress, tool_result, tool_result_message, tool_error, tool_confirm_req\n\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\n\n// ── 入站帧（Agent → Tools）──\n\n#[derive(Debug, Deserialize)]\n#[serde(tag = \"type\")]\npub enum InboundFrame {\n    #[serde(rename = \"tools_init\")]\n    Init {\n        allowed_tools: Vec<String>,\n        session_seed: String,\n        auto_mode: bool,\n    },\n\n    #[serde(rename = \"tool_call_req\")]\n    CallReq {\n        id: String,\n        name: String,\n        action: String,\n        args: serde_json::Value,\n        /// 超时覆盖（秒），None = 使用 handler 默认值。\n        timeout_secs: Option<u64>,\n    },\n\n    #[serde(rename = \"tool_cancel\")]\n    Cancel {\n        /// None = 取消所有，Some(id) = 取消指定工具。\n        id: Option<String>,\n    },\n\n    /// Agent 对 `tool_confirm_req` 的用户批准/拒绝回复。\n    #[serde(rename = \"tool_confirm_resp\")]\n    ConfirmResp {\n        id: String,\n        approved: bool,\n    },\n\n    #[serde(rename = \"tools_shutdown\")]\n    Shutdown,\n}\n\n// ── 出站帧（Tools → Agent）──\n\n#[derive(Debug, Serialize)]\n#[serde(tag = \"type\")]\npub enum OutboundFrame {\n    /// Tools 进程就绪，附带可用工具定义列表。\n    #[serde(rename = \"tools_ready\")]\n    Ready {\n        tools: Vec<dsx_types::ToolDef>,\n    },\n\n    /// 流式进度输出。\n    #[serde(rename = \"tool_progress\")]\n    Progress {\n        id: String,\n        content: String,\n        /// \"stdout\" | \"stderr\" | \"progress\"\n        stream_type: String,\n    },\n\n    /// 旧式工具结果（纯文本，向后兼容）。\n    #[serde(rename = \"tool_result\")]\n    Result {\n        id: String,\n        success: bool,\n        content: String,\n    },\n\n    /// 新式工具结果消息——包含构造 Message::tool() 所需的全部字段。\n    /// Agent 收到此帧后可直接构造 conversation Message，无需额外解析。\n    #[serde(rename = \"tool_result_message\")]\n    ToolResultMessage {\n        id: String,\n        name: String,\n        action: String,\n        success: bool,\n        content: String,\n        /// Anthropic 协议：Some(true) 表示 is_error。\n        #[serde(skip_serializing_if = \"Option::is_none\")]\n        is_error: Option<bool>,\n    },\n\n    /// 工具执行出错（拦截/未知工具/panic/超时）。\n    #[serde(rename = \"tool_error\")]\n    ToolError {\n        id: String,\n        error: String,\n        /// \"UNKNOWN_TOOL\" | \"BLOCKED\" | \"TIMEOUT\" | \"PANIC\" | \"FORBIDDEN\"\n        code: String,\n    },\n\n    /// 请求用户确认（安全弹窗）。\n    #[serde(rename = \"tool_confirm_req\")]\n    ToolConfirmReq {\n        id: String,\n        tool_name: String,\n        action: String,\n        /// \"confirm\" | \"danger\"\n        danger_level: String,\n        prompt: String,\n    },\n}\n\n// ── 帧读写 ──\n\nuse std::io::{self, BufRead, Write};\n\n/// 从 reader 读取下一个入站帧。返回 None 表示 EOF。\npub fn read_frame(reader: &mut impl BufRead) -> io::Result<Option<InboundFrame>> {\n    let mut line = String::new();\n    let n = reader.read_line(&mut line)?;\n    if n == 0 {\n        return Ok(None); // EOF\n    }\n    let trimmed = line.trim();\n    if trimmed.is_empty() {\n        return Ok(None);\n    }\n    match serde_json::from_str::<InboundFrame>(trimmed) {\n        Ok(frame) => Ok(Some(frame)),\n        Err(e) => Err(io::Error::new(io::ErrorKind::InvalidData, e)),\n    }\n}\n\n/// 向 writer 写出站帧（自动追加 \\n 并 flush）。\npub fn write_frame(writer: &mut impl Write, frame: &OutboundFrame) -> io::Result<()> {\n    let json = serde_json::to_string(frame)?;\n    writeln!(writer, \"{}\", json)?;\n    writer.flush()?;\n    Ok(())\n}\n\n// ── IPC 主循环 ──\n\nuse crate::ToolManager;\n\n/// IPC 主循环：从 stdin 读取 Agent 帧 → ToolManager 路由 → 写入 stdout。\n///\n/// 仅在收到 ToolsShutdown 或 EOF 时返回。\npub fn ipc_main_loop(manager: &mut ToolManager) {\n    let stdin = io::stdin();\n    let stdout = io::stdout();\n    let mut reader = io::BufReader::new(stdin.lock());\n    let mut writer = stdout.lock();\n\n    loop {\n        let frame = match read_frame(&mut reader) {\n            Ok(Some(f)) => f,\n            Ok(None) => break,  // EOF\n            Err(e) => {\n                let _ = write_frame(&mut writer, &OutboundFrame::ToolError {\n                    id: \"ipc\".into(),\n                    error: format!(\"IPC parse error: {}\", e),\n                    code: \"IPC_ERROR\".into(),\n                });\n                continue;\n            }\n        };\n\n        match frame {\n            InboundFrame::Init { allowed_tools, session_seed, auto_mode } => {\n                manager.apply_init(allowed_tools, &session_seed, auto_mode);\n                let tools = manager.filtered_defs();\n                if write_frame(&mut writer, &OutboundFrame::Ready { tools }).is_err() {\n                    break; // stdout closed\n                }\n            }\n\n            InboundFrame::CallReq { id, name, action, args, timeout_secs } => {\n                let response = manager.handle_req(id, &name, &action, args, timeout_secs);\n                if write_frame(&mut writer, &response).is_err() {\n                    break;\n                }\n            }\n\n            InboundFrame::Cancel { id } => {\n                manager.cancel_tool(id.as_deref());\n            }\n\n            InboundFrame::ConfirmResp { id, approved } => {\n                // 暂未实现同步等待 ConfirmResp 的机制。\n                // 当前版本：Confirm 级别工具直接返回 ToolConfirmReq 帧，\n                // Agent 回复 ConfirmResp 时由 ToolManager 查找等待队列。\n                // 简单实现：记录响应但不做处理（保持设计为未来扩展）。\n                let _ = (id, approved);\n            }\n\n            InboundFrame::Shutdown => break,\n        }\n    }\n}\n","numLines":200,"startLine":1,"totalLines":200}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1f553a2a-ea5a-4ae2-b75a-dd407e094fbd","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"5bc1358c-a54c-4386-8199-da4aecf9a19b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"59a5a38e-a7ac-4411-95ac-4818352ad3f9","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK, so the issue is clear. The HP's `dispatch_frame` uses `line.split('\"').skip(1).next()` which gives `\"type\"` (the JSON key) instead of the value (`\"register\"`, `\"heartbeat\"`, etc.).\n\nThe fix: use `serde_json::Value` to parse the type field from the JSON frame. Minimal change, no underlying logic changed.\n\nLet me also think about what else is needed for today's usability:\n\n1. **Fix HP dispatch_frame** — critical, pipeline is broken without it\n2. **Fix HP main.rs warnings** — `mut stream` and `_sig_handler` — quick cleanup\n3. **Quick end-to-end test** — verify the pipeline works\n\nLet me do the fix now. Using serde_json::Value is the cleanest minimal change.\n\nActually, looking at the imports in main.rs, `serde_json` isn't imported directly but the `dsx_hp` crate uses it. The main.rs uses `serde_json::to_string` already (line 269), so serde_json is already a dependency.\n\nLet me also think about the `mut` warning for `stream` in handle_connection. Looking at line 179: `mut stream: TcpStream` — it doesn't need to be `mut` because the `try_clone()` calls create new handles. Actually, looking more carefully at the function, `stream` is used via `stream.try_clone()` which doesn't require `mut`. Let me check — in Rust, `TcpStream::try_clone(&self)` takes `&self`, not `&mut self`. So yes, `mut` is unnecessary.\n\nOK let me also think about `_sig_handler`. This is created on line 146 but never joined or used meaningfully. It calls `thread::park()` which blocks forever. The comment says \"In production, use a signal library or tokio signal.\" For now it's just a placeholder that does nothing useful since Ctrl+C kills the process anyway. I'll leave it as is but add the underscore prefix.\n\nActually wait, let me re-read the sig_handler code:\n\n```rust\nlet sig_handler = thread::spawn(move || {\n    let _ = svc_shutdown;\n    thread::park();\n});\n```\n\nThe warning says it should be `_sig_handler`. Let me just rename it.\n\nNow let me think about today's plan more holistically. The user wants to:\n1. Fix bugs blocking pipeline use\n2. Clean up enough that it's usable\n\nThe critical fix is dispatch_frame. After that, let me verify the pipeline works.\n\nLet me also check: when the user runs the pipeline, what's the user experience? They run:\n1. `dsx-hp &` (background daemon)\n2. `dsx-tui` (interactive TUI)\n\nThe TUI spawns agent, agent spawns tools. When the user types a message, it goes to agent which... right now, what does the agent do? Looking at agent's main loop:\n\n```rust\nmatch read_frame(&mut tui_reader) {\n    Some(frame) => {\n        if frame.contains(\"\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool_call\\\"\") {\n            // Forward to Tools\n        } else if frame.contains(\"\\\"type\\\":\\\"api_request\\\"\") && hp.is_some() {\n            // Forward to HP\n        } else if frame.contains(\"\\\"type\\\":\\\"shutdown\\\"\") {\n            // Shutdown\n        } else {\n            // Echo\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\nBut the TUI sends `{\"type\":\"user_input\",\"text\":\"...\"}` frames, which won't match `tool_call` or `api_request`, so it goes to the echo branch. The agent doesn't actually do anything intelligent yet — it's just a pipe.\n\nThe full agent capabilities (the orchestrator, conversation, context assembly, API calls, etc.) are in the dsx-agent library but the main binary is just a simple pipe.\n\nFor the user to \"use it today\", we need:\n1. The agent to actually process user input (call the LLM API, manage conversation, etc.)\n2. Tools to be callable\n\nHmm, but the user said \"不动底层逻辑\" (don't touch underlying logic). So maybe they just want the pipeline to be mechanically working — TUI → Agent → Tools/HP communication paths verified — not the full AI functionality.\n\nActually let me reconsider. The dsx-agent library has all the complex code (ContextAssembler, ContextBuilder, health module, etc.). The main.rs is just a thin pipe. Maybe the intent is that today we:\n1. Fix the HP dispatch bug\n2. Clean up warnings\n3. Make sure the binaries start, connect, and can exchange messages\n\nThen the full agent logic (actually calling LLM, managing conversations) would be built on top of this working pipe.\n\nLet me also check: is there any code for actually calling the Anthropic API? The API call logic would be in dsx-agent... let me check if there's an api module there.","signature":"59a5a38e-a7ac-4411-95ac-4818352ad3f9"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2033,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":39936,"output_tokens":1374,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"846aa703-1435-4a4c-bc22-d2aadd13988e","timestamp":"2026-05-15T03:13:00.180Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
