call forwarding). And the main loop returned None (EOF) before reaching cleanup. So `tools_writer` is still alive at this point.\n\nActually, `tools_writer` is defined on line 63 (in the current code it might be different due to our edits), and it's used in the main loop's tool_call branch. After the main loop breaks, `tools_writer` is still in scope.\n\nThe fix: add drop(tools_writer) before tools_child.wait() in the cleanup section.\n\nLet me also check: does the agent's main loop break cleanly when its stdin is closed? Yes, because `read_frame` calls `read_line` which returns Ok(0) on EOF, and `read_frame` returns `None`, and the `None => break` arm triggers.\n\nSo the flow after fixing would be:\n1. TUI closes agent_writer (agent's stdin)\n2. Agent sees EOF, breaks main loop\n3. Agent drops tools_writer (tools' stdin) → tools sees EOF\n4. Agent waits for tools → tools exits cleanly\n5. Agent unregisters from HP\n6. Agent exits\n7. TUI: child.wait() returns\n\nLet me add the drop(tools_writer) to agent's cleanup.","signature":"76c52310-58aa-40b3-8d86-9dd2f41c177b"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":176,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":72960,"output_tokens":942,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"cbcc89d0-5b7d-418f-a44d-6bbdc3bbab55","timestamp":"2026-05-15T03:18:56.473Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
