{"parentUuid":"66f5cbff-6a67-4735-97e7-beccd508bb3e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"f7d2ccb4-b542-4364-90f8-f5fed384245f","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"musl target 下载较慢，先给你说说方案。\n\n**静态链接：** 用 `x86_64-unknown-linux-musl` target 编译，出来的二进制不依赖 glibc，任何 Linux 都能跑。我们的 reqwest 已经用了 rustls（纯 Rust TLS），没有 OpenSSL 依赖，应该能过。\n\n**单一二进制：** 新建一个 `dsx` crate，作为调度入口：\n\n```\n$ dsx              # 默认启动 TUI\n$ dsx hp           # 启动健康守护进程\n$ dsx agent        # 启动 agent 子进程\n$ dsx tools        # 启动工具子进程\n```\n\n内部 TUI 启动 agent/tools 时不再找外部二进制，而是 `dsx agent`、`dsx tools` 这样子命令方式。4 个角色在一个二进制里，但进程隔离不变（仍然是独立 OS 进程）。\n\n不过这个要动一下 crate 结构：每个库需要暴露 `pub fn run()`，原来的 main.rs 变成薄包装。要不要搞？还是先等 musl 出来看看能不能静态编译过？"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":104,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":142464,"output_tokens":405,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"3e38b9ca-0edc-4aed-bc43-a1abb901d8cd","timestamp":"2026-05-15T03:39:10.437Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
