{"parentUuid":"84b36774-cc31-4868-a2b7-ea04452a05a4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"1486d7fa-94e9-4651-8245-877f348f1ff8","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The error is: `cannot read spec file '/usr/lib/x86_64-linux-musl/musl-gcc.specs': No such file or directory`\n\nThe `musl-gcc` wrapper needs a specs file at `/usr/lib/x86_64-linux-musl/musl-gcc.specs`. This file is part of the `musl-dev` package but might need to be at a specific system path.\n\nThe issue is that the `musl-gcc` wrapper uses GCC with a custom specs file to link against musl's libc. This specs file needs to be at the system path.\n\nThis is getting complex. The musl toolchain was designed to be installed system-wide with `sudo apt install musl-tools musl-dev`. The extracted deb files expect to be at system paths.\n\nLet me try a different approach: create the missing specs file manually, and set up the right include/library paths.\n\nOr... let me try the simplest approach: use `cross` (cross-rs) for musl builds.\n\nActually, let me just tell the user. The musl static build needs `sudo apt install musl-tools musl-dev` to install the system-wide musl toolchain. Without that, we can't compile native C code against musl.\n\nBUT — there's an alternative. The `esaxx-rs` and `aws-lc-sys` crates are the ones that need C/C++ compilation. These are pulled in by dependencies I might be able to avoid.\n\nLet me check: which dependency pulls in `aws-lc-sys`?\n\nActually, `aws-lc-sys` is part of the AWS rustls provider. Let me check if `reqwest` with `rustls` uses the `aws-lc-rs` provider or the `ring` provider.\n\nreqwest with `rustls` feature uses `rustls` which can use either `aws-lc-rs` or `ring` as its crypto provider. The default is `aws-lc-rs`. If I switch to `ring`, it might avoid the C compilation issue.\n\nBut this is a deep dependency change that I shouldn't make without understanding the implications.\n\nLet me take the pragmatic approach: tell the user what's needed for musl, and suggest they run `sudo apt install musl-tools musl-dev` themselves, at which point I can complete the static build.","signature":"1486d7fa-94e9-4651-8245-877f348f1ff8"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4084,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":179968,"output_tokens":779,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"02cdcdd6-0086-4db5-939c-ae53261246b8","timestamp":"2026-05-15T03:47:16.613Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"02cdcdd6-0086-4db5-939c-ae53261246b8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"1486d7fa-94e9-4651-8245-877f348f1ff8","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Musl 静态链接遇到阻碍——需要系统级安装 musl toolchain 来编译 C 依赖（`aws-lc-sys`、`esaxx-rs`）。我没办法绕过 sudo。\n\n不过基本情况和方案已经完整：让 **单一二进制 + 静态链接** 可以正常使用，只需要你跑一条命令：\n\n```bash\nsudo apt install musl-tools musl-dev\n```\n\n然后我就能用 musl target 编出完全静态的 13MB 单一二进制 `dsx`，不依赖任何系统库，扔到任何 Linux 机器上直接跑。\n\n目前已经完成的部分：\n\n**单一二进制 `dsx`（已工作 ✅）：**\n```\n$ dsx hp &        # 启动健康守护进程（API 代理 + 进程注册）\n$ dsx             # 启动 TUI（交互式聊天）\n$ dsx agent       # agent 子进程（对话管理）\n$ dsx tools       # 工具执行服务器\n```\n\n**测试验证（glibc 版本）：**\n- 单二进制 13MB，四种角色共用\n- 完整管道：dsx → agent → tools + HP(DeepSeek API)\n- 多轮对话正确跟踪上下文\n- 退出码 0\n\n你先跑安装命令，我接着帮你编完整版本？"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4084,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":179968,"output_tokens":779,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"5c6685d1-7993-4834-83de-62ace33ec630","timestamp":"2026-05-15T03:47:19.762Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.141","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
