{"parentUuid":"1db497fa-b280-4ffb-b202-f640bbc5c8c2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"a75cd047-d5e7-4a1b-bf15-3b5471b1d8f6","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"好，不读代码。按模块排优先级，从最可能的开始：\n\n**1. crossterm::event（最可疑）**\n`poll(100ms)` 在你的终端（Konsole）下可能永远不等 100ms——raw mode 下终端会持续发光标位置协商包，crossterm 解析成事件，poll 永远立刻返回。CPU 烧在这里。`--readline` 不用 crossterm，所以没事。\n\n**2. render 中的 DS_BANNER（次可疑）**\n那个大 ASCII art 每次 draw 都逐行渲染。加上你的终端可能是窄屏走 `render_all_vertical`，路径没测试过。\n\n**3. AgentConnection 的 background thread**\n有 100 条上限的 channel，但线程本身活着就在消耗资源。万一收到的帧格式不对走 `log::warn!()`，而这个日志模块没初始化等于白打，线程继续跑。\n\n**4. ratatui Terminal 自身**\n如果初始化时终端尺寸探测失败（比如非标准 Konsole 配置），可能导致 ratatui 内部 buffer 异常。\n\n要快速定位的话，可以试 **关掉 crossterm 事件系统，用 stdin 读代替**——这基本就是 `--readline` 的键盘处理方式。要不要试这个方案？只替换事件读取，保留 ratatui 渲染。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":227,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":320896,"output_tokens":1754,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"6924ade9-86ac-4d11-8cc0-4328b25b39be","timestamp":"2026-05-15T04:45:38.468Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
