{"parentUuid":"8687761b-420c-4355-b8e1-59b9809b3895","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"8749ff29-fe61-4a56-9b28-cab1d532b313","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"不是合并进程。agent 还是独立子进程，只是**通信方式**不同：\n\n**当前正常模式（出问题的）：**\n```\nTUI 主线程 ─→ 写 stdin\n         ─→ channel ← background thread ← 读 agent stdout\n```\n两个线程、一个 channel、异步非阻塞读。\n\n**`--demo` / `--readline` 的直连方式（没问题的）：**\n```\nTUI 主线程 ─→ 写 stdin\n         ─→ 发送后直接 blocking 读 agent stdout\n```\n一个线程、同步阻塞读。\n\n两边的 agent 都是独立进程，HP/tools 也完全不变。只是 TUI 读 agent 回复的方式从\"后台线程+channel\"改成了\"直接等回复\"。\n\n要改吗？就半小时的事。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":175,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":344448,"output_tokens":1306,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"ca570ed3-3d09-4b01-80dd-ff771d4aeee6","timestamp":"2026-05-15T05:00:45.643Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
