{"parentUuid":"98b0241e-d696-48ad-9af9-eb8feae7c6c4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"51bc4dea-bbae-4b46-9062-02dd95bffaef","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about future Tauri GUI integration. Let me explain:\n\nTauri is a desktop GUI framework that uses a webview (Rust backend + HTML/JS frontend). For a Tauri GUI, the architecture would need to communicate with the agent process differently than the current TUI.\n\nKey insight: Tauri wouldn't use stdin/stdout pipes directly. Instead, it would use:\n1. HTTP/WebSocket to HP (which aggregates everything)\n2. Or direct TCP/IPC to agent/hp\n\nThe current 5-process architecture already separates concerns:\n- `dsx`/`dsx-tui` → frontend (TUI or Tauri)\n- `dsx-agent` → conversation management\n- `dsx-tools` → tool execution\n- `dsx-hp` → API proxy + health daemon\n\nThe communication protocol between frontend and backend is JSON-LP (already defined). Whether it's over stdin/stdout pipes (TUI) or TCP/WebSocket (Tauri), the protocol is the same.\n\nSo the question is: should the TUI communicate via:\nA) stdin/stdout pipes (current approach for both readline and --demo)\nB) TCP to HP (future-proof, same as Tauri would use)\n\nOption B would make TUI and Tauri share the same communication pattern - both talk to HP via TCP. The agent becomes a \"headless\" backend process that HP manages.\n\nBut right now the TUI spawns agent directly (not through HP). The agent isn't managed by HP in that sense.\n\nFor future Tauri compatibility, the cleanest architecture would be:\n1. HP is always running (daemon mode)\n2. TUI or Tauri both connect to HP via TCP\n3. HP manages agent lifecycle\n4. JSON-LP protocol over TCP for both frontends\n\nBut this is a bigger change. For today, the simpler fix is just to change the TUI's communication with agent from \"background thread + channel\" to \"direct blocking reads\". This doesn't affect Tauri at all because Tauri would use a completely different transport.\n\nLet me answer the user concisely.","signature":"51bc4dea-bbae-4b46-9062-02dd95bffaef"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":242,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":344576,"output_tokens":648,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"d6c759b5-ad5c-4f41-b9ad-e5f9ff997c53","timestamp":"2026-05-15T05:01:39.209Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"d6c759b5-ad5c-4f41-b9ad-e5f9ff997c53","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"51bc4dea-bbae-4b46-9062-02dd95bffaef","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Tauri 不走 stdin/stdout，它走 TCP/WebSocket 到 HP。所以 TUI 内部的通信方式不影响 Tauri。\n\n整个架构是三层：\n```\nTUI (进程) ── JSON-LP/stdin ──→ Agent (进程) ──→ Tools\n  │                                  │\n  │                                  └─→ HP (daemon) ──→ API\n  │\nTauri (未来) ── TCP/WebSocket ──→ HP (daemon) ──→ API\n                        │\n                        └─→ 未来也可以管理 Agent\n```\n\nTUI 和 Agent 之间的管道怎么读（同步还是异步），跟 Tauri 完全不搭界。Tauri 会另起一条通路到 HP。\n\n所以现在放心改——把 TUI 的通信改成直连阻塞读（像 `--demo` 那样），不绑死架构，不影响将来。要改吗？"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":242,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":344576,"output_tokens":648,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"369a7574-a801-498c-bf03-4ac8a8ce8470","timestamp":"2026-05-15T05:01:41.686Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
