{"parentUuid":"71c80daa-cabc-415a-a293-f5fbff72a167","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"5c0511fb-cb71-4ca7-89c6-7193f2ad2716","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"可以不需要完整的 agent 库编排层。agent 库的 orchestrator、session、memory 等模块代码都在，只是当前的 `runner.rs`（~200 行）跳过了它们。\n\n迁移路径很简单——**扩展 runner.rs 的主循环**，在现有管道上加逻辑，不重构：\n\n```\n当前：\nTUI → agent(api_chat) → HP → API\n                  ↓\n          回复 → TUI\n\n加 tool 后：\nTUI → agent(api_chat) → HP → API\n                  ↓\n        回复含 tool_call → tools 执行 → 结果送回 HP → API(第二轮)\n                  ↓\n          最终回复 → TUI\n```\n\n每个加的功能就是 runner.rs 的 `handle_user_input` 里加几段逻辑：\n- 判断回复里有没有 tool_calls → 有就调 tools → 再发回 HP\n- 每轮结束后调用 `session::finalize_session` 存盘\n- 调用 `memory::SemanticMemory` 提取知识\n\n不是迁移，是**加法**——管道不动，功能往上堆。要开始接吗？从哪个先来？"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":132,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":362496,"output_tokens":859,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"48c3eb4a-1a6d-471b-b13c-49c0db01a506","timestamp":"2026-05-15T05:10:29.441Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
