pe\":\"api_response\",\"content\":\"...\"}\n```\n\nI need to extend it to:\n```\n{\"type\":\"api_response\",\"content\":\"...\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"id\":\"...\",\"name\":\"...\",\"arguments\":\"...\"}]}\n```\n\nThen in the agent:\n1. If tool_calls present: forward each to tools process\n2. Get results from tools\n3. Build conversation with tool results\n4. Send new api_chat to HP\n5. Repeat\n\nThis requires changes in:\n- HP `runner.rs` → `handle_api_chat()`: include tool_calls in response\n- Agent `runner.rs` → `handle_user_input()`: loop until no more tool_calls\n\nFor the incremental tool calling, I also need to handle the conversation correctly. Each round adds:\n- User's original message (or empty continuation)\n- Assistant's response with tool_calls\n- Tool results\n\nThen HP needs these passed as the full conversation.\n\nLet me plan the changes more carefully. Actually, let me focus on getting the current build working first and present the slash fix to the user. Then tackle tool calling step by step.\n\nActually, let me just present what I've fixed and ask the user what feature to add back first.","signature":"b537737b-370f-4dd1-aaf2-548a6c1554be"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":194,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":368768,"output_tokens":840,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"a234d2b1-c712-407c-b3b6-bff4d9cb06dd","timestamp":"2026-05-15T05:12:43.755Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
