{"parentUuid":"4cb818cb-aa1c-4f58-91d0-20f77d5aca49","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"9a3e5348-482c-49e2-b98c-96bbc93990b1","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking what features haven't been restored yet. Let me think about what the original architecture had vs what's currently working in the new pipeline.\n\n**Currently working:**\n- Chat/typing\n- API calls (via HP → DeepSeek)\n- Tool calling (agent forwards to tools, sends results back to HP)\n- Conversation management with cache-friendly compaction\n- Slash commands (/lang, /model, /effort, /quit)\n- Config persistence (~/.dsx/config.json)\n- HP daemon (process registration, health monitoring)\n- Auto-start HP\n- Static single binary\n\n**Not yet restored (from the original architecture):**\n\n1. **Session persistence** - Save/restore conversations. The `session` module has `finalize_session`, `load_index`, etc. Currently no session is saved when the user quits.\n\n2. **Memory system** - Long-term memory, short-term memory, semantic memory, pitfall guide. Not wired in the agent runner.\n\n3. **Skills** - SkillIndex, slash command skills. Not wired.\n\n4. **Agent health monitoring** - The `DsAgentsHealthPlatform` in dsx-agent tracks errors, consecutive failures, context tier, etc. Not wired.\n\n5. **Phase detection** - The orchestrator's phase detector tracks what phase the conversation is in (explore, code, debug, etc.). Not wired.\n\n6. **Auto mode** - Automatic tool execution without user confirmation. Not wired.\n\n7. **TUI features** - The ratatui render has panels for workspace, tool code preview, exec output, etc. Currently only chat panel + minimal workspace is shown.\n\n8. **Streaming** - The current pipeline sends the full response at once (non-streaming). The original had streaming deltas.\n\n9. **Balance query** - `/balance` command to check API quota. Not wired.\n\n10. **Resume session** - `--resume` flag to continue a previous session. Not wired.\n\n11. **Tool confirmation** - Safety gates for dangerous tools. Not wired (tools execute immediately).\n\n12. **Sudo mode** - For elevated operations. Not wired.\n\nThe most impactful ones to restore (in order):\n1. Session persistence - so conversations aren't lost on restart\n2. Streaming - better UX than waiting for full response\n3. Auto mode - for multi-step tasks without manual confirmation\n\nBut the user asked what's NOT restored. Let me give a concise answer.","signature":"9a3e5348-482c-49e2-b98c-96bbc93990b1"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":127,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":396160,"output_tokens":797,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"0e37ae5c-6ebb-42fb-ae49-874403da8177","timestamp":"2026-05-15T05:26:02.189Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"0e37ae5c-6ebb-42fb-ae49-874403da8177","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"9a3e5348-482c-49e2-b98c-96bbc93990b1","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"主要没接的：\n\n**会话层**\n| 功能 | 状态 | 影响 |\n|------|------|------|\n| session 持久化 | ❌ | 退出后对话丢失，不能--resume |\n| 流式响应 | ❌ | 现在一次返回全文，没有逐字输出 |\n| /balance | ❌ | 不能查余额 |\n| auto_mode | ❌ | 每次 tool 都要等（但现在是自动执行的，少了确认提示而已） |\n\n**记忆/上下文层**\n| 功能 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| 长时记忆 / 短时记忆 | ❌ |\n| 语义记忆（架构决策提取） | ❌ |\n| 陷阱指南 | ❌ |\n| Phase 检测 | ❌ |\n\n**TUI 显示层**\n| 面板 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| tool code 预览 | ❌ |\n| exec 输出面板 | ❌ |\n| workspace 面板 | ❌ |\n| 弹窗（确认/选择器） | ❌ |\n\n**安全层**\n| 功能 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| tool 安全门 | ❌ 目前直接执行 |\n| sudo 模式 | ❌ |\n\n哪个先接？我个人建议 **session 持久化**或**流式响应**，对日常使用影响最大。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":127,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":396160,"output_tokens":797,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"8ced5f15-a9e8-4b04-a80e-bec186512ca9","timestamp":"2026-05-15T05:26:03.792Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
