{"parentUuid":"ee04aea2-1d1e-4e6b-8c46-d5f932b9bd60","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"d69a67f4-81fe-48b2-9f4c-fb0cce3c4e59","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_00_hQLaDtmswl2RV1aUgmJt5884","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here is the exhaustive report on the DSX Rust project.\n\n---\n\n## PROJECT OVERVIEW\n\n**DSX (DeepSeek X Agents)** v4.0.0-alpha1 is a multi-process AI coding assistant. The workspace contains 7 crates (5 binaries + 2 libraries), totaling approximately 80 source files across 15 module teams.\n\nWorkspace root: `/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx`\nBuild target: `release`\n\n---\n\n## WORKSPACE CONFIGURATION\n\n`/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/Cargo.toml`\n\n- resolver = \"2\"\n- Edition 2021, MIT license\n- 7 members:\n  1. `crates/dsx-types` (lib)\n  2. `crates/dsx-proto` (lib)\n  3. `crates/dsx` (bin -- umbrella)\n  4. `crates/dsx-hp` (bin)\n  5. `crates/dsx-agent` (bin)\n  6. `crates/dsx-tools` (bin)\n  7. `crates/dsx-tui` (bin)\n\n---\n\n## ARCHITECTURE (Multi-Process)\n\n```\ndsx-hp (TCP daemon, port 9001)\n  |-- Health platform, API proxy, process registry, sentinel\n  |-- Only process that holds the API key\n  |\n  +-- dsx-tui (ratatui terminal UI, parent process)\n       |-- Spawns dsx-agent via stdin/stdout JSON-LP\n       |\n       +-- dsx-agent (conversation orchestrator, stdin/stdout)\n            |-- Spawns dsx-tools via stdin/stdout JSON-LP\n            |-- Connects to dsx-hp via TCP JSON-LP\n            |\n            +-- dsx-tools (sandboxed tool execution, stdin/stdout)\n```\n\n---\n\n## CRATE DETAILS\n\n### 1. `dsx-types` -- Shared Type Library\n\n**Path:** `/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/crates/dsx-types/`\n**Cargo.toml:** `/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/crates/dsx-types/Cargo.toml`\n**lib.rs:** `/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/crates/dsx-types/src/lib.rs`\n**Dependencies:** serde, serde_json, thiserror\n\n**Public modules (9):**\n\n| Module | Source File | Description |\n|--------|------------|-------------|\n| `message` | `src/message.rs` | `Message`, `ToolCall`, `FunctionCall` |\n| `safety` | `src/safety.rs` | `SafetyLevel` |\n| `tool_def` | `src/tool_def.rs` | `ToolDef`, `ToolFunction` |\n| `state` | `src/state.rs` | `AgentPhase`, `TaskPhase`, `DebugLevel`, `RouterCommand` |\n| `config` | `src/config.rs` | `PersistentConfig`, `ProfileConfig`, `UserPreferences` |\n| `session` | `src/session.rs` | `SessionFile`, `SessionMeta`, `StreamState` |\n| `anthropic` | `src/anthropic.rs` | `AnthropicContent`, `AnthropicMessage`, `AnthropicTool`, `AnthropicThinking`, `AnthropicRequest`, `AnthropicStreamEvent`, and more |\n| `api_types` | `src/api_types.rs` | `UsageInfo`, `TokenDetails`, `ModelInfo`, `ModelList`, `BalanceInfo`, `BalanceEntry` |\n| `convert` | `src/convert.rs` | Conversion utilities |\n| `error` | `src/error.rs` | `DsxError`, `IpcError`, `ApiError`, `ToolError`, `HealthError` |\n| `serde` | `src/serde.rs` | `SerdeError`, `encode_msg`, `encode_msg_with_max`, `decode_msg`, `try_decode_msg`, `MAX_FRAME_SIZE` |\n| `token` | `src/token.rs` | `TokenCount`, `TokenBreakdown`, `estimate_messages_tokens`, `count_tokens`, `format_tokens`, `context_usage_ratio` |\n\n---\n\n### 2. `dsx-proto` -- IPC Protocol Library\n\n**Path:** `/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/crates/dsx-proto/`\n**Cargo.toml:** `/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/crates/dsx-proto/Cargo.toml`\n**lib.rs:** `/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/crates/dsx-proto/src/lib.rs`\n**Dependencies:** dsx-types, serde, serde_json\n\nCurrently the lib.rs only contains a doc comment `//! DSX IPC message protocol -- shared between all processes`. The actual IPC frame definitions live in `dsx-tools/src/ipc.rs` instead (see below).\n\n---\n\n### 3. `dsx` -- Umbrella Binary\n\n**Path:** `/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/crates/dsx/`\n**Cargo.toml:** `/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/crates/dsx/Cargo.toml`\n**main.rs:** `/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/crates/dsx/src/main.rs`\n**Dependencies:** dsx-hp, dsx-agent, dsx-tools, dsx-tui, serde_json, anyhow\n\nThe single entry point that dispatches based on argv[1]:\n- `dsx hp` -> calls `dsx_hp::runner::run()`\n- `dsx agent` -> calls `dsx_agent::runner::run()`\n- `dsx tools` -> calls `dsx_tools::run()`\n- `dsx config` -> runs interactive config setup (writes `~/.dsx/config.json`)\n- `dsx` (default) -> calls `dsx_tui::run()`\n\nSets env var `DSX_SINGLE_BINARY=1` on startup.\n\n---\n\n### 4. `dsx-hp` -- Health Platform Daemon\n\n**Path:** `/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/crates/dsx-hp/`\n**Cargo.toml:** `/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/crates/dsx-hp/Cargo.toml`\n**main.rs:** `/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/crates/dsx-hp/src/main.rs`\n**lib.rs:** `/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/crates/dsx-hp/src/lib.rs`\n**runner.rs:** `/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/crates/dsx-hp/src/runner.rs`\n**Dependencies:** dsx-types, dsx-proto, tokio, reqwest (rustls, json, stream), serde, serde_json, log, futures-util, anyhow\n\n**All source files (22):**\n\n| File | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `src/lib.rs` | Re-exports. Defines `StreamEvent` enum and `AccumulatedToolCall` struct. Public modules listed below. |\n| `src/main.rs` | Binary entry point, delegates to `runner::run()` |\n| `src/runner.rs` | TCP server loop, connection handler, frame dispatch, `api_chat` handler (HTTP to LLM API) |\n| `src/client.rs` | HTTP client for Anthropic API calls |\n| `src/config.rs` | API config (key, base_url) |\n| `src/converter.rs` | Message conversion utilities |\n| `src/types.rs` | HpError, ProcessKind, Verdict, ProcessHealth, ProcessSummary |\n| `src/registry.rs` | ProcessRegistry (heartbeat tracking) |\n| `src/pipeline.rs` | Health judgment pipeline |\n| `src/ipc_traits.rs` | HealthProbe trait definition |\n| `src/assessment.rs` | Health assessment logic |\n| `src/audit.rs` | Health audit trail |\n| `src/circuit_breaker.rs` | Circuit breaker pattern |\n| `src/emotion.rs` | Agent emotion inference |\n| `src/gate.rs` | Tool gate / safety checks |\n| `src/liveness.rs` | Liveness probing |\n| `src/monitor.rs` | MonitorState