ib.rs` | Main module: `ToolManager`, `ToolHandler`, `ToolCallCtx`, `ToolResult`, `ToolKey`, IPC entry point |\n| `src/main.rs` | Binary entry point, calls `ipc::ipc_main_loop` |\n| `src/registration.rs` | `build_tool_manager()` -- registers all tool handlers |\n| `src/ipc.rs` | JSON-LP IPC protocol frames (`InboundFrame`, `OutboundFrame` enums) + frame reader/writer + `ipc_main_loop` |\n| `src/exec.rs` | Tool: exec command, sudo, PTY |\n| `src/explore.rs` | Tool: filesystem exploration |\n| `src/file.rs` | Tool: file read/write/edit/diff |\n| `src/git.rs` | Tool: git operations (status, diff, log, commit) |\n| `src/web.rs` | Tool: web fetch, search |\n| `src/meta.rs` | Tool: list_skills, read_skill_ref, glance (metadata) |\n| `src/task.rs` | Tool: task CRUD |\n| `src/plan.rs` | Tool: plan CRUD |\n| `src/memory.rs` | Tool: memory save/read/forget/recall/pitfall |\n| `src/status.rs` | Tool: status |\n| `src/ask.rs` | Tool: ask_user |\n| `src/safety.rs` | Safety classification, `SafetyVerdict` |\n| `src/stubs.rs` | Phase 4 stubs |\n\n**IPC Protocol** (defined in `src/ipc.rs`):\n\nInbound frames (Agent -> Tools):\n- `tools_init` -- initialization with allowed tools list, session seed, auto_mode\n- `tool_call_req` -- tool call with id, name, action, args, timeout_secs\n- `tool_cancel` -- cancel specific or all tools\n- `tool_confirm_resp` -- user approval/denial for confirm requests\n- `tools_shutdown` -- shutdown signal\n\nOutbound frames (Tools -> Agent):\n- `tools_ready` -- ready signal with tool definitions\n- `tool_progress` -- streaming progress (stdout/stderr/progress)\n- `tool_result` -- legacy result (id, success, content)\n- `tool_result_message` -- structured result with error flag\n- `tool_error` -- error with code (UNKNOWN_TOOL, BLOCKED, TIMEOUT, PANIC, FORBIDDEN)\n- `tool_confirm_req` -- request user confirmation\n\n---\n\n### 7. `dsx-tui` -- Terminal UI\n\n**Path:** `/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/crates/dsx-tui/`\n**Cargo.toml:** `/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/c