nded migration target but is currently a stub.\n\n---\n\n## `input/` Subdirectory\n\n### 11. `input/mod.rs` (18 lines) -- COMPLETE\nModule wiring and re-exports. Nothing of substance.\n\n### 12. `input/action.rs` (82 lines) -- COMPLETE\n`InputAction` enum with variants: `None`, `SendMessage`, `SetBuffer`, `ConfirmTools`, `RejectTools`, `SubmitSudo`, `CancelSudo`, `SelectIntent`, `LoadSession`, `ScrollUp`, `ScrollDown`, `ScrollPageUp`, `ScrollPageDown`, `ScrollToTop`, `ScrollToBottom`, `ToggleAutoScroll`, `OpenSlashSubmenu`, `RequestExit`, `ConfirmExit`, `CancelExit`, `CancelStream`, `CancelExec`. Also defines `NO_ACTION` constant.\n\n**Implementation status:** Complete.\n\n### 13. `input/chat.rs` (226 lines) -- COMPLETE\n`handle_chat_key(state, key, commands) -> InputAction` -- full keyboard handler for Chat mode:\n- Submenu navigation (inside slash submenu)\n- Slash menu navigation with filtering\n- Normal text input (all standard keys: characters, backspace, delete, arrows, home/end, Enter sends message, Ctrl+Enter inserts newline, Ctrl+D/U scroll)\n- Auto-opens slash menu when `/` is typed at buffer start\n- `update_slash_items` filters command list by input\n- `build_submenu_items` provides submenu options for /effort, /model, /lang\n\n**Implementation status:** Complete. Handles multi-byte characters correctly via `utils::char_boundary`.\n\n### 14. `input/confirm.rs` (24 lines) -- COMPLETE\n`handle_confirm_key` and `handle_danger_key` -- both map Enter to `ConfirmTools`, Esc to `RejectTools`.\n\n### 15. `input/picker.rs` (86 lines) -- COMPLETE\n- `handle_intent_picker_key` -- supports letter keys (A-F mapped to options), typed custom input, Enter to submit. Uses CJK-safe cursor operations.\n- `handle_session_picker_key` -- supports Up/Down navigation, Enter to load selected session, Esc to quit.\n\n### 16. `input/state.rs` (168 lines) -- COMPLETE\n`InputState` with sub-states:\n- `InputMode` enum (Chat, Confirm, Danger, Sudo, IntentPicker, SessionPicker)\n- `Ch