d.rs` | 18 | **Complete** | Nothing |\n| `input/action.rs` | 82 | **Complete** | Nothing |\n| `input/chat.rs` | 226 | **Complete** | Nothing |\n| `input/confirm.rs` | 24 | **Complete** | Nothing |\n| `input/picker.rs` | 86 | **Complete** | Nothing |\n| `input/state.rs` | 168 | **Complete** | Nothing |\n| `input/sudo.rs` | 31 | **Complete** | Nothing |\n| `render/mod.rs` | 160 | **Complete** | Nothing |\n| `render/chat.rs` | 846 | **Complete** | Nothing |\n| `render/input.rs` | 98 | **Complete** | Nothing |\n| `render/popups.rs` | 410 | **Complete** | Nothing |\n| `render/tool_code.rs` | 97 | **Complete** | Nothing |\n| `render/workspace.rs` | 37 | **STUB** | `render_workspace()` is a no-op (TODO E03); `render_info_panel()` is minimal |\n\n---\n\n## Critical Findings\n\n1. **`event_loop()` in lib.rs is dead code.** It implements the correct architecture (using `AgentConnection::drain_frames()`) but is never called. The inline loop in `run_impl()` uses raw pipe reads instead.\n\n2. **`render/workspace.rs` is a stub.** The workspace panel (project info, plans, tasks, health errors, memory overview) and the full info panel (health icons, emotion, context bar, runtime) are completely missing from the new render architecture. The legacy `workspace.rs` has these but is not wired through `render_all()`.\n\n3. **The entire stubs module** (lib.rs lines 659-999, ~340 lines) is placeholder code for Phase 4 cross-crate IPC. None of the orchestrator, context, health, memory, or config functionality actually works -- everything returns empty/no-op defaults.\n\n4. **Two parallel architectures exist.** The old `App` struct (app.rs) with ~80 fields is still used by `commands.rs` and legacy `workspace.rs`. The new disaggregated `AppState` + `StreamBuffer` + `AgentConnection` + `RenderContext` (state.rs) is used by the render layer. They are not fully reconciled.\n\n5. **`run_impl()` spawns the agent twice conceptually** -- once as a raw `Command` child (for actual IPC) and once as `Ag