e old `workspace.rs` (263 lines) to the new `render/workspace.rs`. The old version shows:\n- Workspace section header\n- Low-balance warning\n- Status messages\n- Active plan\n- Task summary\n- File changes\n- Health errors\n- Model, phase, effort, auto-mode tag\n- Health icon, emotion\n- Context bar (visual filled/empty bar)\n- Balance, session runtime, version\n\nThe new version should use `RenderContext` instead of `&App`. Add any missing fields to `RenderContext` in `state.rs` as needed.\n\n### Step 3: Clean up dead code and stubs\n1. In `lib.rs`: The `event_loop()` function (around line 549) is a properly implemented ratatui event loop that uses `AgentConnection::drain_frames()` — but it's NEVER called. Either:\n   - Wire it in to replace the inline loop in `run_impl()`, OR\n   - Delete it if the inline loop is preferred\n\n2. In `lib.rs`: The `stubs` module (lines 659-999, ~340 lines) contains no-op implementations. These exist because the TUI was compiled without the agent crate. Now that dsx-tui can depend on dsx-agent types:\n   - Check if dsx-tui's Cargo.toml can add dsx-agent as a dependency\n   - If yes: remove stubs that duplicate agent types\n   - If no: keep stubs but mark them clearly as IPC-placeholders\n\n3. Check if `app.rs` can be removed entirely or reduced. The new `AppState` + `RenderContext` should be the single source of truth.\n\n### Step 4: Migrate commands.rs\n`commands.rs` uses `&mut App` (old). Change it to use the new state types (`AppState`, `AgentConnection`, etc.) or make it work with `RenderContext`.\n\n### Step 5: Verify render_all wires everything\nIn `render/mod.rs`, check that `render_all()` calls BOTH:\n- `render_workspace()` (the new one)\n- `render_info_panel()` (the new one)\n\nCurrently the dispatch may not be calling the workspace at all.\n\n## Important\n- Do NOT run `cargo test`\n- Do NOT break the working TUI (keyboard input, chat rendering, popups must keep working)\n- The `run_impl()` inline event loop is working — be careful not to break it\n- `AgentConnection` currently spawns in stub mode in `run_impl()` — the real communication goes through raw pipes. Don't break this.\n\n## Deliverable\n1. Modified files with unified architecture\n2. Working `render/workspace.rs` with full workspace panel\n3. Cleaned up dead code and stubs\n4. Report: what was done, what couldn't be done, any compilation issues","run_in_background":true}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":79,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":76288,"output_tokens":4342,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"c85122eb-8fd9-4afe-9415-5df6c41afe54","timestamp":"2026-05-15T05:43:42.443Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
