{"parentUuid":"260ebbf6-146f-4ac2-a0d6-0961cb33ea8e","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx-integration","attachment":{"type":"edited_text_file","filename":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/crates/dsx-proto/src/lib.rs","snippet":"1\t//! DSX IPC message protocol — shared frame definitions for all processes.\n2\t//!\n3\t//! Every frame is a single-line JSON object (`\\n` delimited), tagged with `\"type\"`.\n4\t//!\n5\t//! ## Channels\n6\t//!\n7\t//! | Channel | Transport | Direction |\n8\t//! |---------|-----------|-----------|\n9\t//! | TUI ↔ Agent | stdin/stdout pipes | Bidirectional |\n10\t//! | Agent ↔ Tools | stdin/stdout pipes | Bidirectional |\n11\t//! | Agent → HP | TCP localhost | Bidirectional |\n12\t//!\n13\t//! ## Frame categories\n14\t//!\n15\t//! - `TuiToAgent` / `AgentToTui` — TUI ↔ Agent JSON-LP over pipes\n16\t//! - `AgentToTools` / `ToolsToAgent` — Agent ↔ Tools JSON-LP over pipes\n17\t//! - `AgentToHp` / `HpToAgent` — Agent ↔ HP JSON-LP over TCP\n18\t\n19\tuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\n20\t\n21\t// ── TUI ↔ Agent ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n22\t\n23\t/// TUI → Agent frames (stdin pipe).\n24\t#[derive(Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\n25\t#[serde(tag = \"type\")]\n26\tpub enum TuiToAgent {\n27\t    #[serde(rename = \"user_input\")]\n28\t    UserInput { text: String },\n29\t\n30\t    #[serde(rename = \"tool_call\")]\n31\t    ToolCall {\n32\t        id: String,\n33\t        name: String,\n34\t        action: String,\n35\t        args: serde_json::Value,\n36\t    },\n37\t\n38\t    #[serde(rename = \"shutdown\")]\n39\t    Shutdown,\n40\t}\n41\t\n42\t/// Agent → TUI frames (stdout pipe).\n43\t#[derive(Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\n44\t#[serde(tag = \"type\")]\n45\tpub enum AgentToTui {\n46\t    /// Streaming content delta (one token or small chunk).\n47\t    #[serde(rename = \"content_delta\")]\n48\t    ContentDelta {\n49\t        delta: String,\n50\t        #[serde(skip_serializing_if = \"Option::is_none\")]\n51\t        re