r, \"{}\", json_response(\"error\", &e));\n                    let _ = writer.flush();\n                    return;\n                }\n                _ => {}\n            }\n        }\n    });\n}","originalFile":null,"structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":515,"oldLines":6,"newStart":515,"newLines":213,"lines":["     }"," }"," ","+/// Streaming variant of `handle_api_chat` — writes content deltas to `writer`","+/// as they arrive from the LLM, then a final `api_response` frame.","+///","+/// Frame sequence written to writer:","+///   {\"type\":\"content_delta\",\"delta\":\"Hello\",\"reasoning\":null}","+///   {\"type\":\"content_delta\",\"delta\":\", world\",\"reasoning\":null}","+///   {\"type\":\"api_response\",\"content\":\"...\",\"tool_calls\":[...],...}","+fn handle_api_chat_streaming(line: &str, writer: &mut impl Write) {","+    let config = match HP_CONFIG.get() {","+        Some(c) => c.clone(),","+        None => {","+            let _ = writeln!(writer, \"{}\", json_response(\"error\", \"HP not configured (no API key)\"));","+            let _ = writer.flush();","+            return;","+        }","+    };","+","+    let v: serde_json::Value = match serde_json::from_str(line) {","+        Ok(v) => v,","+        Err(e) => {","+            let _ = writeln!(writer, \"{}\", json_response(\"error\", &format!(\"invalid api_chat frame: {e}\")));","+            let _ = writer.flush();","+            return;","+        }","+    };","+","+    let model = v.get(\"model\").and_then(|v| v.as_str()).unwrap_or(\"deepseek-v4-flash\");","+    let system = v.get(\"system\").and_then(|v| v.as_str()).map(String::from);","+","+    let messages_val = match v.get(\"messages\").and_then(|v| v.as_array()) {","+        Some(arr) => arr,","+        None => {","+            let _ = writeln!(writer, \"{}\", json_response(\"error\", \"api_chat: missing messages array\"));","+            let _ = writer.flush();","+            return;","+        }","+    };","+","+    let anthropic_msgs: Vec<An