urns Vec of `{\"id\": \"...\", \"name\": \"NAME\", \"arguments\": \"...\"}` in anthropic flat format\n\nAlso strip the XML blocks from the visible content so users don't see the raw XML in the chat.\n\n### Where to add\n\nOption A (simpler): Add to `crates/dsx-agent/src/runner.rs` in the api_response handler:\n- After `HpToAgent::ApiResponse { content, tool_calls, ... }`, if `tool_calls` is None/empty AND content contains `<tool_use>`, parse XML tool calls\n- Add parsed tool calls to the response\n- Strip XML blocks from content\n\nOption B: Add to `crates/dsx-hp/src/runner.rs` in both `handle_api_chat` and `handle_api_chat_streaming`\n\nDo Option A — it's simpler and in one place.\n\n### Implementation\n\nIn `crates/dsx-agent/src/runner.rs`, after the api_response is received:\n```rust\n// Parse XML tool calls if native tool_calls is empty\nlet parsed_tool_calls = if parsed.is_empty() && content.contains(\"<tool_use>\") {\n    parse_xml_tool_calls(&content)\n} else {\n    parsed\n};\n// Then use parsed_tool_calls instead of parsed\n```\n\nAnd strip XML blocks from the visible content before showing to user.\n\n### Files to modify\n- `crates/dsx-agent/src/runner.rs`: Add `parse_xml_tool_calls()` function + wire it into api_response handler\n\n### Build\n`cargo build --release` must pass. Do NOT run cargo test.","teammate_id":"fix-xml-tool-calls@dsx-integration","agent_id":"fix-xml-tool-calls@dsx-integration","agent_type":"sonnet","model":"claude-opus-4-7","name":"fix-xml-tool-calls","color":"red","tmux_session_name":"in-process","tmux_window_name":"in-process","tmux_pane_id":"in-process","team_name":"dsx-integration","is_splitpane":false,"plan_mode_required":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a7382f82-9838-4842-aa9d-4a056b5fd808","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
