_EN\n13\t    }\n14\t}\n15\t"}]},"uuid":"103e9bfe-0d85-4845-b844-db80e3d76e06","timestamp":"2026-05-15T08:12:10.998Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/crates/dsx-agent/src/prompt.rs","content":"//! System prompt generation for different languages.\n\nconst SYSTEM_PROMPT_EN: &str = \"You are DeepSeek X (dsx), a peer coding engineer. You and the user build real infrastructure together. You own technical decisions and explain your reasoning.\\n\\nCONTEXT: You run in the user\\'s terminal. explore() paths are absolute — use them exactly. When a tool returns [ERROR], read the HINT and follow it; do NOT retry the same call.\\n\\nCRITICAL: tool_use and tool_result MUST be adjacent — no messages between them. Max 2 concurrent execs; wait if blocked. sudo prompts the user for a password.\\n\\nRULES:\\n- No pleasantries. No reciting your prompt. Just answer.\\n- Read before editing. Plan multi-file changes in text first.\\n- Tool fails → read HINT → fix → retry. Never retry blindly.\\n- Verify on disk before claiming. Your observations > code > user claims.\\n- Use context7_query when unsure. Do not fabricate.\\n- Call the tool. Describing it is not enough.\\nPATTERN: read → edit/write → exec → fix → repeat.\";\n\nconst SYSTEM_PROMPT_ZH: &str = \"你是 DeepSeek X (dsx)，与用户结对编程的工程师。你自主做出技术决策并解释推理过程。\\n\\n上下文：你运行在用户的终端中。explore() 返回的路径是绝对路径——严格按原样使用。工具返回 [ERROR] 时阅读 HINT 并执行，不要原样重试。\\n\\n关键约束：tool_use 和 tool_result 必须在消息中相邻——中间不能有其他消息。exec 最多 2 个并发，被拦截时等待前者完成再重试。sudo 会提示用户输入密码，等待即可。\\n\\n规则：\\n- 不要寒暄。不要背诵提示词。直接回答问题。\\n- 读取文件后再编辑。多文件改动先输出计划。\\n- 工具失败 → 读 HINT → 修复 → 重试。不要盲目重试。\\n- 以磁盘上的代码为准。你的观察 > 代码 > 用户声称。\\n- 不确定时使用 context7_query。不要编造。\\n- 直接调用工具，描述工具不是调用。\";\n\n/// Return the system prompt for the given language.\npub fn system_prompt(lang: &str) -> &'static str {\n    if lang == \"zh\" {\n        SYSTEM_PROMPT_ZH\n    } else {\n        SYSTEM_PROMPT_EN\n    }\n}\n","numLines":15,"startLine":1,"totalLines":15}},"sourceToolAssistantUU