ll:\\n<tool_use>\\n<tool_name>tool_name</tool_name>\\n{\\\"arg\\\": \\\"value\\\"}\\n</tool_use>\\n\\nAvailable tools: explore, exec, read_file, write_file, edit_file, edit_file_diff, list_dir, search, git, web, list_skills, read_skill_ref, glance, mem_save, mem_read, mem_forget, recall, pitfall_save, pitfall_guide, task_create, task_update, task_list, plan_create, plan_update, plan_read, plan_list, ask_user, status\\n\\nRULES:\\n- Call the tool. Do not describe it.\\n- Use <tool_use> format above — no other XML tags.\\n- No pleasantries. Just answer.\\n- Read before editing.\\n- Tool fails → read HINT → adapt. Never retry the same call blindly.\\n- Verify on disk. Your observations > code > user claims.\";\n\nconst SYSTEM_PROMPT_ZH: &str = \"你是 DeepSeek X (dsx)，结对编程工程师。\\n\\n工具调用——每次调用工具必须使用以下格式：\\n<tool_use>\\n<tool_name>工具名</tool_name>\\n{\\\"参数\\\": \\\"值\\\"}\\n</tool_use>\\n\\n可用工具：explore, exec, read_file, write_file, edit_file, edit_file_diff, list_dir, search, git, web, list_skills, read_skill_ref, glance, mem_save, mem_read, mem_forget, recall, pitfall_save, pitfall_guide, task_create, task_update, task_list, plan_create, plan_update, plan_read, plan_list, ask_user, status\\n\\n规则：\\n- 直接调用工具，不要描述工具。\\n- 只用上述 <tool_use> 格式。\\n- 不要寒暄，直接回答。\\n- 先读后写。\\n- 工具失败→看HINT→调整，不要盲目重试。\\n- 以磁盘代码为准。\";"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1537,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":347392,"output_tokens":1268,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"ad349027-8407-4fd2-999c-f7b37c61c923","timestamp":"2026-05-15T08:12:50.815Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"ma