{"parentUuid":"c6e3801d-4680-4f0e-8959-37738581866e","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx-integration","message":{"id":"21ed5813-7e0d-4329-b105-1cef6c8484d8","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to explain why tools aren't working. Let me trace the full chain:\n\n1. Agent sends `tools_init` with `allowed_tools: vec![]`\n2. Tools process receives it and calls `apply_init(vec![], ...)`\n3. `self.allowed = Some(vec![])`\n4. `filtered_defs()` checks `Some(vec![])` → filters to only tools in empty list → empty\n5. Tools sends back `Ready { tools: [] }` — zero tools\n6. Agent stores 0 tool definitions\n7. Agent sends `api_chat` with `tools: []` — model has no tools to call\n8. Model can't call tools\n\nThe fix is simple: either make `vec![]` mean \"allow all\" (change the tools logic), or pass all tool names (change the agent init).\n\nBut the user asked me to EXPLAIN first, not fix it.","signature":"21ed5813-7e0d-4329-b105-1cef6c8484d8"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":92,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":356736,"output_tokens":485,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"0b63417f-8629-4532-82a9-1711373495a8","timestamp":"2026-05-15T08:18:29.093Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"0b63417f-8629-4532-82a9-1711373495a8","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx-integration","message":{"id":"21ed5813-7e0d-4329-b105-1cef6c8484d8","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"两个点，串起来就是全链条：\n\n## 1. `allowed_tools: vec![]` =「一个都不许用」\n\nAgent 启动时发给 tools 进程的 Init 帧：\n\n```\nallowed_tools: vec![]\n```\n\ntools 进程收到后：\n\n```\nself.allowed = Some(vec![])           ← \"允许列表存在但为空\"\nfiltered_defs() → filter → 0 个工具\nReady { tools: [] }                  ← 空列表发回 agent\n```\n\n所以 `dsx-agent: tools → 0 definitions`。这里的语义是「允许列表为空 = 全禁」。如果 `self.allowed = None` 才会「全放」。\n\n## 2. 0 个工具 → 模型无工具可调用\n\nAgent 拿到 0 个 tool_defs，api_chat 请求里 `tools: []`。模型不知道有任何工具存在，自然一个都调不了。\n\n总结链：\n\n```\nvec![] → apply_init → Some([]) → filtered_defs 全过滤 → Ready{tools:[]} → tool_defs=[] → api_chat tools=[] → 模型无工具\n```\n\n修起来一行：把 `apply_init` 的逻辑改成「空列表 = 全允许」，或者 agent 里把 `allowed_tools: vec![]` 改成不限制。要修吗？"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":92,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":356736,"output_tokens":485,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"2235432d-fea6-4196-b64e-260f26066ac5","timestamp":"2026-05-15T08:18:38.473Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
