{"parentUuid":"53f19a12-3b11-459c-b8c4-ff1d84122eea","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx-integration","message":{"id":"7d9f5ee0-7036-4c08-85c4-000a60ef0f0b","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user doesn't want to switch back to OpenAI - they want to support BOTH Anthropic and OpenAI endpoints in the HP. This is a smart approach - the HP already has a `converter.rs` that handles provider routing. We can extend it to support both protocols.\n\nThe key insight: the HP already has `converter.rs` with `anthropic_url()` and `request_to_provider()` functions. We can add OpenAI-compatible support there.\n\nHere's the design:\n\n1. **HP config** has `base_url` - we can detect which protocol to use based on the URL\n   - `api.deepseek.com` → could use either Anthropic or OpenAI\n   - `api.openai.com` → OpenAI\n   - `api.anthropic.com` → Anthropic\n   - The user can choose by setting the base_url\n\n2. **Add an API protocol field to config** - `anthropic` or `openai` \n   - Default: detect from URL, or let user choose via `dsx config`\n\n3. **HP client.rs** needs:\n   - An OpenAI-compatible `chat_stream_openai()` function\n   - Or: refactor `chat_stream()` to dispatch based on protocol\n\n4. **The converter.rs** already has `anthropic_url()` - we need `openai_url()` too\n\n5. **Tool definitions** differ between protocols:\n   - Anthropic: `{name, description, input_schema}` \n   - OpenAI: `{type: \"function\", function: {name, description, parameters}}`\n\n6. **Response parsing** differs:\n   - Anthropic: SSE with `content_block_start/delta/stop` events\n   - OpenAI: SSE with `choices[0].delta.tool_calls` events\n\nThis is a significant but well-scoped change. Let me think about the minimal implementation:\n\n- Add `protocol` field to `Config` (default: `\"anthropic\"`, can be `\"openai\"`)\n- In `client.rs`: if protocol is \"openai\", use OpenAI format\n- In `converter.rs`: add `openai_url()` \n- Add OpenAI SSE parsing in `client.rs`\n\nActually, the user said \"在传输层直接新增对openai端点的支持\" - add OpenAI endpoint support at the transport layer. This means keeping the existing Anthropic path and adding a parallel OpenAI path.\n\nLet me present a clean design:\n\n1. **Config**: Add `protocol: String` field (`\"anthropic\"` or `\"openai\"`)\n2. **converter.rs**: Add `chat_url()` that returns the right URL for each protocol\n3. **client.rs**: Add `chat_stream_openai()` alongside existing `chat_stream()`\n4. **runner.rs (HP)**: Dispatch to the right handler based on protocol\n\nThe TUI already has `/model` and config editing. Adding a protocol toggle would be natural.\n\nFor the `dsx config` command, add a protocol option.\n\nLet me present this clearly and then spawn a sonnet to implement.","signature":"7d9f5ee0-7036-4c08-85c4-000a60ef0f0b"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":89,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":359424,"output_tokens":1013,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"95539e02-650d-4b7d-b3d9-b2f0d4b19fec","timestamp":"2026-05-15T08:21:31.070Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"95539e02-650d-4b7d-b3d9-b2f0d4b19fec","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx-integration","message":{"id":"7d9f5ee0-7036-4c08-85c4-000a60ef0f0b","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"对，不迁移，是**双协议并行**。HP 已经在 `converter.rs` 做了 provider routing，加 OpenAI 是同一层的扩展。\n\n## 设计\n\n```\n                       ┌──────────────────┐\n                       │   dsx-hp (TCP)    │\n                       │                  │\nAgent ──api_chat──→    │  protocol switch  │\n                       │  ╔══════════════╗ │\n                       │  ║ anthropic    ║─→ /anthropic/messages\n                       │  ║ openai       ║─→ /v1/chat/completions\n                       │  ╚══════════════╝ │\n                       └──────────────────┘\n```\n\n改动全在 HP 层，agent/tools/TUI 不动：\n\n| 文件 | 改动 |\n|------|------|\n| `dsx-hp/config.rs` | Config 加 `protocol: String`，默认 `\"anthropic\"` |\n| `dsx-hp/converter.rs` | 加 `chat_url()` 根据 protocol 返回不同端点 |\n| `dsx-hp/client.rs` | 加 `chat_stream_openai()` — OpenAI SSE 解析 + tool_calls 处理 |\n| `dsx-hp/runner.rs` | `handle_api_chat_streaming` 根据 protocol 分发 |\n\nAgent 发送的 `ToolDef` 保持不变 — HP 内部根据 protocol 转换格式：\n- Anthropic: `{name, description, input_schema: parameters}`\n- OpenAI: `{type: \"function\", function: {name, description, parameters}}`\n\n之后 Tauri 里加个下拉框选 protocol 就行。\n\n要拉 sonnet 实现吗？"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":89,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":359424,"output_tokens":1013,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"5a72a3bd-9f17-4af4-95ad-35e604e08f6c","timestamp":"2026-05-15T08:21:40.535Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId"