{"parentUuid":"4705733a-868d-463d-9bfb-1921989972a3","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx-integration","message":{"id":"1835c396-bd88-47d0-afe7-3f52aadc37cb","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is clarifying the architecture. HP should be a health monitor/pass-through, not an API gateway that does protocol translation. Let me re-think the architecture:\n\n1. **dsx-hp**: Health monitor only — checks JSON format, liveness, heartbeats. If JSON is valid, passes through. If not, rejects.\n2. **dsx-agent**: The actual orchestrator — should handle API calls directly or through a library\n3. **dsx-gateway**: A new shared library for protocol translation (Anthropic/OpenAI)\n\nWait, but the user said earlier that HP should hold the API key. If HP is just a health monitor, where does the API key live? And who makes the actual HTTP calls?\n\nLet me re-think. The user's vision seems to be:\n- HP: health monitor + API key holder + pass-through proxy\n- Agent: orchestrator, sends api_chat requests to HP\n- HP checks if the request is valid, then forwards to the API\n- The protocol translation (Anthropic/OpenAI) should be in a shared library, not in HP\n\nActually, let me re-read the user's words: \"healthplatform只负责检查拼凑的json对不对，不对就打回，对就交给下一级处理\"\n\nSo HP:\n1. Receives api_chat from agent\n2. Validates the JSON format using ContextAssembler/gate\n3. If valid → forwards to API\n4. If invalid → rejects back to agent\n\nThe protocol translation should be in a separate layer (dsx-gateway library).\n\nBut who calls the gateway? HP currently holds the API key. The user seems OK with HP being a thin pass-through that validates and forwards. The actual HTTP call could be in the gateway library.\n\nActually wait, let me re-read: \"不应该是hp啥都做--他是健康monitor,不是agents master\"\n\nSo the user wants:\n- HP = health monitor, validates JSON, holds API key, pass-through\n- Gateway = protocol translation library (shared between HP and future Tauri)\n- Agent = orchestrator, not concerned with API protocol\n\nThe flow:\n```\nAgent → HP (TCP) → gate.validate() → gateway.send() → API\n                  ↓ fail\n                  error back to agent\n```\n\nHP still does the HTTP call (because it holds the API key), but the protocol logic is in `dsx-gateway`. HP just calls `gateway::send(config, request)` and streams back the response.\n\nThis is cleaner. Let me design the implementation and spawn a sonnet.\n\nLet me outline the crate and changes.","signature":"1835c396-bd88-47d0-afe7-3f52aadc37cb"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":493,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":359808,"output_tokens":2215,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"cdc4c477-16f4-4017-8c9e-cd1e9fae8cfa","timestamp":"2026-05-15T08:24:44.749Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"cdc4c477-16f4-4017-8c9e-cd1e9fae8cfa","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx-integration","message":{"id":"1835c396-bd88-47d0-afe7-3f52aadc37cb","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"明白了。HP 回归本职：**校验 → 放行/打回**，不做协议翻译。\n\n## 修正后的分层\n\n```\ndsx-gateway (NEW — 纯库)\n  ├── anthropic.rs    Anthropic SSE ↔ StreamEvent\n  ├── openai.rs       OpenAI SSE ↔ StreamEvent  \n  └── mod.rs          route(protocol, config, request) → StreamEvent 流\n\ndsx-hp (健康守护)\n  ├── runner.rs       接收 agent api_chat\n  │                   → gate.validate() 校验 JSON\n  │                   → 失败就打回 error\n  │                   → 通过调 gateway::route()\n  │                   → 逐帧写回 TCP\n  ├── gate.rs         上下文校验（已有）\n  ├── registry.rs     进程注册\n  └── ...\n```\n\nHP 的 `runner.rs` 干净成一条链：\n\n```\napi_chat 帧\n  → gate 校验拼凑的 JSON 对不对\n  → 不对 → error 打回 agent\n  → 对   → gateway::route(protocol, config, req, writer)\n  → 流式写回 TCP\n```\n\nAgent 不感知 Anthropic/OpenAI 差异。HP 不感知协议细节。Gateway 是纯函数库，Tauri 以后直接 link 用。"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":493,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":359808,"output_tokens":2215,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"328d48d7-3182-4515-b56c-7f491bfe30f8","timestamp":"2026-05-15T08:24:53.839Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"328d48d7-3182-4515-b56c-7f491bfe30f8","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx-integration","message":{"id":"1835c396-bd88-47d0-afe7-3f52aadc37cb","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_00_lnMMchj5X9iXizRvcnky5430","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Create dsx-gateway crate","prompt":"Create a new shared library crate `dsx-gateway` that handles API protocol translation. This is a pure library (no process, no I/O — just data transformation).\n\n## Architecture\n\n```\ndsx-gateway (pure lib, no main)\n  src/\n    lib.rs          module declarations + re-exports\n    anthropic.rs    Anthropic SSE → StreamEvent (move from dsx-hp/client.rs)\n    openai.rs       OpenAI chat/completions SSE → StreamEvent (NEW)\n```\n\n## What to move from dsx-hp/client.rs\n\nThe entire `client.rs` from `dsx-hp` should be moved to `dsx-gateway/src/anthropic.rs`:\n- `chat_stream()` function\n- `list_models()` \n- `get_balance()`\n- All internal SSE parsing logic (AnthropicStreamEvent, AccumulatedToolCall, etc.)\n- The AnthropicRequest struct\n\n## What to create: dsx-gateway/src/openai.rs\n\nAn OpenAI-compatible chat completion streaming client:\n\n```rust\npub async fn chat_stream_openai(\n    config: &GatewayConfig,\n    model: &str,\n    system: Option<String>,\n    messages: Vec<Message>,  // internal Message format\n    tools: Option<Vec<ToolDef>>,\n    tool_choice: Option<&str>,\n    max_tokens: u32,\n    tx: tokio::sync::mpsc::Sender<StreamEvent>,\n) -> anyhow::Result<()>\n```\n\nThis function:\n1. Converts internal Messages to OpenAI chat format (role + content)\n2. Converts ToolDef to OpenAI function format (type: \"function\", function: {name, description, parameters})\n3. POSTs to `{base_url}/v1/chat/completions` (or `/beta/v1/chat/completions` for strict mode)\n4. Parses SSE stream: `data: {\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"content\":\"...\"}}]}`\n5. Emits StreamEvent::ContentDelta for text content\n6. Emits StreamEvent::ReasoningDelta for reasoning_content\n7. On tool_calls delta, accumulates and emits StreamEvent::ToolCallProgress\n8. On finish, emits StreamEvent::Done with assembled Message\n\n## What to create: dsx-gateway/src/lib.rs\n\n```rust\nmod anthropic;\nmod openai;\n\npub use anthropic::{chat_stream, list_models, get_balance};\npub use openai::chat_stream_openai;\n\n/// Minimal config needed by gateway (no process-level fields).\npub struct GatewayConfig {\n    pub base_url: String,\n    pub api_key: String,\n    pub protocol: String,  // \"anthropic\" or \"openai\"\n}\n```\n\n## Changes to dsx-hp\n\n1. **Cargo.toml**: Add `dsx-gateway = { path = \"../dsx-gateway\" }` dependency\n2. **lib.rs**: Replace `pub mod client;` with `pub use dsx_gateway::{chat_stream, chat_stream_openai, list_models, get_balance, GatewayConfig};`\n3. **config.rs**: Add `protocol: String` field, default `\"anthropic\"`\n4. **runner.rs**: In `handle_api_chat_streaming`, read `config.protocol` and route:\n   - `\"openai\"` → call `dsx_gateway::chat_stream_openai(...)` \n   - `\"anthropic\"` or default → call `dsx_gateway::chat_stream(...)`\n5. **runner.rs**: Remove `handle_api_chat` (non-streaming) — keep only the streaming variant\n6. **lib.rs**: Remove `pub mod client;` and `pub mod converter;` (moved to gateway)\n7. Delete `crates/dsx-hp/src/client.rs` and `crates/dsx-hp/src/converter.rs` (moved to gateway)\n\n## StreamEvent\n\nMove StreamEvent from dsx-hp to dsx-gateway. It's used by both protocols:\n\n```rust\npub enum StreamEvent {\n    ContentDelta(String),\n    ReasoningDelta(String),\n    ToolCallProgress { name: String, args_so_far: String },\n    Done { raw_message: Message, usage: Option<UsageInfo>, stop_reason: Option<String> },\n    Error(String),\n}\n```\n\n## Important\n\n- dsx-gateway depends on: dsx-types, tokio, reqwest, serde, serde_json, futures-util\n- All HTTP handling lives in gateway — HP just calls the library\n- HP keeps the API key in its config and passes it to gateway\n- Gateway is stateless (pure functions)\n- Do NOT create a binary target for dsx-gateway\n- Do NOT run cargo test\n- After all changes, `cargo build --release` must pass\n\n## Files to create\n- `crates/dsx-gateway/Cargo.toml`\n- `crates/dsx-gateway/src/lib.rs`\n- `crates/dsx-gateway/src/anthropic.rs` (moved from dsx-hp/client.rs)\n- `crates/dsx-gateway/src/openai.rs` (new)\n\n## Files to modify\n- `Cargo.toml` (workspace root — add dsx-gateway member)\n- `crates/dsx-hp/Cargo.toml` (add dsx-gateway dep)\n- `crates/dsx-hp/src/lib.rs` (remove client/converter modules, re-export from gateway)\n- `crates/dsx-hp/src/config.rs` (add protocol field)\n- `crates/dsx-hp/src/runner.rs` (route to gateway based on protocol)\n\n## Files to delete\n- `crates/dsx-hp/src/client.rs`\n- `crates/dsx-hp/src/converter.rs`","run_in_background":true,"subagent_type":"sonnet","name":"create-dsx-gateway"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":493,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":359808,"output_tokens":2215,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"efc7ff4a-76f5-4b8a-bea4-082debfe90fb","timestamp":"2026-05-15T08:25:34.436Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
