{"parentUuid":"b0772162-01eb-4da3-805b-7cb530b8f768","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx-integration","message":{"id":"d2f72b6b-d8a3-4318-bd5d-e99e1cdee02c","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can trace the full chain:\n\n**Agent (runner.rs)**:\n1. `orchestrator::context_compactor::prepare_and_compact(agent)` — builds system prompt + compacts context\n2. `serde_json::to_value(&msgs_no_system)` — converts agent.messages (with system role filtered) to JSON\n3. Builds `AgentToHp::ApiChat { model, system, messages, tools }` — assembles the FULL API request\n4. Sends to HP via TCP\n\n**HP (runner.rs)**:\n1. Detects `api_chat` frame type\n2. Routes to `handle_api_chat_streaming(line, writer)`\n3. Parses the JSON line back into fields (model, system, messages)\n4. RE-CONVERTS messages from JSON to AnthropicMessage format (repeating work agent already did)\n5. Calls `client::chat_stream()` — which converts ToolDef→AnthropicTool, builds AnthropicRequest, makes HTTP call\n6. Streams results back over TCP\n\nSo the flow IS:\n```\nAgent 拼凑完整请求 → HP 收到后拆开再拼一次 → HTTP\n```\n\nHP is doing DUPLICATE work:\n1. Re-parsing messages that agent already assembled\n2. Re-converting tool format\n3. Making the HTTP call\n\nThe user's question: should HP receive pre-assembled data or raw data?\n\nCurrent state:\n- Agent assembles everything (system prompt, messages, tools)\n- HP receives the assembled JSON\n- HP re-parses and re-converts\n\nThe answer: Agent DOES assemble/拼凑 the request. HP receives it assembled. But then HP unassembles and reassembles it!\n\nThis duplication should be eliminated. The ideal flow:\n- Agent assembles the request → sends to HP\n- HP validates (gate check) → passes through to gateway\n- Gateway handles HTTP protocol details (Anthropic vs OpenAI)\n\nHP should NOT be re-parsing messages. It should just validate and forward.\n\nLet me present this clearly to the user.","signature":"d2f72b6b-d8a3-4318-bd5d-e99e1cdee02c"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":787,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":363008,"output_tokens":813,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"d9ed34bd-4a5f-43c3-9fd4-972a758d52ce","timestamp":"2026-05-15T08:28:12.706Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"d9ed34bd-4a5f-43c3-9fd4-972a758d52ce","isSidechain":false,"teamName":"dsx-integration","message":{"id":"d2f72b6b-d8a3-4318-bd5d-e99e1cdee02c","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"扫完了。你的印象是对的，但 HP 做了不该做的重复工：\n\n## 实际流程\n\n```\nAgent                                HP                               API\n─────────────────────────────────    ────────────────────────────────  ───\n1. prepare_and_compact()             \n   拼凑 system prompt\n   \n2. messages_to_json()                \n   拼凑消息数组\n   \n3. AgentToHp::ApiChat {              \n     model, system, messages, tools  \n   }                                 \n        │                            \n        │  TCP api_chat 帧           \n        ▼                            \n                          4. 收到 JSON 行\n                          5. **拆开 JSON** 重新解析 model/system/messages\n                          6. **再次转换** messages → AnthropicMessage（Agent 已经拼好了！）\n                          7. **再次转换** ToolDef → AnthropicTool\n                          8. chat_stream() → HTTP\n                                                             9. 响应\n```\n\n**第 5-7 步是重复工。** Agent 已经拼好了完整的 API 请求，HP 应该直接校验 → 转发，而不是拆了再拼。\n\n## 应该的样子\n\n```\nAgent                     HP                        Gateway（纯库）\n─────────────────────     ────────────────────      ───────────────\n拼凑完整请求              gate.validate()           \n  system prompt             ↓ OK                    \n  messages               gateway::route() ──→      协议转换 → HTTP\n  tools                                            流式响应 ←\n       │                        │\n       ▼                        ▼\n   发送 JSON              流式写回 TCP\n```\n\nHP 只做：**校验拼的对不对 → 对就转给 gateway，不对就打回**。Gateway 是纯函数，接收 Agent 拼好的数据 + config，返回 StreamEvent 流。HP 不碰消息内容。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":787,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":363008,"output_tokens":813,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"2075961c-1974-401e-9804-6774a77ed17b","timestamp":"2026-05-15T08:28:25.683Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
