s` frames have `\"id\":\"\"` (empty ID) — these are from `StreamEvent::ToolCallProgress { name, args_so_far }` in the HP's streaming handler:\n```rust\nStreamEvent::ToolCallProgress { name, args_so_far } => {\n    let frame = serde_json::json!({\n        \"type\": \"tool_progress\",\n        \"id\": \"\",\n        \"content\": format!(\"{name}({args_so_far})\"),\n        \"stream_type\": \"progress\",\n    });\n```\n\nSo the gateway DID emit ToolCallProgress events. This means the model IS generating tool calls (maybe it now works with 28 tool definitions!), and the gateway IS parsing them.\n\nBut then the final response only has `{\"type\":\"done\"}` — no api_response. This means the gateway emitted StreamEvent::Done (which triggers the HP to send api_response + done), but the agent received only done, not api_response.\n\nUnless... the HP sent api_response AND done, but I'm not seeing the api_response because it's a long line and my grep missed it?\n\nLet me check the actual output more carefully.","signature":"636b5277-6186-4a6e-b666-b97aadd0d7ba"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":130,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":381952,"output_tokens":838,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"70012517-8cca-49de-b273-25f2f42f5b5c","timestamp":"2026-05-15T09:05:13.556Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
