{"parentUuid":"05bf0fac-0a75-411f-ae1e-b4dfb5acd18f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"021f15ba-eb9a-4fc3-91a4-7fe3af50d070","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The URL construction is simple — it just appends `/v1/chat/completions` to the base_url. If base_url is `https://api.deepseek.com/anthropic`, the URL becomes `https://api.deepseek.com/anthropic/v1/chat/completions` — which is wrong for OpenAI.\n\nThe fix: for OpenAI, strip any path from base_url. Always use just the origin.\n\nBut more fundamentally, the user's config has `base_url: \"https://api.deepseek.com/anthropic\"` because they set it up for the Anthropic endpoint. The `protocol` field is new. We need the config to be flexible enough to handle both.\n\nThe simplest fix: in the openai gateway URL construction, always just use the origin (scheme + host + port). Strip any existing path.\n\n```rust\nlet url = {\n    // OpenAI endpoint always uses /v1/chat/completions\n    // Strip any existing path from base_url (e.g., /anthropic)\n    let base = config.base_url.strip_suffix('/').unwrap_or(&config.base_url);\n    // Extract just the origin (scheme://host:port)\n    let origin = if let Some(pos) = base.find(\"://\") {\n        let after_scheme = &base[pos + 3..];\n        if let Some(slash_pos) = after_scheme.find('/') {\n            &base[..pos + 3 + slash_pos]\n        } else {\n            base\n        }\n    } else { base };\n    format!(\"{}/v1/chat/completions\", origin)\n};\n```\n\nActually, even simpler: just parse the URL and reconstruct from scheme + host:\n\n```rust\nuse url::Url;  // but we don't have url as a dependency\n```\n\nOr the simplest approach: if the base_url is ap.deepseek.com/anthropic, just take the part before the first path component:\n\n```rust\nlet base = config.base_url.strip_suffix('/').unwrap_or(&config.base_url);\n// Simple: find the first / after ://\nlet origin = if let Some(pos) = base[8..].find('/') {\n    &base[..pos + 8]\n} else {\n    base\n};\nformat!(\"{}/v1/chat/completions\", origin)\n```\n\nWait, that's fragile. Let me think of a cleaner approach.\n\nActually, the cleanest approach: make base_url protocol-aware in the configuration. If protocol is \"openai\", the default base_url should be `https://api.deepseek.com`. If \"anthropic\", `https://api.deepseek.com/anthropic`. But we already have `base_url` stored in config...\n\nLet me just fix the gateway to strip the path for OpenAI. Use a simple URL parsing approach.","signature":"021f15ba-eb9a-4fc3-91a4-7fe3af50d070"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":310,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":416768,"output_tokens":999,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"09672ecf-467a-46b8-9799-3cfb8459930a","timestamp":"2026-05-15T10:14:20.599Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"09672ecf-467a-46b8-9799-3cfb8459930a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"021f15ba-eb9a-4fc3-91a4-7fe3af50d070","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_00_PZVvS8YUqNQKsxNqqQkS4458","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/crates/dsx-gateway/src/openai.rs","old_string":"    // Determine URL\n    let url = {\n        let base = config.base_url.strip_suffix('/').unwrap_or(&config.base_url);\n        if base.ends_with(\"/v1/chat/completions\") {\n            base.to_string()\n        } else if base.ends_with(\"/v1\") {\n            format!(\"{}/chat/completions\", base)\n        } else {\n            format!(\"{}/v1/chat/completions\", base)\n        }\n    };","new_string":"    // Determine URL — for OpenAI, always use /v1/chat/completions\n    // Strip any existing path from base_url (e.g., /anthropic from config)\n    let url = {\n        let raw = config.base_url.strip_suffix('/').unwrap_or(&config.base_url);\n        // Extract origin (scheme://host) by finding first / after ://\n        let origin = match raw.find(\"://\") {\n            Some(scheme_end) => {\n                let after_scheme = &raw[scheme_end + 3..];\n                match after_scheme.find('/') {\n                    Some(slash_pos) => format!(\"{}/v1/chat/completions\", &raw[..scheme_end + 3 + slash_pos]),\n                    None => format!(\"{raw}/v1/chat/completions\"),\n                }\n            }\n            None => format!(\"{raw}/v1/chat/completions\"),\n        };\n        origin\n    };"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":310,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":416768,"output_tokens":999,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":