{"parentUuid":"bddef25d-d38b-4faa-ad3a-d53c7e7b8461","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"1ce8ef60-06ee-46b9-b801-3cd0a4fe140e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"首次调用 API\nDeepSeek API 使用与 OpenAI/Anthropic 兼容的 API 格式，通过修改配置，您可以使用 OpenAI/Anthropic SDK 来访问 DeepSeek API，或使用与 OpenAI/Anthropic API 兼容的软件。\n\nPARAM    VALUE\nbase_url (OpenAI)    https://api.deepseek.com\nbase_url (Anthropic)    https://api.deepseek.com/anthropic\napi_key    apply for an API key\nmodel*    deepseek-v4-flash\ndeepseek-v4-pro\ndeepseek-chat (将于 2026/07/24 弃用)\ndeepseek-reasoner (将于 2026/07/24 弃用)\n* deepseek-chat 与 deepseek-reasoner 两个模型名将于 2026/07/24 弃用。出于兼容考虑，二者分别对应 deepseek-v4-flash 的非思考与思考模式。\n\n接入 Agent 工具\nDeepSeek API 已接入多种主流 AI Agent 与编程助手工具。如果你使用 Claude Code、GitHub Copilot、OpenCode 等工具，可以直接将 DeepSeek 作为后端模型，无需编写代码即可开始使用。\n\n详见 Agent 工具接入指南。\n\n调用对话 API\n在创建 API key 之后，你可以使用以下样例脚本，通过 OpenAI API 格式来访问 DeepSeek 模型。样例为非流式输出，您可以将 stream 设置为 true 来使用流式输出。\n\nAnthropic API 格式的访问样例，请参考Anthropic API。\n\ncurl\npython\nnodejs\ncurl https://api.deepseek.com/chat/completions \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer ${DEEPSEEK_API_KEY}\" \\\n  -d '{\n        \"model\": \"deepseek-v4-pro\",\n        \"messages\": [\n          {\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": \"You are a helpful assistant.\"},\n          {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Hello!\"}\n        ],\n        \"thinking\": {\"type\": \"enabled\"},\n        \"reasoning_effort\": \"high\",\n        \"stream\": false"},"uuid":"e345fe01-65c9-4228-9521-ce666ba356ee","timestamp":"2026-05-15T10:15:53.444Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"e345fe01-65c9-4228-9521-ce666ba356ee","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"6bfc323b-a3cd-4032-b378-bded186084e9","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I see the issue clearly. Looking at the official DeepSeek API docs:\n\n1. **OpenAI format base_url**: `https://api.deepseek.com`\n   - API endpoint: `https://api.deepseek.com/chat/completions` (NOT `/v1/chat/completions`!)\n\n2. **Anthropic format base_url**: `https://api.deepseek.com/anthropic`\n   - API endpoint: `https://api.deepseek.com/anthropic/messages` (this is correct)\n\nSo the current URL construction in the gateway is WRONG for OpenAI. The curl example shows:\n```\ncurl https://api.deepseek.com/chat/completions\n```\n\nNOT `/v1/chat/completions`. DeepSeek's OpenAI-compatible endpoint is at `/chat/completions`, NOT `/v1/chat/completions`.\n\nWait, but standard OpenAI API is at `/v1/chat/completions`. Maybe DeepSeek uses a different path. Let me check: the doc says `base_url (OpenAI): https://api.deepseek.com`. This means `https://api.deepseek.com/chat/completions`.\n\nBut earlier, our test with `https://api.deepseek.com/v1/chat/completions` also worked (I saw API responses). So maybe both paths work? Let me check...\n\nActually, looking at the curl example more carefully: `curl https://api.deepseek.com/chat/completions` — NO `/v1` prefix.\n\nBut our test earlier with `.../v1/chat/completions` also returned successfully. So maybe DeepSeek supports both? Or maybe the non-`/v1` path is the newer recommended one, and the `/v1` path is legacy.\n\nThe user said \"不建议再拼凑出v1了\" — they're saying don't construct `/v1` manually anymore. The recommended path is just `/chat/completions` without v1.\n\nLet me fix the URL construction in the OpenAI gateway to use `/chat/completions` instead of `/v1/chat/completions`.","signature":"6bfc323b-a3cd-4032-b378-bded186084e9"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_token