ol_name));\n            return true;\n        }\n        if is_write {\n            if let Some(ref path) = parse_file_arg(args) {\n                let declared = last_assistant_mentions(state, path);\n                let is_critical = turn_scorer::classify_path(path) == turn_scorer::PathTrust::HighStake;\n                state.health.record_intent_compliance(path, declared, is_critical);\n                if let Some(note) = state.health.intent_note(path) {\n                    state.ctx.annotate(\"intent\", &note);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        if is_edit && state.turns_since_last_read >= 4 {","numLines":60,"startLine":1,"totalLines":98}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"01ea00f7-579e-422e-8bed-abfe984ab0fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
