{"parentUuid":"4bd59589-f07f-4c4b-80fc-241c265920a0","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"ee2f0700-2140-4560-b2f5-8e83b5d90285","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_00_zzcLnIqrrVvpzUMtmzGY6311","type":"tool_result","content":"64:    tool_choice: Option<serde_json::Value>,\n133:    tool_choice: Option<&str>,\n221:    let tc = tool_choice.map(|s| match s {\n254:        tool_choice: tc,","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"bed922a9-e8d9-49c5-ab15-6cf6dd8ce2b6","timestamp":"2026-05-15T10:35:43.375Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"64:    tool_choice: Option<serde_json::Value>,\n133:    tool_choice: Option<&str>,\n221:    let tc = tool_choice.map(|s| match s {\n254:        tool_choice: tc,","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"4bd59589-f07f-4c4b-80fc-241c265920a0","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"bed922a9-e8d9-49c5-ab15-6cf6dd8ce2b6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"abe46e72-9fea-4cda-ae4c-441c19bb2a21","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The gateway accepts `tool_choice: Option<&str>` from the caller, but the HP doesn't pass it. The HP's `handle_api_chat_streaming` calls `dsx_gateway::chat_stream_openai(..., None, ...)` — so `tool_choice` is `None`, which means the OpenAIChatRequest has no `tool_choice` field, and the API defaults to `\"auto\"`.\n\nSo the model chooses freely whether to call tools or not. When it decides to call a tool, it returns `tool_calls` in the response. The gateway detects `finish_reason: \"tool_calls\"` and assembles the tool calls into StreamEvent::Done with raw_message.tool_calls.\n\nThe user might be asking for a clarification on the flow. Let me explain it clearly.","signature":"abe46e72-9fea-4cda-ae4c-441c19bb2a21"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":75,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":461056,"output_tokens":600,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"6ffa0045-bff0-4f59-8f21-6c673cdb7189","timestamp":"2026-05-15T10:35:48.260Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"6ffa0045-bff0-4f59-8f21-6c673cdb7189","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"abe46e72-9fea-4cda-ae4c-441c19bb2a21","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"在 OpenAI 协议下，模型返回的响应里有两种标记表明「进入工具阶段」：\n\n### 1. 流式（Streaming）—— 我们当前用的\n\n响应逐 chunk 到达：\n\n```\nchunk 1: delta.content = \"\" (空)\nchunk 2: delta.tool_calls[0] = {function: {name: \"read_file\"}}  ← 名字\nchunk 3: delta.tool_calls[0] = {function: {arguments: \"{\\\"path\\\":\"}}\nchunk 4: delta.tool_calls[0] = {function: {arguments: \" \\\"/tmp/test.txt\\\"}\"}}\n  ...\nfinal:   finish_reason = \"tool_calls\"                            ← 结束标记\n```\n\nGateway 累积各个 chunk，`finish_reason = \"tool_calls\"` 时组装成 `Message { tool_calls: [...] }`，发出 `StreamEvent::Done`。\n\n### 2. 非流式\n\n```\n{\n  \"message\": {\n    \"content\": null,\n    \"tool_calls\": [{ \"id\": \"call_xxx\", \"type\": \"function\",\n      \"function\": { \"name\": \"read_file\", \"arguments\": \"{\\\"path\\\":\\\"/tmp/test.txt\\\"}\" }\n    }]\n  },\n  \"finish_reason\": \"tool_calls\"\n}\n```\n\n### 触发条件\n\n`tool_choice` 参数控制：\n\n| 值 | 行为 |\n|----|------|\n| `\"auto\"`（默认）| 模型自己决定调不调 |\n| `\"required\"` | 模型必须调一个 |\n| `\"none\"` | 模型不调工具 |\n| `{type: \"function\", function: {name: \"xxx\"}}` | 强制调指定工具 |\n\n我们当前没设 `tool_choice`，走默认 `\"auto\"`。模型看到用户说的和工具描述匹配了就调，不匹配就文本回复。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":75,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":461056,"output_tokens":600,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"89ce91c4-1640-40ca-84ef-971e5eebfeb4","timestamp":"2026-05-15T10:35:52.503Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b85