{"parentUuid":"97f05f97-b6e3-4257-a358-09232b6502c0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"d0ff6c36-ec27-4071-94e8-949ca533a0e4","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_00_fyt3CvC9omHsOMo74bnS6670","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Fix tool round limit behavior","model":"sonnet","name":"fix-tool-rounds","prompt":"Fix the max tool rounds behavior in `/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/crates/dsx-agent/src/runner.rs`.\n\n## Problem\n\nWhen `for _round in 0..10` loop exits (max rounds reached), the agent sends an error to TUI and stops:\n```rust\nagent.ctx.annotate(\"System\", \"Max tool rounds (10) reached. Respond with what you have.\");\nagent.ctx.flush_annotations();\nagent.sync_messages();\nlet _ = dsx_proto::write_frame(tui_writer,\n    &AgentToTui::Error { message: \"exceeded max tool rounds\".into() });\n```\n\nThis sends an ERROR to TUI. The AI never gets to respond because it was cut off.\n\n## Fix\n\nAfter the for loop exits (lines ~688-693), don't send an error. Instead:\n\n1. Annotate context: \"Max tool rounds (10) reached. Respond with what you have.\"\n2. Sync messages\n3. Write ONE MORE api_chat to HP **WITHOUT tools** (so the model can only respond in text)\n4. Read HP response (use the same streaming loop)\n5. Write `AgentToTui::ApiResponse` with the final content (no tool_calls)\n6. Return\n\nThis way the model sees \"Max tool rounds reached. Respond with what you have.\" and generates a text-only summary response. The user gets a useful reply instead of an error.\n\nFor the final no-tools api_chat, send:\n```rust\nlet chat = AgentToHp::ApiChat {\n    model: agent.config.model.clone(),\n    system: Some(system),\n    messages: messages_json,\n    effort: agent.config.effort.clone(),\n    max_tokens: Some(agent.config.max_tokens),\n    tools: None,  // NO TOOLS\n};\n```\n\nRead the response (content_delta + api_response via streaming loop), forward to TUI, then return normally.\n\nAlso add `max_tool_rounds: u32` to AgentState in `crates/dsx-agent/src/agent.rs`:\n```rust\npub max_tool_rounds: u32,\n```\nInitialize to `10` in `new()`, and change the for loop from `for _round in 0..10` to `for _round in 0..agent.max_tool_rounds`.\n\nThen read `max_tool_rounds` from config in `agent.rs`:\n```rust\nmax_tool_rounds: config.max_tool_rounds.unwrap_or(10),\n```\n\nAnd add the field to Config in `crates/dsx-agent/src/config.rs`:\n```rust\npub max_tool_rounds: Option<u32>,\n```\nBut leave default at 10 for now.\n\n## After changes\n`cargo build --release` must pass.","run_in_background":true,"subagent_type":"general-purpose"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":134,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":472320,"output_tokens":1045,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"77b5efaf-a865-43ae-8f03-c933652b0360","timestamp":"2026-05-15T10:44:25.291Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
