le `dev_mode` + debug logging | **MISSING** | **MISSING** |\n| `/reset` | `handle_reset_command` — reset config | **MISSING** (stub returns None) | **MISSING** |\n| `/reconfig` | `handle_reconfig_command` | **MISSING** (stub returns None) | **MISSING** |\n| `/profile` | `handle_profile_command` | **MISSING** (stub returns None) | **MISSING** |\n| `/fix` | Full message repair: detect orphan tools, check alternation | **MISSING** | **MISSING** |\n| `/context` | Show detailed token breakdown (system/semantic/backbone/episodic) | **MISSING** | **MISSING** |\n| `/compact force/now/hard` | Sub-options for aggressive compaction | **MISSING** (forwards basic `/compact` as raw text) | **MISSING** |\n\n---\n\n### SECTION 3: Event Loop / IPC Frame Handling\n\nFile: `/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/crates/dsx-tui/src/lib.rs` (event loop, lines 222-545)\n\nThe old event loop (`src/dsx-tui/mod.rs`) handled a rich `StreamEvent` enum. The new event loop parses raw JSON-LP strings with simple `.contains()` checks.\n\n**IPC frames handled in new event loop:**\n- `\"content_delta\"` -&gt; `stream.apply_payload()`\n- `\"tool_progress\"` -&gt; `stream.tool_progress` update\n- `\"api_response\"` -&gt; initial content display\n- `\"error\"` -&gt; `state.status_msg` + stream clear\n- `\"done\"` -&gt; push message + stream clear\n- `\"tool_confirm_req\"` -&gt; `pending_tools` + mode switch\n\n**IPC frames / StreamEvents MISSING from new event loop:**\n\n| Missing Handler | Old Behavior | Why It Matters |\n|----------------|-------------|----------------|\n| `ExecStarted(id, pid)` | Stores child PID for exec cancellation | Without this, exec cancellation cannot kill child processes |\n| `ExecDone(id, result)` | Finalizes exec: updates `tool_code_content`, pushes result via ContextAssembler, decrements `exec_pending`, restarts agent loop | **CRITICAL**: No exec results are ever displayed or fed back to the agent |\n| `ExecProgress(output)` | Streams exec output lines to `tool_code_content` in real-time | Live exec output never appears in bottom panel |\n| `SudoDone(results)` | Injects sudo exec results, continues agent loop | Sudo flow is completely broken |\n| `BalanceResult(balance)` | Updates `app.balance` field from async query | Balance never auto-updates on startup |\n| `ModelListResult(models)` | Updates model list for setup wizard | Setup wizard model selection broken |\n| `GateBlocked {reason, repairable, suggestion}` | Sets `last_gate_block` for popup render | Gate popup never shows — fields declared but never populated |\n| `ApiError {type, status, retry_count, ...}` | Sets `last_api_error` for render | Error blocks never appear in chat |\n| `RetryProgress {attempt, max_retries, ...}` | Sets `retry_progress` for render | Retry spinners never appear |\n| `RateLimitInfo {retry_after_secs, ...}` | Sets `rate_limit_info` for render | Rate limit countdown never appears |\n\n---\n\n### SECTION 4: Render Differences\n\n#### 4a: Workspace Panel (`/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/crates/dsx-tui/src/render/workspace.rs`)\n\n| Feature | Old (`src/dsx-tui/workspace.rs`) | New | Status |\n|---------|------|-----|--------|\n| Section header | Yes | Yes | PRESENT |\n| Low balance warning | Yes | Yes | PRESENT |\n| Status message | Yes | Yes | PRESENT |\n| Active plan status | Yes (calls `session::list_plans`) | Yes (calls `stubs::session::list_plans`) | STUBBED — always returns no plans |\n| Task summary | Yes (calls `session::read_memory`) | Yes (calls `stubs::session::read_memory`) | STUBBED — always returns empty |\n| File changes this session | Yes (from `long_mem.file_changes`) | Yes (from `ctx.file_changes`) | PRESENT but `file_changes` never populated |\n| **Health errors block** | Shows `health.recent_errors.len()`, `health.overall_level`, `pitfall_count` | **MISSING** | **MISSING** |\n\n#### 4b: Info Panel (`workspace.rs::render_info_panel`)\n\n| Display Element | Old Format | New Format | Status |\n|-----------------|-----------|------------|--------|\n| Model line | `model auto_tag think phase_str **health_icon** **tier_str** **emotion_str** skip_tag exec_tag` | `model auto_tag think phase_str skip_tag exec_tag` | **MISSING** health_icon, tier_str, emotion_str |\n| Context bar | Yes | Yes | PRESENT |\n| Balance | Yes | Yes | PRESENT |\n| Session runtime | Yes (with local time) | Yes (without local time) | PRESENT |\n| Health status line | Yes | Yes | PRESENT |\n\nOld mode_line format:\n```\n\"{} {} {} {}{}{}{}{}{}\"  // model, auto_tag, think, phase_str, health_icon, tier_str, emotion_str, skip_tag, exec_tag\n```\nNew mode_line format:\n```\n\"{} {} {} {}{}{}\"         // model, auto_tag, think, phase_str, skip_tag, exec_tag\n```\n\nThe four missing components are:\n1. `health_icon` — derived from `health.overall_level` (Red=dot, Yellow=half-circle)\n2. `tier_str` — derived from `health.context_tier` (Danger=\"DGR\")\n3. `emotion_str` — derived from `health.infer_emotion()` (emoji + label)\n4. Local time (`local.format(\"%H:%M:%S\")`) on runtime line\n\n#### 4c: Chat Panel (`/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx/crates/dsx-tui/src/render/chat.rs`)\n\n| Feature | Old | New | Status |\n|---------|-----|-----|--------|\n| Welcome banner | Yes | Yes | PRESENT |\n| Session picker | Yes | Yes | PRESENT |\n| Setup wizard | Yes | Yes | PRESENT |\n| Tool confirmations | Yes | Yes | PRESENT |\n| Message display | Yes | Yes | PRESENT |\n| Thinking blocks | Yes | Yes | PRESENT |\n| Tool call blocks | Yes | Yes | PRESENT |\n| Tool results | Yes | Yes | PRESENT |\n| **Stream tool progress** | Shows ALL entries in loop | Shows only LAST entry | **REGRESSION** |\n| Stream content | Yes | Yes | PRESENT |\n| Stream reasoning | Yes | Yes | PRESENT |\n| Generating spinner | Yes | Yes | PRESENT |\n| Waiting spinner | Yes | Yes | PRESENT |\n| Esc cancel indicator | Yes | Yes | PRESENT |\n| **API error block** | **MISSING** (new feature) | Yes | **NEW - IMPROVEMENT** |\n| **Retry progress block** | **MISSING** (new feature) | Yes | **NEW - IMPROVEMENT