/result>\n<usage><total_tokens>48405</total_tokens><tool_uses>24</tool_uses><duration_ms>112232</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>","commandMode":"task-notification"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"33a62e8a-3ee0-421f-8685-20d7a81a2a1e","timestamp":"2026-05-15T10:48:44.042Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"33a62e8a-3ee0-421f-8685-20d7a81a2a1e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"74b37f5a-a508-4002-b61a-2d91cf7cadd8","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"fix-slash-commands is done. The request dump shows:\n- system_len=1 messages=2 messages_json_len=32\n\n1 system message (the prompt) and 2 total messages (system + user). That's a minimal fresh session. The messages_json is only 32 bytes long (just the user message).\n\nLet me remove the debug dump now and explain the structure to the user.\n\nFor the caching question: the system prompt is sent as the `system` field in the API request. This is the FIRST thing the API processes. In DeepSeek/Anthropic caching, the system prompt + early messages are cached. The system prompt contains:\n1. Base prompt (built-in or from ~/.dsx/prompt.json) - STABLE\n2. Long-term memory - NEARLY STABLE\n3. Semantic memory - CHANGES OCCASIONALLY\n4. Card text (compacted turns) - CHANGES PER TURN\n5. Pitfall guide - STABLE\n6. Active skills - STABLE PER SESSION\n7. Tool list - STABLE (always same 27 tools)\n\nMessage order:\n1. System message (filtered out, sent as `system` field)\n2. User message (new query)\n3. Assistant message (last response)\n4. ... older messages\n\nThe stable part is the system prompt + the tool definitions. Everything before the tool definitions is the same between requests. The user messages are the only changing part.\n\nBut wait — with the OpenAI protocol, the system prompt is sent as part of `messages`, not as a separate `system` field. In our gateway, the system prompt is prepended as the first message `{\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": \"...\"}`.\n\nFor caching to work, the system message (message[0]) should be the same between requests. User messages (message[1], message[2], etc.) change, but the system message at position 0 is stable. DeepSeek's cache works on prefix tokens — if the prefix of the messages array is the same, it's cached.\n\nLet me explain this to the user and show the structure.","signature":"74b37f5a-a508-4002-b61a-2d91cf7cadd8"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":809,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":492672,"output_tokens":906,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"82a6831e-da87-45a3-84fc-7d2a0a86661c","timestamp":"2026-05-15T10:48:51.829Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"82a6831e-da87-45a3-84fc-7d2a0a86661c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"74b37f5a-a508-4002-b61a-2d91cf7cadd8","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"fix-slash-commands 完成：/tools /skip-all /dev /context /fix /reset 已接入 + bracketed paste + End 键 auto_scroll。\n\n回复你的问题。先看组装结构和缓存策略。\n\n## 请求体组装顺序\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  system 字段（被稳定缓存）                       │\n│                                                   │\n│  Layer 0: Base prompt（~200 tokens, 永不改变）    │\n│    + prompt.json 的 base + rules + style          │\n│                                                   │\n│  Layer 1: 长期记忆（~50 tokens, 基本不变）        │\n│    - \"tool_use/tool_result must be adjacent...\"    │\n│    - \"Sudo password via stdin...\"                 │\n│                                                   │\n│  Layer 2: 语义记忆（~0 tokens, 当前为空）          │\n│                                                   │\n│  ─────────────────── 缓存边界 ──────────────────    │\n│                                                   │\n│  Card text: 压缩对话轮次（随对话增长）             │\n│  Pitfall guide                                    │\n│  Active skills                                    │\n│  ## Available Tools（27个工具描述, ~2000 tokens） │\n│                                                   │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  messages 数组                                     │\n│  [0]: {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"hi\"}           │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n## 缓存命中策略\n\nDeepSeek 的 prompt cache 是**前缀缓存**。请求体发出去后，服务器如果看到消息头部的 token 序列和之前一样，就直接命中缓存。\n\n当前的问题：**工具定义（27 个工具的描述 + JSON Schema）被拼在 system prompt 的末尾**，也就是在缓存边界之后。这意味着每次请求工具定义都会重新编码，约 2000 tokens 永不命中缓存。\n\n正确做法应该是：**工具定义放 system 字段最前面**，紧接 base prompt，让缓存前缀覆盖到绝大部分系统性内容。\n\n想改吗？一行就能把 tool list 提到 system prompt 最前面。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":809,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":492672,"output_tokens":906,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"a34eb75d-c4f6-4f0e-90e4-7f542176b1dc","timestamp":"2026-05-15T10:48:57.127Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
