scription));\n        }\n        tools_block.push_str(\"Use these tools by their exact name.\");\n    }\n\n    let pitfall_block = state.pitfall_guide.render(3);\n    if !pitfall_block.is_empty() {\n        system.push_str(\"\\n\\n\");\n        system.push_str(&pitfall_block);\n    }\n\n    // Append skill bodies to system prompt\n    if !state.active_skill_bodies.is_empty() {\n        system.push_str(\"\\n\\n## Active Skills\\n\");\n        for (name, body) in &state.active_skill_bodies {\n            system.push_str(&format!(\"### {}\\n{}\\n---\\n\", name, body));\n        }\n    }\n\n    // Append available tool list from registered tool_defs\n        system.push_str(\"\\n\\n## Available Tools\\n\");\n        for td in &state.tool_defs {\n            system.push_str(&format!(\"- {}: {}\\n\", td.function.name, td.function.description));\n        }\n        system.push_str(\"Use these tools by their exact name.\");\n    }\n\n    (system, anthropic_msgs, breakdown)\n}\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":13,"oldLines":12,"newStart":13,"newLines":23,"lines":[" ","     let known_files = std::collections::HashSet::new();","     let prompt = crate::config::system_prompt(&state.config.prompt_lang);","+","+    // Prepend tool definitions to system prompt (stable prefix for caching)","+    let mut prompt_with_tools = prompt;","+    if !state.tool_defs.is_empty() {","+        prompt_with_tools.push_str(\"\\n\\n## Available Tools\\n\");","+        for td in &state.tool_defs {","+            prompt_with_tools.push_str(&format!(\"- {}: {}\\n\", td.function.name, td.function.description));","+        }","+        prompt_with_tools.push_str(\"Use these tools by their exact name.\");","+    }","+","     let semantic_block = state.semantic_memory.render();","     let long_mem_block = state.long_mem.render();"," ","     let builder = context::ContextBuilder::new(","         &state.ctx,","-        &prompt,","+        &prompt_with_tools,","         &semantic_block,","         &long_mem_