{"parentUuid":"0b6bac86-892f-417c-884e-615d80f9d013","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"77a311b9-e069-4284-bd11-254f25f185eb","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"协议层不在意字段顺序。JSON 解析不依赖顺序。\n\n但 **缓存前缀** 在意。Rust serde 的输出顺序就是 struct 定义顺序：\n\n```rust\npub struct Message {\n    pub role,               // 1. role\n    pub content,            // 2. content\n    pub name,               // 3. name\n    pub tool_calls,         // 4. tool_calls\n    pub tool_call_id,       // 5. tool_call_id\n    pub reasoning_content,  // 6. reasoning_content\n    pub thinking_signature, // 7. thinking_signature\n}\n```\n\n每次序列化都这个顺序，跨请求一致。再加上 `skip_serializing_if = \"Option::is_none\"`，不存在的字段直接不出现。所以相同内容的消息跨请求的字节序列完全一致，缓存前缀不受影响。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":117,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":502528,"output_tokens":556,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"461ed9c9-b4c0-4688-b617-c230c9e493d7","timestamp":"2026-05-15T10:53:23.791Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
