{"parentUuid":"e04639b2-485a-40fb-96c2-2dbe1af03088","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"9fcf4bce-5628-4fae-9aab-705a5df52380","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"emmm,anthropicapi的要求和openai一样吗"},"uuid":"85ea03c8-9fb3-4cb9-b083-14c64c4eaad9","timestamp":"2026-05-15T10:55:05.151Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"85ea03c8-9fb3-4cb9-b083-14c64c4eaad9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"d04c1a6c-91d7-4402-9e4c-84ee64cee90d","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if Anthropic API's message format requirements are the same as OpenAI. Let me think about this.\n\nFor Anthropic API:\n- Messages array contains user and assistant messages\n- System prompt is a SEPARATE `system` parameter (NOT in messages array)\n- Tool results are NOT `role: \"tool\"` — instead, they're embedded as content blocks in a `role: \"user\"` message\n- Tool result content block: `{\"type\": \"tool_result\", \"tool_use_id\": \"...\", \"content\": \"...\"}`\n- Tool use is a content block: `{\"type\": \"tool_use\", \"id\": \"...\", \"name\": \"...\", \"input\": {...}}`\n\nFor OpenAI API:\n- Messages array contains system, user, assistant, tool messages\n- Tool results are `role: \"tool\"` with `tool_call_id`\n- Tool calls are on the assistant message as `tool_calls` field\n\nSo NO, they're NOT the same. The key differences:\n1. Anthropic: system is separate parameter. OpenAI: system is messages[0]\n2. Anthropic: tool results are content blocks in user messages. OpenAI: separate \"tool\" role messages\n3. Anthropic: tool use is a content block. OpenAI: tool_calls field on assistant message\n\nIn our current code:\n- The Message struct uses `role: \"tool\"` for tool results (OpenAI format)\n- The gateway/anthropic.rs converts these to Anthropic's tool_result content blocks\n- The gateway/openai.rs sends them as-is with `role: \"tool\"`\n\nBut earlier the user was asking about the internal Message struct format, not the API format. Let me clarify.\n\nActually, looking at the anthropic.rs gateway, it does NOT convert `role: \"tool\"` to Anthropic format. Let me check.","signature":"d04c1a6c-91d7-4402-9e4c-84ee64cee90d"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":281,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":502784,"output_tokens":727,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"6fec4c3c-9f3c-4965-8bd4-13e57c392752","timestamp":"2026-05-15T10:55:11.593Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"6fec4c3c-9f3c-4965-8bd4-13e57c392752","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"d04c1a6c-91d7-4402-9e4c-84ee64cee90d","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"不一样，差很多。\n\n**当前我们内部的 Message 结构是 OpenAI 格式**，Anthropic 网关转换时再映射：\n\n| 概念 | OpenAI（内部格式） | Anthropic |\n|------|-------------------|-----------|\n| 系统提示 | `messages[0]: {role:\"system\", content:\"...\"}` | 独立 `system` 字段 |\n| 文本回复 | `{role:\"assistant\", content:\"text\"}` | `{role:\"assistant\", content:[{type:\"text\", text:\"text\"}]}` |\n| 工具调用 | `{role:\"assistant\", tool_calls:[{id,function}]}` | `{role:\"assistant\", content:[{type:\"tool_use\", id, name, input}]}` |\n| 工具结果 | `{role:\"tool\", content:\"result\", tool_call_id:\"xxx\"}` | `{role:\"user\", content:[{type:\"tool_result\", tool_use_id:\"xxx\", content:\"result\"}]}` |\n| 思考链 | `reasoning_content` 字段 | `thinking` 内容块 |\n\nAnthropic 没有 `role:\"tool\"`——工具结果是**包在 user 消息里作为一个 content block**。所以内部统一用 OpenAI 格式后，anthropic.rs 网关在发送前得做格式转换。\n\n但之前我们把 HP 的消息转换拆到 gateway 里时，这部分转换逻辑是搬过去了。你遇到 Anthropic 端点的 400 错误可能就是这个映射没做对。要检查一下 `gateway/anthropic.rs` 里的转换逻辑？"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":281,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":502784,"output_tokens":727,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"13378671-a733-47b7-855f-a5bb56e04a07","timestamp":"2026-05-15T10:55:15.363Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
