{"parentUuid":"528776ab-af31-445a-b832-99ba15b37e80","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"3e86e422-177b-46b7-9cde-8cdabc96e28b","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is questioning why Anthropic's API is considered more professional for agents. They're right to be skeptical — let me think about what makes Anthropic's API design different and whether it's actually \"more professional\" or just different.\n\nThe key differences between Anthropic and OpenAI for agent/tool use:\n\n**OpenAI (our current format):**\n- Messages have `role: \"assistant\"` with `tool_calls` field\n- Tool results have `role: \"tool\"` with `tool_call_id` to match\n- Simple, flat structure\n\n**Anthropic:**\n- Messages have `content` as an **array of content blocks** (not a single string)\n- `tool_use` and `tool_result` are **content block types** within `content`\n- `tool_result` is wrapped inside a `role: \"user\"` message, not a separate role\n- Thinking is also a content block type\n\nAnthropic's design is more \"professional\" for agents because:\n\n1. **Content blocks** — A single assistant message can have text + tool_use + thinking all in one structured array. OpenAI requires separate tool_calls alongside content, which can be awkward.\n\n2. **Tool results as user messages** — By wrapping tool results in `role: \"user\"` messages, Anthropic maintains the conversation flow as a strict alternation between user and assistant. OpenAI's `role: \"tool\"` breaks this alternation.\n\n3. **Thinking/reasoning as content block** — Anthropic has thinking as a first-class content block type with budget_tokens control. OpenAI relies on the non-standard `reasoning_content` field.\n\n4. **Tool use/result adjacency guarantee** — Anthropic's API enforces that every `tool_use` content block must be followed by a matching `tool_result`, or it returns an error. This prevents the model from calling tools and never getting results (which can happen with OpenAI).\n\nBut in practice, for our use case (coding assistant with tool calling), the differences are marginal. OpenAI's format is simpler and gets the job done. The \"more professional\" claim is mostly about:\n\n- Anthropic designed their API specifically for agent loops from day one\n- OpenAI's format evolved from chat completions with function calling bolted on later\n- Anthropic's content block system is more extensible\n\nThe practical advantage of OpenAI/DeepSeek is:\n- Simpler format\n- Better model training for tool use (for DeepSeek at least)\n- Lower cost\n\nSo the user's skepticism is warranted — \"more professional\" is marketing, not engineering reality.","signature":"3e86e422-177b-46b7-9cde-8cdabc96e28b"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":383,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":503040,"output_tokens":819,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"4f4b5694-e58a-41e6-9a3e-116266ddd6fd","timestamp":"2026-05-15T10:56:19.820Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"4f4b5694-e58a-41e6-9a3e-116266ddd6fd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"3e86e422-177b-46b7-9cde-8cdabc96e28b","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"说实话，**看不出来**。anthropic 的 content blocks 设计在概念上更干净（一条消息可以混合 text + tool_use + thinking），但实际用起来：\n\n| | OpenAI | Anthropic |\n|---|---|---|\n| 复杂度 | 低 | 高（2次映射） |\n| 工具结果角色 | `role:\"tool\"` 直给 | 包在 `role:\"user\"` 里 |\n| 工具调用的格式 | 额外字段 `tool_calls` | 混在 `content` 数组里 |\n| 思考链 | 额外字段 `reasoning_content` | 也是 content block |\n| 实战训练 | DeepSeek 原生就是 OpenAI 格式 | DeepSeek 的 /anthropic 端点是兼容层 |\n\n\"更专业\"本质上是：\n- Anthropic 的 Messages API 从第一天就为 agent loop 设计\n- OpenAI 的 chat completions 是先有文本聊天，后来才把 function calling 贴上去的\n- Content block 可扩展性更好（未来加新类型不用改 role 系统）\n\n但对我们来说，**OpenAI 格式更简单、DeepSeek 模型训练更好、少一次格式转换。** 当前走 OpenAI 端点是对的，Anthropic 端点留着做备胎。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":383,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":503040,"output_tokens":819,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"7ab913da-671c-4729-9df2-640a5fd3d036","timestamp":"2026-05-15T10:56:23.595Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
