{"parentUuid":"91538f9d-04d6-446b-8981-596246691497","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"41603cb6-01fd-4219-a8f8-9e0c47a372c3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"哦，其实openai和anthropic转换我们可以不用自实现的。这个倒是忘记说了，因为我们最开始只做单一端点就没考虑"},"uuid":"b573263f-b6cc-491c-b0e5-70fd9b4330f3","timestamp":"2026-05-15T10:58:17.269Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"b573263f-b6cc-491c-b0e5-70fd9b4330f3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"469f1020-a1c8-4ed3-8836-873b81996e31","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is pointing out that we don't need to implement the Anthropic/OpenAI format conversion ourselves. There are existing libraries that handle this. \n\nFor Rust, the main options would be:\n1. `anthropic` crate - Anthropic SDK\n2. `async-openai` crate - OpenAI SDK with Rust\n3. But we'd need something that converts between formats or we could use one directly\n\nThe user is implying: instead of maintaining our own message format conversion in `dsx-gateway`, we should just use the official SDK/client libraries for each API. The gateway would just be a thin wrapper around the appropriate SDK.\n\nThis is a good point. The `dsx-gateway` crate's `anthropic.rs` and `openai.rs` contain custom SSE parsing code for each API's streaming format. This is reinventing the wheel. Official SDKs handle:\n- Request serialization in the correct format\n- SSE stream parsing\n- Tool call delta accumulation\n- Error handling\n- Retries\n\nIn Rust:\n- For OpenAI: `async-openai` crate or just use `reqwest` with proper types\n- For Anthropic: `anthropic` crate or use `reqwest` with their JSON format\n\nBut the current code already works and has all this logic. Rewriting to use SDKs would be a significant refactor with no immediate user-facing benefit. Let me just acknowledge the user's point and suggest it as a future cleanup.","signature":"469f1020-a1c8-4ed3-8836-873b81996e31"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":433,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":503296,"output_tokens":525,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"ee9abe4c-ed2e-4b9a-975b-53065dee04fa","timestamp":"2026-05-15T10:58:25.141Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"ee9abe4c-ed2e-4b9a-975b-53065dee04fa","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"469f1020-a1c8-4ed3-8836-873b81996e31","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"对，各家的 SDK 都帮你做好了 SSE 解析、content block 拼装、tool call delta 累积。我们 `dsx-gateway` 里那两套自定义 SSE 解析器属于**本可以不用写的重复工**。\n\nSDK 方案对比：\n\n| 方式 | 自己维护 | 用 SDK |\n|------|---------|--------|\n| SSE 解析 | 自己写 EventSource 循环 | SDK 内置 |\n| 消息格式转换 | 自己拼 JSON | 类型安全 API |\n| 错误处理 | 自己抓 status code | SDK 统一处理 |\n| 新功能适配 | 自己追 Changelog | SDK 更新 |\n| 依赖数 | 少（无额外 dep） | 多 1-2 个 crate |\n\n**现在换 SDK 值不值得？** 不急着换——当前的自定义实现已经跑通了，换成 SDK 需要对 gateway 做一次重写，不改变任何用户可见行为。建议标记为「v4.1 cleanup」，等稳定后再洗。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":433,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":503296,"output_tokens":525,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"d5f239ec-9b63-4126-86e3-0f222994cd81","timestamp":"2026-05-15T10:58:28.813Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
