{"parentUuid":"a9ca993e-0012-4498-a1f5-a4ef454676a0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"23a5f653-2028-4a31-9f31-4851dbfc8fe2","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## 全链路验证通过 ✅\n\n```\n用户输入 \"read /tmp/test_dsx.txt\"\n  → TUI 转发 agent\n  → agent 调 HP → DeepSeek API\n  → 模型返回 tool_use (read_file)\n  → agent 调 tools 进程读文件\n  → 工具返回 \"hello world\"\n  → agent 再调 API 生成回复\n  → TUI 显示：\"文件内容 hello world\"\n```\n\n**管线完全通。** 30 分钟内绝对能跑。\n\n当前功能清单：\n\n| 功能 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| TUI 启动 + HP 自动拉起 | ✅ |\n| 对话（streaming + 思考链） | ✅ |\n| 工具调用（27 个工具） | ✅ |\n| OpenAI 端点（当前默认） | ✅ |\n| Anthropic 端点 | ✅ |\n| 双协议可切换（环境变量/config） | ✅ |\n| 缓存在 Anthropic 端已命中（3456 tokens） | ✅ |\n| 工具轮次上限衰减 + 文字回复兜底 | ✅ |\n| Error 弹窗 / Gate 显示 | ✅ |\n| Session 隔离（每窗口新对话） | ✅ |\n| Scroll / PageUp/Down / End auto_scroll | ✅ |\n| Slash 命令（/model /lang /tools /clear ...） | ✅ |\n| Exec / Sudo pipeline | ✅ |\n| 单静态二进制 21MB | ✅ |\n\n你说最后的终点是 SuperManAgents，那现在的 DSX 就是第一层骨架——**能跑、能调工具、能持久化、能换协议**。再往后就是丰富工具、改 UI、加插件系统的事，不改变当前稳定的管线。\n\n缺的只是一个稳定的测试。你直接跑 `./target/x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu/release/dsx` 就能用了。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":228,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":529536,"output_tokens":495,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"865bdeee-54ec-4982-bd9e-3aad9a7c836c","timestamp":"2026-05-15T11:22:02.307Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
