{"parentUuid":"87ff7699-9fe8-45d5-af13-2c835add3c9a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"5d17b252-a375-4ac1-bcf5-260bb23462b9","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**21MB 静态二进制就绪。** \n\n## 接入本地模型\n\n本地跑个 Ollama 或 LM Studio 就行，然后改配置：\n\n```bash\n# 1. 本地启动 Ollama（如果还没跑）\nollama serve &\n\n# 2. 拉个模型（Ollama 支持的都行）\nollama pull deepseek-r1:7b\n\n# 3. 改 DSX 配置\n# 编辑 ~/.dsx/config.json:\n```\n\n```json\n{\n  \"base_url\": \"http://localhost:11434/v1\",\n  \"api_key\": \"ollama\",\n  \"model\": \"deepseek-r1:7b\",\n  \"protocol\": \"openai\"\n}\n```\n\n或直接用环境变量覆盖：\n\n```bash\nDEEPSEEK_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1 \\\nDEEPSEEK_API_KEY=ollama \\\nDEEPSEEK_MODEL=\"deepseek-r1:7b\" \\\n./target/x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu/release/dsx\n```\n\n网关已经正确处理本地端点——`http://localhost:11434/v1` 会被拼成 `http://localhost:11434/v1/chat/completions`，原生 OpenAI 格式，工具调用照常工作。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":404,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":559872,"output_tokens":494,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"73a7c97f-05e1-4f08-8864-6e496bd1bab1","timestamp":"2026-05-15T11:46:58.897Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
