nt::ContentDelta/ReasoningDelta/ToolCallProgress/Done → writes content_delta/tool_progress/api_response frames to TCP\n   - **Context caching**: Tool definitions moved to prompt head (before card text) for stable cache prefix in DeepSeek/Anthropic\n   - **Config priority**: ~/.dsx/config.json > ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN env var > code defaults\n   - **Tool filtering**: 27 registered tools filtered to 10 essential ones for local model 12K context\n   - **Auto-mode**: agent.tool_defs filtering + ToolConfirmReq auto-accept when agent.auto_mode is true\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n\n   - **`crates/dsx-proto/src/lib.rs`** (KEY: shared IPC protocol)\n     - Created from empty stub to full protocol with all 6 frame enums\n     ```rust\n     pub enum TuiToAgent { UserInput { text }, ToolCall { ... }, Shutdown }\n     pub enum AgentToTui { ContentDelta { delta, reasoning }, ToolProgress { ... }, ApiResponse { content, tool_calls, ... }, Echo { data }, Done, Error { message }, ShutdownAck }\n     pub enum AgentToTools { Init { ... }, CallReq { ... }, Cancel { ... }, ConfirmResp { ... }, Shutdown }\n     pub enum ToolsToAgent { Ready { tools }, Progress { ... }, Result { ... }, ToolResultMessage { ... }, ToolError { ... }, ToolConfirmReq { ... } }\n     pub enum AgentToHp { Register { ... }, Heartbeat { ... }, Unregister { ... }, Judge, Query, List, ApiChat { model, system, messages, tools, ... } }\n     pub enum HpToAgent { Ok { ... }, Error { ... }, Verdicts { ... }, Health { ... }, ProcessList { ... }, ContentDelta { delta, reasoning }, ToolProgress { ... }, ApiResponse { content, tool_calls, reasoning_content, thinking_signature, usage } }\n     ```\n\n   - **`crates/dsx-agent/src/runner.rs`** (KEY: full orchestration pipeline)\n     - Grew from 355 lines to ~900+ lines with full module wiring\n     - Agent-rewire wired ALL 39 modules (session, memory, orchestrator, context, skills, router, tokenizer, health)\n     - Then was FURTHER modified to fix multiple bugs:\n       - `connect_hp()` changed from `try_clone()` to single TcpStream\n       - Tools filtered from 27 to 10 for local models\n       - ToolConfirmReq handler added with auto-accept in auto_mode\n     ```rust\n     fn connect_hp() -> Option<TcpStream> { ... }\n     fn handle_user_input(agent: &mut AgentState, text: &str, hp: &mut TcpStream, tools_reader: &mut impl BufRead, tools_writer: &mut impl Write, tui_writer: &mut impl Write, tui_reader: &mut impl BufRead) { ... }\n     fn parse_xml_tool_calls(content: &str) -> (String, Vec<ToolCall>) { ... }\n     fn parse_tool_calls(tcs: &serde_json::Value) -> Vec<ToolCall> { ... }\n     ```\n\n   - **`crates/dsx-hp/src/runner.rs`** (KEY: HP → thin pass-through)\n     - Refactored from handling API calls directly to routing through dsx-gateway\n     - `handle_api_chat_streaming()` now just parses JSON, extracts fields, calls gateway\n     - `json_response()` fixed from format! to serde_json::json! (was producing invalid JSON)\n     - Config priority: file first, env vars as fallback\n     ```rust\n     fn handle_api_chat_streaming(line: &str, writer: &mut impl Write) {\n         // Extract model, system, messages, tools from JSON\n         // Protocol-route to dsx_gateway::chat_stream or chat_stream_openai\n         // Write stream events back as content_delta/tool_progress/api_response frames\n     }\n     fn json_response(status: &str, message: &str) -> String {\n         serde_json::json!({\"type\": status, \"message\": message}).to_string()\n     }\n     ```\n\n   - **`crates/dsx-gateway/src/anthropic.rs`** (KEY: Anthropic API conversion)\n     - Moved from HP's client.rs\n     - Modified to accept raw `Vec<serde_json::Value>` messages, convert internally\n     - Added handling for `role: \"tool\"` (was only handling `role: \"tool_result\"`)\n     - Added thinking_signature → Thinking content block conversion\n     - Fixed tool_calls name extraction (flat format fallback)\n     - Fixed: `content = m.get(\"content\")?` → `m.get(\