tually sent (with serde_json escaping)\n       - Periodic /snapshot timer REMOVED (was sending junk to model)\n\n   - **`crates/dsx-tools/src/lib.rs`** (tool execution)\n     - `handle_req` function: added name-only fallback when exact (name, action) key not found\n     - `apply_init`: empty allowed_tools → None (allow all), not Some(vec![]) (allow nothing)\n\n   - **`crates/dsx/src/main.rs`** (umbrella binary)\n     - Added `init` as alias for `config`\n     - `run_config()` rewritten as interactive 5-step wizard:\n       1. API type (OpenAI/Anthropic)\n       2. Endpoint URL\n       3. API key\n       4. Model name with presets\n       5. Context limit\n\n   - **`~/Desktop/dsx/config.example.json`** (prompt template for user customization)\n     - Created as reference for prompt.json format\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - **`handle_user_input` interface mismatch**: agent-rewire changed signature from `frame: &str` to `text: &str` but downstream callers still passing raw JSON → fixed by updating callers\n   - **`try_clone()` TCP connection drops**: `TcpStream::try_clone()` + `BufReader` created fd management issues → switched to single TcpStream for read+write\n   - **System messages not filtered in messages array**: OpenAI/DeepSeek accept `system` only via `system` field, not in `messages` → added `m.role != \"system\"` filter\n   - **`json_response()` invalid JSON**: `format!()` doesn't escape quote characters in message → changed to `serde_json::json!()`\n   - **`reasoning_content` missing from OpenAIMessage**: DeepSeek thinking mode requires round-trip of reasoning → added field to struct\n   - **Tool `handle_req` name lookup fails**: `handle_req` had no name-only fallback (unlike `execute`) → added HashMap iteration fallback\n   - **Anthropic gateway drops assistant messages**: `content = m.get(\"content\")?` → `None` when field absent → changed to `unwrap_or(&Null)`\n   - **Anthropic tool_use name using wrong field**: extracted from flat format but model return