{"parentUuid":"8c032386-819e-4ecb-9991-36591a284137","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"e1e06a78-43ce-4a21-bbaa-f7621a4dbd90","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"是的，本质一样长。Anthropic 也是每次请求带全量数据，只是字段名短一点：\n\n**OpenAI 格式：**\n```json\n{\n  \"model\": \"...\",\n  \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": \"...\"}, ...],\n  \"tools\": [{\"type\": \"function\", \"function\": {\"name\": \"...\", \"description\": \"...\", \"parameters\": {...}}}]\n}\n```\n\n**Anthropic 格式：**\n```json\n{\n  \"model\": \"...\",\n  \"system\": \"...\",\n  \"messages\": [...],\n  \"tools\": [{\"name\": \"...\", \"description\": \"...\", \"input_schema\": {...}}]\n}\n```\n\n字段名短些，但信息量一样——该传的 system prompt、工具 schema、历史消息，一分不少。\n\n唯一的区别是 Anthropic 的 tools 格式少一层 `{type, function}` 包装，schema 字段名叫 `input_schema` 而不是 `parameters`。总体体积差不了多少。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":165,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":37760,"output_tokens":338,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"25b6348e-2630-49f1-a369-688d34d668b2","timestamp":"2026-05-15T12:10:27.867Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
