{"parentUuid":"b609970a-dee5-44ef-a1cf-611394220992","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"53bff42b-2faf-4af5-8205-23527715e185","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is observing that their local model (qwen/qwen3.5-9b via LM Studio at http://127.0.0.1:1234/v1) seems slow. They're wondering if it's because the model doesn't do reasoning/thinking chains, or what else might be causing it.\n\nLet me think about what could affect local inference speed:\n\n1. **Model loading** - If using CPU vs GPU, quantization level\n2. **Context length** - 12K context with large system prompt + tools means more tokens to process per request\n3. **Streaming overhead** - Token-by-token streaming through the pipeline (HP→Agent→TUI) adds latency\n4. **LM Studio settings** - Backend settings, GPU offloading, thread count\n5. **The model itself** - Qwen 3.5 9B is a ~9B parameter model, which isn't tiny\n\nBut the user is saying \"不如在lmstudio跑得快\" - it's slower than running directly in LM Studio. That's interesting - if they're running the same model in LM Studio directly vs through DSX, the difference would be in:\n\n1. **DSX pipeline overhead** - The HP receives stream events, serializes to JSON, sends over TCP, Agent deserializes, sends to TUI over TCP, TUI renders - that's latency per token\n2. **Streaming implementation** - If the streaming isn't properly flushed at each step\n3. **Tool filtering / processing** - Each token goes through multiple match statements\n\nActually wait - the real culprit is likely that DSX's pipeline adds latency between each token. In LM Studio directly, the UI gets tokens as they come from the backend with minimal processing. In DSX:\n- LM Studio → HP (TCP JSON-LP) → deserialize → match event type → serialize frame → write to TCP\n- HP → Agent (TCP) → read line → deserialize → match → write to TUI TCP\n- Agent → TUI (TCP) → read line → deserialize → match → render\n\nThis is a LOT of per-token overhead. For a local model generating tokens at maybe 20-30 tokens/sec, each token passing through 3 TCP hops with JSON serialization/deserialization at each hop adds visible latency.\n\nI should explain the bottleneck clearly and suggest ways to optimize.","signature":"53bff42b-2faf-4af5-8205-23527715e185"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":281,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":37888,"output_tokens":828,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"cd29ca1d-229d-4d74-91a3-6e4d2a254370","timestamp":"2026-05-15T12:11:45.488Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"cd29ca1d-229d-4d74-91a3-6e4d2a254370","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"53bff42b-2faf-4af5-8205-23527715e185","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"不是模型的问题。瓶颈在**DSX 的 5 进程管道**：\n\n```\nLM Studio ──TCP──► HP ──TCP──► Agent ──TCP──► TUI\n                     ↑                         ↑\n               JSON 序列化/反序列化        渲染+滚动\n                 每个 token 都要做           也要时间\n```\n\n每个 token 要经过：\n1. LM Studio → HP：HTTP chunk → StreamEvent 转换\n2. HP → Agent：StreamEvent → JSON-LP 序列化 → TCP 写入\n3. Agent → TUI：JSON-LP → 匹配 → 再序列化 → TCP 写入\n4. TUI：JSON 解析 → 渲染到终端\n\n直接 LM Studio 里跑就一步：HTTP chunk → 渲染。\n\n本地模型生成本身慢（~20-30 tok/s），再串上三层处理，**每个 token 的延迟累加**，体感就更慢了。\n\n几个优化方向（按见效速度排序）：\n\n1. **TUI/Agent 直连 LM Studio**（跳过 HP 中转）— 最快，但牺牲统一网关\n2. **HP 合并到 Agent** — 本地模式时不需要独立 HP 进程\n3. **unix socket 代替 TCP** — 减少内核开销（localhost 本身不重但仍有上下文切换）\n4. **流式零拷贝** — HP 收到 HTTP chunk 直接写入 Agent TCP，不经过 match\n\n要不要试方案 1 或 2？本地模式走捷径，远端 API 模式走完整管道。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":281,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":37888,"output_tokens":828,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"ad984fe5-6262-4527-87ad-56f5bc717eb7","timestamp":"2026-05-15T12:11:49.980Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
