{"parentUuid":"52620e98-25f0-43e5-a894-57c1efd528cf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"6aa10625-db42-4b06-9773-674b76ad9fff","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user has 10GB VRAM + 32GB RAM and is running Qwen 3.5-9B via Vulkan. 14 tok/s does seem slow for this setup. Let me think about why.\n\nQwen 3.5-9B should typically run at 30-50 tok/s on a 10GB VRAM GPU with proper acceleration. The Vulkan backend through llama.cpp is notoriously slower than CUDA or even ROCm.\n\nBut actually, the bigger problem is likely the **context size**. The user has `context_limit: 12000` in config, and the system prompt + 10 tool definitions take up a lot of space. But more importantly, the model generated **4095 tokens** of thinking before being truncated.\n\nLet me look at the server log again:\n```\nprompt eval time = 2441.42 ms / 49 tokens (49.82 ms per token, 20.07 tokens per second)\neval time = 139.80 ms / 2 tokens (69.90 ms per token, 14.31 tokens per second)\ntotal time = 2581.22 ms / 51 tokens\nn_tokens = 4095, truncated = 1\n```\n\nWait, that log shows 49 tokens prompt eval and 2 tokens eval - that's just the initial response. Then it generated 4095 tokens total (truncated). The 14 tok/s was measured over just 2 tokens, which might be a cold-start measurement. The actual sustained rate might be different.\n\nBut the real issue the user is pointing out is: 10GB VRAM + 32GB RAM should be enough to run a 9B model at decent speed. Let me think about what could be wrong:\n\n1. **Vulkan backend** - It's slower than CUDA, but shouldn't be this slow\n2. **Model partially offloaded** - If not all layers fit in VRAM, some run on CPU (dramatic slowdown)\n3. **LLaMA.cpp configuration** - Batch size, threads, GPU layers settings\n4. **The 5-process pipeline overhead** - But this is minimal (~1-2ms per token)\n\nActually, I think the user's real problem might just be that:\n1. They typed \"1\" and the model went into a 4000+ token reasoning chain\n2. The first few tokens are slow due to prompt processing\n3. Then the sustained generation is slow because... hmm\n\nLet me not overthink this. The user is asking why it's slow with their hardware. Let me give practical advice.\n\nActually, I wonder if the user is even running the model through llama.cpp/LM Studio properly. Let me think about what they might be doing wrong.\n\nBut honestly, I think the user might just be venting and the real answer is: Qwen 3.5-9B just isn't fast on Vulkan. CUDA would be 2-3x faster. Or they could try a smaller model.\n\nAlso, I notice the first measurement was 14 tok/s but measured over only 2 tokens - that's a very small sample. The model was just warming up. Sustained speed might be different.\n\nLet me give a practical, honest answer.","signature":"6aa10625-db42-4b06-9773-674b76ad9fff"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":345,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":50432,"output_tokens":963,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"7e2761ea-7dec-4601-97d9-12a395fc2816","timestamp":"2026-05-15T12:17:13.412Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"7e2761ea-7dec-4601-97d9-12a395fc2816","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"6aa10625-db42-4b06-9773-674b76ad9fff","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"你说得对，这配置跑 9B 不应该只 14 tok/s。问题可能出在几个地方：\n\n1. **Vulkan 后端性能损失** — 比 CUDA 慢 30-50%，但也不至于这么低\n2. **模型没完全 offload 到 GPU** — llama.cpp 默认可能只放部分层到显存，剩下的跑在 CPU 上，会暴跌到 2-5 tok/s\n3. **4095 token 截断** — 模型花了大部分时间在**生成思考链**上，14 tok/s 只是初始几 token 的冷启动测量，实际跑满后可能更稳定\n\n你可以检查 LM Studio 里的这几个设置：\n\n- **GPU Offload** — 确认是全部层 (100%) 都 offload 到 GPU，不是 partial\n- **Batch size** — 设 512 或更高，充分利用并行\n- **Threads** — 设成你 CPU 物理核心数（不是逻辑线程）\n\n另外 Qwen 3.5-9B 本身在 Vulkan 上 benchmark 也就 ~25-35 tok/s，加上思考链动辄几千 token，体感慢正常。\n\n或者直接试 `deepseek-coder-6.7b-instruct`——比 Qwen 小但 coding 不差，速度能翻倍。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":345,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":50432,"output_tokens":963,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"f701e7cc-ee6f-4a85-a7f1-7c51f948335b","timestamp":"2026-05-15T12:17:17.371Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
