{"parentUuid":"ad8c56f6-dc59-48cd-8601-d27400e48baf","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"1db24ca2-e104-4539-87df-558ecb8f79e3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"所有 GPU 目前均被禁用。请启用至少一个以进行卸载。。 这怎么开不了啊"},"uuid":"faa93f7a-4fa3-4f02-86d4-85b184858f42","timestamp":"2026-05-15T12:19:47.554Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"faa93f7a-4fa3-4f02-86d4-85b184858f42","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"f8f417ae-682a-41cf-909b-4d92732a8755","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying that LM Studio is showing \"All GPUs are currently disabled. Enable at least one for offloading.\" This is an LM Studio / backend configuration issue, not a DSX code issue. \n\nThis likely means the Vulkan/GPU support in LM Studio's llama.cpp backend isn't detecting their GPU properly. This could be because:\n1. LM Studio needs to be configured to use Vulkan\n2. The GPU drivers might not be properly installed for Vulkan\n3. The llama.cpp backend being used by LM Studio doesn't have Vulkan support compiled in\n\nLet me think about what I can actually help with here. This is an LM Studio configuration issue, not something in DSX code. But I can suggest diagnostic steps.\n\nActually wait - the user said earlier they configured LM Studio to serve qwen3.5-9b. But now they're finding that GPU is disabled. That would explain the 2.5 tok/s - it's running entirely on CPU.\n\nThe prompt processing (prefill) on CPU for 5000+ tokens would take forever, and then generation would also be CPU-bound.\n\nI can help them check:\n1. Does LM Studio show Vulkan as available?\n2. Is the model loaded with GPU offloading enabled?\n3. Maybe try a different backend option in LM Studio\n\nSince this is a tool issue (LM Studio), let me just give them the diagnostic steps rather than trying to dig into code.","signature":"f8f417ae-682a-41cf-909b-4d92732a8755"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":343,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":51072,"output_tokens":525,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"32f8fbf3-1494-4eca-ad71-de676b83efa2","timestamp":"2026-05-15T12:19:52.349Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
{"parentUuid":"32f8fbf3-1494-4eca-ad71-de676b83efa2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"f8f417ae-682a-41cf-909b-4d92732a8755","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**难怪只有 2.5 tok/s** — 模型全程跑在 CPU 上。10G 显存完全没用上。\n\n这是 LM Studio 设置问题，不是代码问题。排查一下：\n\n1. **LM Studio → Settings → Engine** — 确认 backend 选了 \"Vulkan\" 或 \"Auto\"，不是 \"CPU\"\n2. **点模型加载时** — 在模型右侧的选项里，确认 **GPU Offload** 是 100%（滑块拉到最右），不是 0\n3. **或者卸载模型 → 重新加载** — 加载时有弹出选项，选 Vulkan device\n\n如果 LM Studio 确实检测不到 GPU，可能是：\n\n- **Vulkan 驱动没装** → 终端跑 `vulkaninfo` 看有没有输出\n- **LM Studio 版本问题** — 试试更新到最新或切换到 `llama.cpp` 后端\n\n最粗暴的验证：建个新模型加载配置，**GPU Offload = 100%**，右下角点 \"Load\"。如果还是 CPU only 就是驱动问题。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":343,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":51072,"output_tokens":525,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"535c4fed-59db-4575-ada8-3c3ac7e68dd5","timestamp":"2026-05-15T12:19:56.005Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
