{"parentUuid":"1a0562a3-a6fa-451f-abb6-0cb2573abb84","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"90588260-44a9-49c7-84e0-dbdeb34265c5","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_00_h00VhtsTyDp5Bbpmquq42604","type":"tool_result","content":"## No, the RX 6600 and RX 6750 GRE are **not officially supported**.\n\nBased on the documentation, the only **RDNA 2** GPUs listed as supported are the **professional** cards:\n\n- **Radeon PRO W6800** (gfx1030)\n- **Radeon PRO V620** (gfx1030)\n\nNo **consumer** RDNA 2 cards (Navi 21/22/23) appear anywhere in the supported tables. The document states: \"If a GPU is not listed on this table, it's not officially supported by AMD.\"\n\n### What *is* supported in the Radeon consumer line?\n\nOnly **RDNA 3** and **RDNA 4** cards are listed:\n\n| RDNA 3 (supported) | RDNA 4 (supported) |\n|---|---|\n| RX 7900 XTX / XT / GRE | RX 9070 XT / GRE / 9070 |\n| RX 7800 XT | RX 9060 XT LP / XT / 9060 |\n| RX 7700 XT / 7700 | |\n\n### What about community support?\n\nThe docs note that unlisted GPUs \"might be community-enabled through TheRock nightly builds.\" Your RX 6600 or RX 6750 GRE could potentially work via that path, but it carries no official support guarantee and prebuilt ROCm libraries \"will cause runtime errors\" on unsupported hardware."}]},"uuid":"2fa4ed1b-020a-4dfd-8ac0-9ac89c506f6e","timestamp":"2026-05-15T12:25:48.629Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":15122,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"## No, the RX 6600 and RX 6750 GRE are **not officially supported**.\n\nBased on the documentation, the only **RDNA 2** GPUs listed as supported are the **professional** cards:\n\n- **Radeon PRO W6800** (gfx1030)\n- **Radeon PRO V620** (gfx1030)\n\nNo **consumer** RDNA 2 cards (Navi 21/22/23) appear anywhere in the supported tables. The document states: \"If a GPU is not listed on this table, it's not officially supported by AMD.\"\n\n### What *is* supported in the Radeon consumer line?\n\nOnly **RDNA 3** and **RDNA 4** cards are listed:\n\n| RDNA 3 (supported) | RDNA 4 (supported) |\n|---|---|\n| RX 7900 XTX / XT / GRE | RX 9070 XT / GRE / 9070 |\n| RX 7800 XT | RX 9060 XT LP / XT / 9060 |\n| RX 7700 XT / 7700 | |\n\n### What about community support?\n\nThe docs note that unlisted GPUs \"might be community-enabled through TheRock nightly builds.\" Your RX 6600 or RX 6750 GRE could potentially work via that path, but it carries no official support guarantee and prebuilt ROCm libraries \"will cause runtime errors\" on unsupported hardware.","durationMs":10180,"url":"https://rocm.docs.amd.com/en/latest/release/gpu_os_support.html"},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1a0562a3-a6fa-451f-abb6-0cb2573abb84","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/qaqtamsy/Desktop/dsx","sessionId":"40da231b-9053-442b-b857-d081c20c78fb","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"master","slug":"gentle-orbiting-karp"}
